<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">Bɛkwyel</book>
  <para style="h">Mɛsa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mɛkana mɛ Mɛsa mɛ Bot ɛ Lwoma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mɛsa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mɛs</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mɛkana mɛ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mɛsa mɛ</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bot ɛ Lwoma</para>
  <para style="imt">Ɛniel</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana mɛ mɛsa mɛ bot ɛ lwoma ye bhɔɔba ɛ́ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Luk nakwyal ɛ. Nyɛ kaada ɛ́ dáa bot ɛ lwoma, bot ɛ Yezu nalwom ɔ, nagoola bhaadal'ɛ. Bɛ nakan ɛgoola yɛ ɛ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm, bhii tak pɛ kɔ epes e mɛdhik mɛ nadi mbaka-mbaka nɛ tin ɛ, bhii tak pɛ kɔ mɛdhik mɛ di é ngwoob nɛ ngwoob boo dii mɛsɔn mɛ Mediteelane ɛ. Deenek, bɛ naasa <char style="bd">lwomel</char> Yezu nalwom náá, bɛ sa ɛ́ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 24:47-48">Luk 24.47-48</ref></char>, bot ɛ lwoma <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">1.8</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">É mɛkɛn mɛ mɛkana mɛ bot ɛ lwoma, Yezu eebyet tɔ gwoo pɛ daa Zɛɛb (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:9">1.9</ref></char>). Nenak nyɛ tokapɛ é di wat bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ dáa nyɛ nadidi sok ɛ, é di'enek, nyɛ eedhis bɛdjekel bɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ, nadus pɛ daa Zɛɛb ɛ (ɛlaŋel ɛ ebá <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 2">2</ref></char>). Sisim tak ɛ́ di edjɛ bɛ ghwyil ɛkɛgoola embɛɛ esa ee Zɛɛb sa ɛ. Mɛkɛn nɛ mɛsik mɛ mɛkana mɛ bot ɛ lwoma, Sisim na Dɛɛ ɛpedul bɛdhiiti bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ pɛ daa Yezu.</para>
  <para style="io1">Kɛkum pɛ ɛlaŋel ɛ kam nɛ ebá (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 12">12</ref></char>), <char style="bd">mot-lwoma Pyɛɛd</char> di mot ghoŋ tɔ etɛp ee di kaadaa tɔ mɛkana mɛ bot ɛ lwoma ɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bɛdjekel ɛ Yezu ɛ́ eYuda, bɛ ɛ́ kuku ɛtɔ́ pɛ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa Yeluzalɛm, tin, bɛ nadi elii kɔ ɛsu ɛ lyoel yɔɔ. Deenek, tyee wat nɛ Yezu, bɛ nabɛ ààdi egwakel nɛ bɛghaa-Zɛɛb (ɛlaŋel ɛ elɛl kɛkum yii etɛn nɛ elɛl <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 3-8">3–8</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Bot ɛ zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, bɛ eezɛtɔ́ kɔ mɛl mɛ kyee dik Yude djas, pɛ Samaali nɛ pɛ mɛdhik mɛ sis. Bɛ nadi egoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal pɛ daa bot ɛ membyak mɛ sis (ɛlaŋel ɛ etɛn nɛ elɛl kɛkum ɛlaŋel ɛ kam nɛ ebá <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 8-12">8–12</ref></char>). Yenek ɛ́ dhiiti sa na bes. É ghɛŋ tak, eYuda bɔɔ bɛmet ɛ́ nazodi egu Zɛɛb ngɔt tak. Bɛ nadi egek náá, bot ɛ bɛdhiiti bɛzɛɛb ɛ sis tok nɛ ghwyil ɛgu nyɛ. Tinaak, Yezu Klisto ɛpesa náá, bot djas needi nɛ ɛgwakel nɛ Zɛɛb. Ezɛɛga ekeletyɛ, nɛghu ezɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala ɛpebyel. Ye ɛpebilel, ɛbilel nɛ ɛbilel. Bot ɛ di tɔ tak ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda nɛ bot ɛ membyak mɛ sis.</para>
  <para style="io1">Kana pɛ pak ɛlaŋel ɛ kam nɛ elɛl (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13">13</ref></char>), <char style="bd">mot-lwoma Pɔl</char> ɛ́ kazɛdu bhis ɛ Pyɛɛd tɔ Ekwyala yii mɛkana mɛ bot ɛ lwoma. Yezu Klisto ɛ́ nadjóo Pɔl (ɛlaŋel yii etɛn nɛ ená <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 9">9</ref></char>). Bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala Antiɔs pɛ kyee dik Siili zokazɛsɛ́ɛ nyɛ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ nakwaadi egyee nɛ nɛ ɔ, étɛp bɛ neekɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Yezu Klisto ɛtsetaɛpe pɛ mɛdhik mɛ sis. É ɛkɛn é ɛlaŋel ɛ kam nɛ elɛl, kɛkum ɛlaŋel ɛ mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ etɛn nɛ elɛl (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13-28">13–28</ref></char>), ye liial ɛ́ mɛdjoŋ mɛ lwomel'ɛ. Ye kaada ɛ́ dáa Mbɛɛ Bhaadal eezedjala mbaka-mbaka nɛ Mediteelane kɛkum pɛ ghaada Lɔm nadi ɛ́ boo ghaada ekukuma kyee dik tak.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Yezu Klisto Luk nakwyal ɛ, ɛpelii ɛ́ etɛp dum nɛ é ghɛŋ Yezu nadi kɔ bɔs ɛ. Tɔ mɛkana mɛ mɛsa mɛ bot ɛ lwoma, yɛ ɛ́ ɛkɛn ɛ<char style="bd">ɛwala ɛ zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala</char>. Yɛ ɛ́ ɛwala ɛ ekeletyɛ, bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, di egoola mɛlu djas nɛ é edi djas Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Yezu Klisto. Bɛ goola yɛ ɛ́ pɛ daa bot ɛ membyak djas, nɛ pɛ daa bot ɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala mɛ bɛzɛɛb ɛ sis djas, pɛ daa bɔɔ dhyeeb, nɛ pɛ daa eboo bot, pɛ daa bɛkum ɛ bot nɛ pɛ daa bɛdjel.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s">Yezu eekɛk bot ɛ lwoma Sisim na Dɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Sɔ'am Teofil, tɔ mɛkana mam yii ɛsok, mɛ naakaada etɛp e Yezu nasa ɛ, nɛ mɛlyo mɛ nyɛ nalyo é mɛkɛn ɛ, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />kɛkum dwoo Zɛɛb nasa náá, nyɛ byet tɔ́ tɔ gwoo ɛ. Ɛsok nɛ nyɛ nɛ byet tɔ́ tɔ gwoo, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nyɛ eelik bot ɛ lwoma mɛlyo nɛ ghwyil Sisim na Dɛɛ. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Etɛɛ náá, bhii mezuk mɛ nyɛ nazuk gwyɛ ɛ, nyɛ nadidi elelyaal bɛ nyel, étɛp bɛ neemyaal náá, nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ tsik. Mɛlu mɛkam-mɛná, nyɛ nadi elelyaal bɛ nyel, nyɛ nadi elii nɛ nɔɔ kɔ ɛsu ɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Dhiiti dwoo, nyɛ nadi edɛ edee lɔɔg wat bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Sa mot ààtseta nɛ ghaada Yeluzalɛm. Bwoodka sa Saagam nakɛk ɛ, sa mɛ nalɛɛ bin ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Etɛɛ náá, Zaŋ Nduuel-bot naduu bot Zɛɛb ɛ́ tɔ mɛdii, yɛ kabɛ biyɔ ɔɔ, tɔ mɛlu mɛ di ezyɛ yenek, bi aaduwa Zɛɛb ɛ́ tɔ ghwyil Sisim na Dɛɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezu eebyet pɛ tɔ gwoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Deenek, bot ɛ nasɛɛga é di wat bɛ nɛ Yezu ɔ boozɛdji nyɛ náá: «Ghɛŋ, yɛ ɛ́ é ɛwala ɛlak ɛ wɔ aagomal ɛyoŋ ɛ Yisalaɛl é?» <verse eid="ACT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Yezu eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Dum nɛ tɛp ɛwala, nɛ dwoo lenek, yɛ ààgwyák biyɔ, etɛɛ náá, Saagam naazekoobal yenek nɛ ghwyil'ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ ɔɔ, bi ɛ́ waabela boo ghwyil é sok Sisim na Dɛɛ aasul kɔ len ɛ, bi aadi ɛ́ bɛtyaasɛs bam pɛ Yeluzalɛm, pɛ kyee dik Yude nɛ Samaali kɛkum pɛ mɛsik mɛ bɔs.» <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Bhii Yezu nake deenek ɛ́, nyɛ eezɛbyet tɔ́ tɔ gwoo, bɔɔ djas ebee, wɔ gwaa, eguud zokazɛdipal nyɛ é mis mɔɔ. <figure style="fig" alt="Jésus monte au ciel aux yeux de ses disciples" file="45_Acts1.9_Ascension.tif" size="col" loc="1.9" copy="Gordon Thompson" ref="1.9">Yezu eebyet tɔ́ pɛ tɔ gwoo é mis mɛ bɛdjekel bɛ</figure><verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Dáa bɛ nadi egwyák tɔ́ gwoo é sok Yezu nadi ebyet ɛ, é di tak, bot ɛbá nɛ ekaad e na puu eezɛtuula bɛ, <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />bɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bot ɛ Ghalile, étɛp yé bi di egwyɛ é gwyák tɔ gwoo? Yezu yenɔk, mot Zɛɛb zedis nyɛ pak'en, nyɛ tɔ́ tɔ gwoo ɔ, nyɛ aabaazobula ɛ́ dhatyee bi bee nyɛ é byet yenek.»<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mot nadjila Yudas ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Dáa bɛ nadus pɛ ɛtsok ɛ pyeeb oliv ɛ, bot ɛ lwoma eezɛsik pɛ Yeluzalɛm. Ɛtsok ɛ́ tak natseta nɛ ghaada ɛ, tyee pes ɛwala wat e kyeed mɛko. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Dáa bɛ nakum pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ, bɛ eezɛni tɔ dhiiti dhɛŋ nadi pɛ ɛko ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ di bɛ nadi ezezyɛ nɛ ɛsɛɛga sok ɔ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ Pyɛɛd, Zaŋ, Zak, Andele, Filip nɛ Toma, zɛnɔɔ Bhaatelemi, nɛ Matye, Zak mɔn ɛ Alfe, Simɔŋ mot di tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi edjóoaa eZɛlɔt ɔ, zɛnɔɔ Zuud, mɔn ɛ Zak. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Bɔɔ djas, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛfulu mɛ ɛsesɛɛga é zɛɛga mendjaala bɛ nɛ boa, nɛ Maali nyɛɛg ɛ Yezu, zɛnɔɔ bɔn-nyɛɛg ɛ Yezu esok nɛ esok.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Dwoo wat, wɔ gwaa, bot ɛ nadi edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ zokazɛsɛɛga é di wat, mɛtaŋ mɛ bot ɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́ tyee bot dhet nɛ mɛkam-mɛmbá (120). Wɔ gwaa, Pyɛɛd zɛtyaa tetel kuku ɛbwak ɛ lɔɔ, nyɛ eezɛke náá: <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />«Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, ye nagoka ɛ́ náá, sa Sisim na Dɛɛ naloolɛɛ tɔ Ekwyala e Zɛɛb ɛ́ sael. Pɛ tɔ nuub ɛ Dhavid, nyɛ naaloolii dum nɛ Yudas náá, yɛ ɛ́ Yudas ɛ nadul bot ɛ nazɛmɛt Yezu ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Nyɛ nadi ɛ́ ngɔt tɔ lɔɔg'es, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nyɛ eebela yɛ kyee ɛkɛɛ tɔ lwomel bis nalwomaa ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Deenek, nɛ epata ee bɛ nadjɛ nyɛ, étɛp nyɛ neekɛka Yezu ɛ, nyɛ naabɔm pyeeb. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nyɛ eeduma si nɛ ɛghet é bɔs, mɔ tii nyɛ, mendja djas pɛ kel. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Bot ɛ Yeluzalɛm djas naagwak tɛp tak, é di tak ɛ́ bɛ naget pyeeb tak tɔ lii'ɔɔ “Akɛledama”. Ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ́ “pyeeb ghiya”.»<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />«Tinaak, beeka sa di kwyala tɔ mɛkana mɛ Mɛdjeeb ɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">“Ndjaŋ'ɛ goka nɛ ɛlik ɛ́ wum;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">sa dhiiti mot ààlik tɔ tak.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Ye nabaakwyalel ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">“Da dhiiti mot ɛ́ zɛdjila nyɛ tɔ mɛsa mɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.20 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:26">Mɛd 69.26</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:8">109.8</ref></char></char></note>”<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Ye goka nɛ ɛnɔŋaa ɛ, mot ngɔt tɔ sama bot ɛ nadi egyee mena nɛ bɛnɔɔ é sok mena nadi ekɛka mɛlu djas mena nɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu ɛ, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />kɛkan dwoo Zaŋ naduu nyɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, kɛyaka nɛ dwoo Zɛɛb nadis nyɛ pak'enaka ɛ. Mot tak aakadi ɛ́ tyaasɛs mena nɛ bɛnɔɔ, étɛp ɛkɛbaŋa nɛ bot náá, Yezu naazegom bhis ɛsyee ɛ lɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Tin, bɛ eezɛlyaal bɛ bot ɛbá: Ye nabɛ ɛ́ Zozɛf, dhiiti din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Bhaalasabhas, nyɛ nabaadi edjóoaa ɛ́ Yustus, zɛnɔɔ Matyas. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Bhii tak bot ɛ nadi edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ zokazɛsɛɛga, bɛ moo tin edjaala náá: «Ghɛŋ, wɔy mot di egu ebhum elyem e bot ɔ, lyaala bis mot wɔ tɔ, tɔ sama bot ɛbá bak ɔ, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />étɛp nyɛ needi ngɔt tɔ sama bot ɛ lwoma, é di mɛsa ɛ Yudas mot lik bis, da tɔ́ yɛ é di di egoka nɛ nɛ ɔ.» <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛsa dhiiti ɛgwyeeg, ɛgwyeeg ɛ tak kasɛ́ɛ ɛ́ Matyas. Matyas ɛ́ boozɛni tɔ sama bot ɛ lwoma kam nɛ ngɔt.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Ɛzyɛ ɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Dáa dwoo Patekɔt nakakum ɛ, bɛdjekel nadi ɛ́ zɛɛga é sum di wat. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Kasɛka tɔ gwoo ɛ́, dhiiti mɛwuŋal dáa ghuu na lyel-lyel eezɛlwoodal ndjaa djas bɛ nadi tɔ tak ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Tin, bɛ eezɛbee esonok eezɛtyaa kɔ elo bɔɔ, tyee mengel mɛ du. Bhii tak, wɔ gwaa ngel tak zokazɛbɛka, bɔɔ epes-epes, kyee wat-wat eekɛtyaa kɔ mot nɛ mot. <figure style="fig" alt="L’arrivée du Saint Esprit le jour de la pentecôte" file="DN00498b.tif" size="span" loc="2.3" copy="Darwin Dunham" ref="2.3">Ɛzyɛ ɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ é dwoo Patekɔt</figure><verse eid="ACT 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Bɔɔ djas naalwood nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ. Bhii tak bɛ moo tin elii membyak me sis, dáa Sisim nadi edjɛ bɛ ghwyil ɛlii ɛ.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Tin, é ghɛŋ tak, tɔ Yeluzalɛm, ye nadi ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda nadi ekaab Zɛɛb ɔ, nadus pɛ kyee mɛdhik djas di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Dáa bɛ nagwak ɛtap ɛlenek ɛ, bɔɔ djas zokasum ekaab zɛsɛɛga é di wat, bɛ moo tin edjoka ɛbuɛpe etɛɛ náá, mot nɛ mot nadi egwak bɛdjekel elii elii e membyak mɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Bɛ naadyeebadjoka ɛbuɛpe, bɔɔ náá: «Bot ɛ di elii'aak, tok bot ɛ kyee dik Ghalile? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Ye sa dáa náá, mot nɛ mot pak'ena gwak sa bɛ di elii ɛ́ tɔ lii mbyak'ɛ? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Pak'ena wak, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ dus pɛ dik Paaletɛs, dik Medɛs, zɛnɔɔ dik Elam. Bɛdhiiti bot dus ɛ́ pɛ Meezopotami, pɛ kyee dik Yude, pɛ dɛl ɛ Kapadɔs, nɛ Pɔŋ pɛ kyee dik Azi, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />pɛ Fiilizi, nɛ pɛ Panfili zɛnɔɔ pɛ Eziptɛ, nɛ é ngwoob dɛl ɛ Sylɛn pɛ Libi, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ nadus pɛ ghaada Lɔm ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />Bɛdhiiti nabɛ ɛ́, bot ɛ ghola Kelɛt, nɛ bot ɛ dik Aalabi. Pak'enaka ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda, bak bɛdhiiti nabɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ nazemyaal ɛdjaala Zɛɛb eYuda ɔ. Tin, bisɔ djas ɛpegwak pɛ tɔ elii e membyak mes dáa bɛ di elɛɛ embɛɛ nɛ eboo esesɛɛ Zɛɛb di esa ɛ!» <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Bɔɔ djas naadyeebadjoka dhaa tyɛ, bɛ moo tin yooo ààbɛ nɛ dáa bɛ sa, bɛ moo tin edjinel pak'ɔɔ náá: «Yak tak kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ yé?» <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Tin, bɛdhiiti bot nadi egɔ bɛ, bɔɔ náá: «Elangi e mɛnyok ɛ́ di esa bɛ ɔ!»<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pyɛɛd eezɛlii nɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Tin Pyɛɛd eezɛtyaa tetel bɛ nɛ bak bɛdjekel kam nɛ ngɔt, nyɛ moo tin etuud nɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛlyelɛpe náá: «Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam bot ɛ mbyak eYuda, zɛnɔɔ biyɔ bot ɛ di é dwoo lak mos kɔ Yeluzalɛm ɔ, ye goka bi mɛt ɛsuk ɛ sa di esael ɛ. Gwakeka ɛnyɔɛpe sa mɛ di ekwyɛl ɛlɛɛ bin ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Bot bak tok tɔ elangi e mɛnyok dáa bi di egek tɔ elyem bin ɛ, etɛɛ náá, mena dinaaka ɛ́ é ɛwala etɛn nɛ ená yii mɛlem. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />É di'enek guka náá, sa ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Zowɛl nalɛɛ ɛ́, ye moo zɛsael. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nyɛ eeke náá:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />“Zɛɛb naake náá: Tɔ mɛlu mɛ mɛsik,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">mɛ waadjɛ bot djas Sisim yam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Bɔn bin, bɔn botom nɛ bɔn boa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">bɛ aadi ɛ́ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">mengbaaz ɛ́ waakan ɛbee etɛp tyee tɔ mɛdhyam</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">tin bɛtɔa-bot ɛ́ waadjem mɛdhyam.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ tɔ mɛlu menek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">mɛ waadjɛ Sisim yam nɛ bot ɛ mɛsa mam yii botom nɛ yii boa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">bɛ aadi ɛ́ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Mɛ waasa esa e mɛbwala pɛ ɛko tɔ gwoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">nɛ endem e mɛbwala pɛ si kɔ bɔs.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">Yɛ aadi ɛ́ ghiya, du, eguud nɛ eguluk.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Ɛsok nɛ dwoo ɛ Ghɛŋ zyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">dwoo tak aadi ɛ́ boo dwoo nɛ duma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">gwyes ɛ́ waaghomela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">ngɔn ɛ́ waate zoooŋ dáa ghiya.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Tin, mot aadjaala nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:21">nyɛ waatsak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.21 <char style="xt"><ref loc="JOL 3:1-5">Zol 3.1-5</ref></char></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />Bot ɛ mbyak Yisalaɛl, gwakeka sa mɛ di elii'aak: Zɛɛb naalyaal bin kɔkɔ mbi mot Yezu mot Nazalɛt nadi ɛ́. Etɛɛ náá, pak'en, Zɛɛb naasa eboo endem e mɛbwala membi nɛ membi é ze ɛ Yezu. Biyɔ bɛmet nɛ gu yɛ ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Bi nabɛ ɛ́ bi eeka mot tak é mɛmbɔ mɛ bot ɛ di ààgu Zɛɛb ɔ. Bɛ naagó nyɛ, bem nyɛ é mɛlaaba, etɛp binek djas nasael ɛ́ dáa Zɛɛb naloozekɛk, nɛ ɛlɛɛ náá, nyɛ waasa ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Tin, Zɛɛb naagomal nyɛ bhis ɛsyee, nyɛ naapɛk nyɛ tɔ mezuk mɛ ɛsyee, etɛɛ náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààdjala náá, ɛsyee di nɛ eghɛŋ kɔ lɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Beeka dáa mɛkoozi Dhavid naake kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">“Mɛ nadi ebebee Ghɛŋ sok bhwoob'am,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">nyɛ ɛ́ pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ bam ekaab náá,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">mɛ zɛkɛpwak nɛ bwoo.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, lyem'am ɛ́ tɔ boo mɛnyɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">mɛkpa mɛ nuub'am eelwood nɛ boo mɛmyaala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">nyel'am ɛ́ tɔ boo ɛbwaalel.<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Etɛɛ náá, Ghɛŋ, wɔ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛlik mɛ kɔ dɛl ɛ edim e bot ɛ nazegwyɛ ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:27">wɔ aanàkwaabet náá, mot'ɔ na Dɛɛ kɛsyep tɔ ɛvit.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Wɔ eelyaal mɛ ze di edul bot pɛ tsik ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:28">wɔ ɛpedjɛ mɛ mɛmyaala é mis mɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.28 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 16:8-11">Mɛd 16.8-11</ref></char></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, betka mɛ lɛɛ bin popoopwon dum nɛ bhaab'enaka Dhavid, nyɛ naagwyɛ, bhii tak nyɛ naadelaa. Ɛvit ɛ lɛ ɛ́ tak dɔɔ nɛ dwoo pan mos'ak wak ɛkunaaɛpe. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Dáa nyɛ nadi náá, nyɛ ɛ́ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, nɛ dáa Zɛɛb nakɛk nyɛ nɛ ɛtuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mɛ náá, ngɔt tɔ bɛdha bɛ ɛ́ waadjila kɔ bóó mɛkoozi mɛ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Dhavid nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ eegu sa nawaasael ɛ. Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ eelɛɛ bot dum nɛ ɛgom ɛ Mɛsia bhis ɛsyee, étɛp tak ɛ nyɛ nake náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">“Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdhuugelaa tɔ dɛl ɛ edim e bot ɛ nazegwyɛ ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">tin, muu'ɛ nabɛ ɛ́, ààsyep tɔ ɛvit.”<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Zɛɛb eegomal Yezu mɛ di elii kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ'aak bhis ɛsyee. Bisɔ djas ɛ́ bɛtyaasɛs étɛp tak. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Zɛɛb eesa náá, nyɛ byet pɛ ɛko kɛ di pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ bɛ, nyɛ naabela Sisim na Dɛɛ Zɛɛb Sɛɛg nakɛk ɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ eelwoodal bis nɛ yɛ. Yenek ɛ́, etɛp ee bi di ebee nɛ ɛgwak, mos yenek. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Bela náá, Dhavid nyɛ ɛmet nabɛ ààbyet tɔ gwoo, tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nyɛ eeke náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">“Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb naake nɛ Ghɛŋ'am náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">Dha disi pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ bam.<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />Mɛ waalwom bot ɛ mɛbhuka mɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:35">bɛ di esa ee mɛbɔ mɔ aanyal ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.35 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Mɛd 110.1</ref></char></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Ye goka ɛ́ náá, bot ɛ mbyak Yisalaɛl djas gu ɛnyɔɛpe náá: Yezu bi nabem nyɛ é mɛlaaba ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ, Zɛɛb sa mos náá, nyɛ di Ghɛŋ nɛ Mɛsia!»<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bot bɛmil ɛlɛl eedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Bot ɛ nadi é di tak ɔ naadyeebadjoka nɛ mbi yenek kɔkɔ mɛkpa. Bɛ boozɛdji Pyɛɛd bɛ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ lwoma náá: «Mɔn-nyɛɛg, bis goka nɛ ɛsa dáa?»<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Pyɛɛd eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mot nɛ mot tɔ len, liigka elyem, da bi ɛ́ duwa Zɛɛb nɛ din ɛ Yezu Klisto, etɛɛ náá, mesyem men neepelaa. Bhii tak, bi ɛ́ waabela ekɛk ɛ Zɛɛb, Sisim na Dɛɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Tin, Zɛɛb nakɛk etɛp bak ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ len, nɛ bɔn bin, zɛnɔɔ bot ɛ di kɔ mɛl mɛ di ɛtsetaɛpe ɛ, bot djas Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb'ena aadjóo ɔ.»<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Pyɛɛd naabaalii nɛ nɔɔ bɛtɛ nɛ edhiiti etɛp, étɛp bɛ neemyaal, nɛ étɛp bɛ neebela mɛghaaz. Nyɛ nadi eke nɛ nɔɔ ɛ́ náá: «Myaalka tsik étɛp biyɔ bɛmet needi ààkwyɛ é laab bot ɛ di mos, bɛ eezewo ze'aak!» <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bot ɛbuɛpe tɔ sama yɔɔ naamyaal mɛlyo ɛ Pyɛɛd, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zokazɛduwa Zɛɛb. Dwoo tak, bot ɛkɛɛ sa yɛ aasa bɛmil ɛlɛl (3 000) naabaazɛbilel kɔ sama bot ɛ nazedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb sok ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsik bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Bɔɔ djas naadyeebawa zii tɔ ɛgwak ɛ́ mɛlyo mɛ bot ɛ lwoma nadi elyo bɛ ɛ. Bɛ nadi ɛ́ tɔ boo ɛgwakel pak'ɔɔ, bɛ nadi edɛ edee ɛ́ é di wat, nɛ ɛdjaala Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Mot nɛ mot nadi ɛ́ ekaab Zɛɛb ɛlyelɛpe. Tin é ze bot ɛ lwoma, Zɛɛb nadi esa bɛtɛ nɛ endem e mɛbwala. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Bot ɛ nadi edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ nadi ɛ́ lyem wat tɔ ɛgwakel. Pak'ɔɔ, bɛ nadi ekekaa esa djas bɛ nadi nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Bɛ nadi ebebɔmsa esa nɛ ekum bɔɔ. Bhii tak, epata ee bɛ aabela ɛ, bɛ kekaa yɛ ɛ́ pak'ɔɔ, é ɛbee ɛkwosak ɛ mot di nɛ yɛ ɛ́. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Mɛlu djas, bɛ nadi esɛɛga tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa ɛ Zɛɛb. Bɛ nadi ededɛ edee bɔɔ ɛ́, é di wat tɔ mendjaa mɔɔ, tin bɛ nadi edɛ ɛ́ nɛ boo mɛmyaala tɔ elyem, ààbɛ nɛ lyem ɛbet. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Bɛ nadi eduwal Zɛɛb tɔ mɛdjeeb, tin, bot djas nadi ekwyɛl bɛ ɛbuɛpe. Tin mɛlu djas, Ghɛŋ nadi ebil tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ lɔɔ, bot ɛ nyɛ nadi etsik ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Pyɛɛd bɛ nɛ Zaŋ eetsik boka mot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Dhiiti dwoo, Pyɛɛd bɛ nɛ Zaŋ zokazɛbyet pɛ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa étɛp ɛkɛdjaala, ye nabɛ ɛ́ é ɛwala elɛl yii bikoko. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />É ngwoob ɛniel ɛ di edjóoaa «Ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa na nyɔ-nyɔ» ɛ, é di tak ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti boka mot mbyela mɔ. Mɛlu djas bot nadi eghɛɛ nyɛ, zɛmak nyɛ tin, étɛp nyɛ neebɔɔ epata pɛ daa bot ɛ nadi ezyɛ pɛ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Dáa nyɛ nabee Pyɛɛd bɛ nɛ Zaŋ ekwyɛl ɛni tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa ɛ, nyɛ eezɛwaab bɛ epata. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />É di'enek, Pyɛɛd bɛ nɛ Zaŋ zɛgwyák nyɛ kpɛɛɛ. Bhii tak, Pyɛɛd eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Gwyáka bis!» <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Tin mot'enɔk eezɛgwyák bɛ kpɛɛɛ, etɛɛ náá, tɔ lyem'ɛ, nyɛ nadi egek ɛ́ náá, bɛ waadjɛ nyɛ sonok. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />É di'enek, Pyɛɛd ɛ́ booke nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛ tok nɛ epata, ààkobɛ nɛ lɔɔd, sa mɛ di nɛ yɛ ɛ, mɛ ɛpedjɛ wɔ: Nɛ din ɛ Yezu Klisto mot Nazalɛt, wyɛla da wɔ ɛ́ kɛ!» <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Bhii tak nyɛ eezɛmɛt nyɛ pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ, nyɛ eezɛkwyee nyɛ é ɛwyɛl. É di tak wat, mɛko nɛ mɛtii mɛ mɛko mɛ mot'enɔk moo tin ɛlyelɛpe, <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />vaskala, é di tak wat, nyɛ eezɛtyaa tetel, nyɛ moo tin ekɛ. <figure style="fig" alt="Pierre guérit une personne paralysée" file="cn01896C.tif" size="col" loc="3.8" copy="David C Cook" ref="3.8">Pyɛɛd eetsik boka mot</figure></para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 3:8">Bhii tak nyɛ eezɛni lɔɔg wat bɛ nɛ bot ɛ lwoma pɛ tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa, nyɛy ekɛ, etsel, nɛ ɛduwal ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Bot djas nadi tin ɔ naabee nyɛ ekɛ nɛ ɛduwal ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />Dáa bɛ nagwyák náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ mot nadyeebadidi ndiindel é «Ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa na nyɔ-nyɔ» yii kok Ndjaa-ebuwa étɛp ɛwaab epata ɛ, tin bɔɔ djas naabela bɛbebwol nɛ ɛdjoka ɛbuɛpe dum nɛ sa nasael nɛ boka mot'enɔk ɛ.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pyɛɛd eezɛlii nɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Dáa mot'enɔk nanaada Pyɛɛd nɛ Zaŋ ɛ, bot djas tɔ ɛdjoka bɛ nadi edjoka ɛ, wɔ gwaa bɛ zokazyɛ kaab pɛ pak bɛ nadi ɛ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ di bhaaz nadi edjóoaa, «Bhaaz ɛ Salomɔŋ» ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Dáa Pyɛɛd nabee deenek ɛ́, nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ ɛdhuu ɛ bot binɔk náá: «Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam bot ɛ Yisalaɛl, étɛp yé bi di edjoka tsik mot'ak tsak ɛ? Étɛp yé bi di egwyák tyee náá, bis tsik mot'ak ɛ́ nɛ mɛghwyil mes met nɛghu etɛɛ náá, bis ɛpesa zii étɛp ɛdu ɛ Zɛɛb? Ààbɛ ye tok deenek! <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Yɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb ɛ Abalaam, Zɛɛb ɛ Izak, nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ Zakɔɔb, Zɛɛb ɛ bɛbhaab binaka ɛ lyaal duu mot-mɛsa mɛ Yezu. Biyɔ bɛmet bi naka nyɛ é mɛmbɔ mɛ ekukuma, nɛ swonal ɛ nyɛ é mis mɛ Pilat, kabela náá, Pilat naakwyɛl ɛbet nyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Biyɔ, bi naabyen mot na dɛɛ, na epiki, biyɔ nakwyɛl ɛ́ náá, Pilat bet mot di egó bot ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Deenek, bi naagó mot di nakuma tsik ɔ. Tin, bhis etɛp binek djas, Zɛɛb naagomal nyɛ tɔ ɛsyee, bis ɛ́ bɛtyaasɛs étɛp tak. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Yɛ ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ mɛbwala mɛ din ɛ Yezu, nɛ dum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ nɛ ɛ, ghwyil mot bi di ebee nɛ ɛgu'aak bula. Yɛ ɛ́ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Yezu ɛ sa náá, nyɛ bela tsik nyel djas bi di ebee'enek.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />Bela náá, bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, mɛ nɛ gu ɛnyɔɛpe náá, biyɔ nɛ ekukuma bin nasa deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bi ɛ́ tɔ boo ɛdjak dum nɛ Yezu. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ Zɛɛb kwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛsuk ɛ etɛp ee nyɛ naloolɛɛ tɔ enuub e bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb djas ɛ. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nyɛ eelɛɛ náá, Mɛsia mɛ ɛ́ waazuk. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Swoolaka mɛfulu men, da bi ɛ́ dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb etɛɛ náá, nyɛ needis mesyem men. <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />Deenek bhii tak, Ghɛŋ ɛ́ waazɛdjɛ bin ɛwala ɛ bi aawala ɛ. Tin, nyɛ waadhis bin Yezu, Mɛsia mɛ nyɛ naloozetɔ kɔ ɛsu ɛ len ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Nenak yak, ye goka ɛ́ náá, Yezu Klisto pookodi pɛ tɔ gwoo, kɛkum mɛlu mɛ yɛ aabɛ náá, esonok djas ɛ́ waabula bes, dáa Zɛɛb naloozelɛɛ tɔ enuub e bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb bɛ na dɛɛ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́, Moiiz naake náá: “Ghɛŋ Zɛɛb'en ɛ́ waadhis bin ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb dáa mam. Nyɛ aadi ɛ́ mot mbyak'en, da bi ɛ́ gwak etɛp ee nyɛ aalɛɛ bin ɛ djas. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Mot djas aadi ààgwak etɛp e ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb tak ɔ, nyɛ waasɔaa tɔ sama bot ɛ mbyak, bhii tak nyɛ waagóaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.23 <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Dɛt 18.15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:19">19</ref></char></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Tɔ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb djas, kana Samyɛl, kɛyaka nɛ bot ɛ nakazyɛ bhii koŋ'ɛ ɔ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ bɛ naalii nɛ nen dum nɛ mɛlu mak. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Etɛp ee Zɛɛb nakɛk bin tɔ enuub bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, nabɛ ɛ́ yebɔ. Bi ɛ́ nɛ yebɔ di tɔ ɛbhɛŋ ɛ Zɛɛb nakwyal bɛ nɛ bɛbhaab bin ɛ. Nyɛ naake nɛ Abalaam náá: “Mɛ waasɛɛ mɛbyel djas, kɔ bɔs mɛtel, kɔ lo bɛdha bɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Étɛp tak ɛ́ di náá, Zɛɛb napookoleedhis mot-mɛsa mɛ sok ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ len, nyɛ napookoleedhis nyɛ ɛ́, étɛp nyɛ neezɛsɛɛ bin mɛtel, nɛ ɛsa náá, mot nɛ mot neeliig koŋ nɛ embee mɛfulu mɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Pyɛɛd nɛ Zaŋ sok bhwoob boo kwan eYuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Bela tin náá, Pyɛɛd nɛ Zaŋ nadi elii nɛ zukamwaa nɛ mot nadi tin ɔ. Wɔ gwaa, bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, ekukuma e bɛmbaalel ɛ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa, zɛnɔɔ bot ɛ ɛdhuu ɛ eSaduseɛ, bɔɔ zokazyɛ pɛ kyee bɛ nadi ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Elyem naadyeebakpaa bɛ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nabɛ ààkwyɛl náá, Pyɛɛd nɛ Zaŋ, bot ɛ Lwoma bɛbá gheelelyo bot tɔ mɛlyo mɔɔ náá, Yezu Klisto mot nagwyɛ ɔ, nyɛ eezegom. Pyɛɛd nɛ Zaŋ nadi esa deenek ɛ́ étɛp ɛlyaal nɛ bot náá, nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, bot ɛ zegwyɛ ɔ waagom. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Tin bɛ boozɛmɛt Pyɛɛd nɛ Zaŋ zɛwa bɛ é membok. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zokazɛdjɛk bɛ tin kɛkum mɛlem, etɛɛ náá, bɛ namɛt bɛ ɛ́ bikoko. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Bela náá, bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ nagwak mɛkpa mɛ bot ɛ lwoma ɔ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ naadum koŋ nɛ mɛlyo mɔɔ. Mɛtaŋ mɛ bot ɛ tak naabilel, kum tyee bot bɛmil ɛtɛn (5 000).<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />É yak mɛlem, ekukuma eYuda, bɛpaa, zɛnɔɔ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi, zokazɛsɛɛga pɛ dɛl Yeluzalɛm. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Bot ɛ nadi tɔ zɛɛga tak ɔ nabɛ ɛ́, An boo ghaa-Zɛɛb, Kayif, Zaŋ, Alɛkzandɛlɛ zɛnɔɔ bot ɛ mɛbyel ɛ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb djas. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Bɛ eezɛtel Pyɛɛd nɛ Zaŋ metetel sok bhwoob'ɔɔ, tin, bɛ eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Bi sa esesɛɛ bak nɛ yak mɛbwala, nɛ din ɛ zɛ?» <verse eid="ACT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Tin, Sisim na Dɛɛ eezelwood tɔ Pyɛɛd, nyɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Ekukuma e mbyak nɛ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />bɛ dji bis mɛdjin mak mos ɛ́, étɛp enɛm esa ee bis nasa nɛ boka mot ɛ. Bɛ dji bis ɛ́ náá, mot'ak tsak dáa? <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />Ɛnyɔɛpe, ye goka ɛ́ bi gu náá, biyɔ djas, dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ Yisalaɛl, yɛ bɛ náá, mot'ak eetyaa tetel nɛ nyel ɛnyɔɛpe é mis men ɔɔ, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil din ɛ Yezu Klisto mot Nazalɛt, mot bi nabem é mɛlaaba, da Zɛɛb ɛ́ gomal nyɛ bhis ɛsyee ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Yezu, mot Ekwyala e Zɛɛb di elɛɛ tsɛɛtsɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">“Ɛkok ɛ bɛzumel mwas ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">moo ɛ́ ɛkok di epyet ndjaŋ ɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.11 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Mɛd 118.22</ref></char></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Tsik belaa ɛ́, nɛ din ɛ Yezu Klisto nyɛ ɛmet. Dhiiti mot Zɛɛb nadhis kɔ bɔs'ak náá, nyɛ neetsik mena ɔ, tok.»<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Dáa bɛ nabee náá, Pyɛɛd nɛ Zaŋ nadi elii nɛ boo ɛbwaalel ɛ, bot ɛ zɛɛga boo kwan eYuda naadjoka. Bɛ naadjoka etɛɛ náá, ye bɛ ɛ́ bɛ eesiiza náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ mbi vaŋ bot ɛ nadi ààtɔ́ mɛdjek ɔ. Bɛ nadi egu náá, bɛ nadi egyee ɛ́ sama wat nɛ Yezu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Tin, bɛ nadi ebee mot natsak ɔ tetel é ngwoob'ɔɔ, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkabɛ nɛ ɛkpa ɛ ɛyala. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Bɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá, bɛ wyis tɔ ndjaa epɛ́ɛ. Bɛ moo tin esɔs pak'ɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Bɛ nadi ekeke ɛ́ náá: «Mena aasaka bot bak dáa? Etɛɛ náá, bot dɛl Yeluzalɛm djas nɛ gu popoopwon náá, bɔɔ ɛ nasa ndem mɛbwala mak, mena tok nɛ ghwyil ɛswonal. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Tin, yɛ ààgoka náá, menduk mɛ tɛp'ak gék tɔ mɛlɔ mɛ bot bak djas. Mena ɛ́ waalyak bɛ nɛ mɛbhɛma náá, bɛ nàbaalii nɛ bot kɔ ɛsu ɛ din ɛ Yezu.»<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Bɛ eezɛdjóo bɛ, bhii tak bɛ eezɛlyak bɛ ɛlyelɛpe náá, bɛ nàbaalii nɛghu ɛlyo ɛ bot nɛ din ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Tin, Pyɛɛd nɛ Zaŋ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Pɛ́ɛka biyɔ bɛmet nɛghu yɛ ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe é mis ɛ Zɛɛb náá, bɛ looba nɛ nen nɛghu bɛ looba nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Yɛ kabɛ bisɔ ɔɔ, bis tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbyen ɛlii dum nɛ sa bis nabee nɛ mis nɛ ɛgwak nɛ mɛlɔ ɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Bot ɛ boo kwan eebaazɛbhɛm bɛ, bhii tak, bɛ eezɛbet bɛ. Bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ tyee bɛ aazuk bɛ, etɛɛ náá, ɛdhuu ɛ bot djas nadi eduwal Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ etɛp ee nasael ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Mot natsak nɛ mɛbwala ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ membu mɛkam-mɛná kɛdhaa.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mendjaala mɛ bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Dáa bɛ nabet bɛ ɛ, Pyɛɛd bɛ nɛ Zaŋ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ pak ɛdhuu ɛ bɛsɔ bɔɔ nadi ɛ. Bɛ moo tin ebaŋa bɛ etɛp djas eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ bɛpaa ɛ eYuda nalɛɛ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Bhii bɛ nazegwak etɛp binek djas ɛ, bɔɔ djas eezɛgwakel, tin, bɛ eezɛdjaala Zɛɛb náá: «Zɛɛb Mɛkaake, yɛ ɛ́ wɔy ɛ nakus gwoo nɛ bɔs, nɛ boo dii mɛsɔn zɛnɔɔ esonok djas di tɔ tak ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Yɛ ɛ́ wɔy ɛ di náá, nɛ ghwyil Sisim na Dɛɛ wɔ naasa náá, Dhavid bhaab'es mot-mɛsa mɔ ke náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">“Mɛdhik ɛpekuu, yɛ ɛ́ étɛp yé?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">Bot ɛ membyak ɛpedi bhoob yii toto.<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Bɛmɛkoozi mɛ bɔs eezekomsa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">étɛp ɛkɛlumla dɛɛb,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">eboo ekukuma eezesɛɛga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">Bɛ sɛɛga ɛ́, bɛ neekɛlumla dɛɛb nɛ Ghɛŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">nɛ mɛkoozi mɛ nyɛ nadjɛ ebotan ɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.26 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2:1-2">Mɛd 2.1-2</ref></char></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, Eelood nɛ Pɔɔs Pilat eezesɛɛga kɔ dɛl ɛlak bɛ nɛ ekukuma e membyak mɛ sis, zɛnɔɔ bot ɛ Yisalaɛl, bɛ needi boob kɔ ɛsu ɛ Mot-mɛsa mɔ na Dɛɛ Yezu, mot wɔ nazedjɛ ebotan ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Tin, bɛ eesa esonok djas wɔ naloogek nɛ ɛkwosak ɛ lɔ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />É di'enek, Ghɛŋ, bɛɛa mis kɔ mɛbhɛma mɔɔ, tin da wɔ ɛ́ djɛ bot ɛ mɛsa mɔ ze ɛgoola mɛkpa mɔ, nɛ boo ɛbwaalel. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Sɛɛba mbɔ'ɔ, etɛɛ náá, bot neetsak, endem e mɛbwala neesael nɛ din ɛ Mot-mɛsa mɔ na Dɛɛ Yezu.» <verse eid="ACT 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Dáa bɛ nasilal ɛdjaala ɛ, di bɛ nasɛɛga ɔ zokazɛdheegel, wɔ gwaa, Sisim na Dɛɛ zokalwood tɔ lɔɔ. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛni é ɛgoola Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ ɛbwaalel djas.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bot ɛ zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ ɛpekaa esa bɔɔ pak'ɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Ɛdhuu ɛ bot djas nadi edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, nadi ɛ́ tɔ ɛgwakel ɛnyɔɛpe tɔ elyem nɛ esisim, ye tok nɛ mot ngɔt pak'ɔɔ nadi eke náá, esa bɛ ɛ́ yii nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet. Esa ee bɛ nadi nɛ yɛ ɛ, nabɛ ɛ́ yii bɔɔ djas. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Yɛ ɛ́ nɛ boo mɛbwala ɛ bot ɛ lwoma nadi elɛɛ bot dáa Ghɛŋ Yezu nagom ɛ. Tin, Zɛɛb naadjɛ bɔɔ djas bɛtɛ nɛ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Ye tok nɛ mot ngɔt pak'ɔɔ nasu sa mot di egoka nɛ ɛdi nɛ yɛ étɛp tsik'ɛ ɔ. Deenek, bot ɛ nadi nɛ epyeeb nɛghu mendjaŋ ɔ, nadi ebɔmsa yɛ, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />bhii tak, da bɛ ɛ́ zyɛ nɛ epata ee bɛ aabela ɛ, zɛdjɛ bot ɛ lwoma. Bhii tak, bɛ kakaa epata e tak ɛ nɛ mot nɛ mot, é ɛbee egwyes e mot nɛ mot di nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Djhoonɔɔka geka nɛ Zozɛf, mot di Levit ɔ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bot ɛ di esa mɛsa tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa ɔ.</char></note> mot ghola Siipɛlɛ, mot bot ɛ lwoma naget din ɛ Bhaanabhas ɔ. Din ɛ tak kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ: «mot di edjɛ ghwyil nɛ mɛghaaz ɔ». <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />Nyɛ naabɔmsa pyeeb'ɛ, bhii tak nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ epata, zɛdjɛ bot ɛ lwoma.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Ananias bɛ nɛ Safiida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Tin, dhiiti motom din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Ananias, din ɛ myɛl nabɛ ɛ́ Safiida, bɛ naazɛgwakel étɛp ɛbɔmsa bɛɛdok nadi yɔbɔ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ kyee pata wat syel, yak kyee nyɛ bookɛdjɛ bot ɛ lwoma, myɛl nadi egu. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Tin, Pyɛɛd eezɛkɛ nɛ nɛ náá: «Ananias étɛp yé Satan zeni wɔ tɔ lyem deenek? Wɔ kwyɛl ɛ́ ɛkɔɔ Sisim na Dɛɛ, wɔ eesyel kyee epata wat ee wɔ bɔmsa bɛɛdok'ɔ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Ɛsok nɛ wɔ nɛ bɔmsa yɛ, ye nadi ɛ́ yɔ. Bhii wɔ kazebɔmsa yɛ ɛ, epata bɛ ɛ́ yɔ, etsal é? Haaa étɛp yé wɔ sa mbi yenek esesɛɛ? Wɔ ààpakɔɔ mot, wɔ kɔɔ ɛ́ Zɛɛb.» <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Gwaka nyɛ nagwak mɛkpa menek ɛ, Ananias eezɛduma si é bɔs, nyɛ eezɛgwyɛ. Tin bwoo naazɛmɛt bot djas nagwak menduk mɛ tɛp tak ɔ ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Mengbaaz ɛ́ boozɛpil muu'ɛ tɔ bheeza, bhii tak bɛ eezɛtɔ́ nɛ muu'ɛ kɛdel.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Ba mɛwala mɛlɛl nadhaa bhii tak, mwaa Ananias zɛkum, ààgu sa sael sok ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Pyɛɛd eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Lɛɛa mɛ, ye bɛ ɛ́ bi nabɔmsa bɛɛdok'en ɛ́ nɛ mɛtaŋ mak ɔ?» Nyɛ eezɛbɔɔza: «Hɛɛɛ, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛtaŋ menek ɛ bis bɔmsa yɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />É di'enek, Pyɛɛd ɛ́ booke náá: «Bi sa dáa étɛp bi neegwakel étɛp ɛbowal Sisim ɛ Ghɛŋ? Gwyáka, bot ɛ kɛdel ngom'ɔ ɔ, moo ɛ́ é ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa, bɛ waabaabɛp muu'ɔ tɔ́ nɛ yɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />É di tak wat, nyɛ zɛghaaga si, si mɛko mɛ bot ɛ lwoma, nyɛ eezɛgwyɛ. Mengbaaz mɛ nadus ndela ɔ, eezɛkum, bɛ kabela nyɛ ɛ́ muu. Tin, bɛ eezɛghɛɛ nyɛ, bɛ eezɛtɔ́ kɛdel nyɛ é ngwoob di bɛ nadel ngom ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala djas nɛ bot ɛ nagwak menduk mɛ tak ɔ, naabela boo bwoo.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bɛtɛ nɛ endem e mɛbwala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Bot ɛ lwoma nadi esa bɛtɛ nɛ endem e mɛbwala tɔ mɛdhuu mɛ bot. Bot djas nadi edum koŋ nɛ Ghɛŋ ɔ, zokasɛɛga pɛ tɔ bhaaz ɛ Salomɔŋ di tɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ Ndjaa-ebuwa ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Bot ɛbuɛpe nabɛ ààkadjheebal ɛkɛ é lɔɔg'ɔɔ, ye nakoozodi náá, bot nadi eduwal bɛ ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Tin, botom nɛ boa aluu na aluu nadi edum koŋ nɛ Ghɛŋ ɔ naazɛni tɔ lɔɔg'ɔɔ ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Tin, bot zokakɛghɛɛ membel, zɛnɛɛg bɛ é ngwoob egba, kɔ emwaala nɛ kɔ bhum. Bɛ nasa deenek ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, é sok Pyɛɛd aadhaŋ ɛ, sisim yɛ neegheebutal bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />É dhiiti mɛdhuu mɛ bot naazɛdus pɛ mɛl mɛ nadi é mengwoob mɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ. Bɔɔ zokazyɛ nɛ membel nɛ bot ɛ embee esisim nadi edhek-dhek ɔ. Bɔɔ djas zokatsak.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bot ɛ lwoma eetiigaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Dáa bɛ nabee edjema binek ɛ, boo ghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ bot ɛ lɔɔg'ɛ, bot ɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ zɛɛga eSaduseɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zokazɛkpaa elyem ɛbuɛpe dum nɛ bot ɛ lwoma binɔk. Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛke náá: «Ye goka ɛ́, mena lyakeka tɛp'ak.» <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Bɛ eezɛmɛt bot ɛ lwoma, bhii tak bɛ eezɛkɔɔl bɛ é membok mɛ bot djas di ekɔɔlaa tɔ tak ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Tin, é pum, wɔ gwaa fofop ɛ Ghɛŋ zokazɛdii ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa membok, bhii tak nyɛ eezɛwyisal bot ɛ lwoma, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />«Tɔ́ka pɛ tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa, lɛɛka bot etɛp djas di edum nɛ tsik na bes ɛ.» <figure style="fig" alt="Un ange libère les apôtres de la prison" file="CN01911C.TIF" size="col" loc="5.20" copy="David C Cook" ref="5.20">Fofop eewisal bot ɛ lwoma é membok</figure><verse eid="ACT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Bot ɛ lwoma eezɛgwak fofop tak. Tɔ ghooghom mɛlem bɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa, tin, bɛ eezɛni elyo bot mɛlyo mɔɔ. Boo ghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ bot ɛ lɔɔg'ɛ ɛ́ boozɛsɛɛg bɛpaa ɛ mbyak eYuda, étɛp bɛ neeboma é boo kwan. É di'enek, bɛ eezɛlwom bɛmbaalel, bɛ kɛnɔɔ bot ɛ lwoma pɛ ndjaa membok. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Tin dáa bɛmbaalel ɛ tak nakakum ɛ, bɛ ààpakabela bɛ tɔ dhɛŋ'ɔɔ é membok. É di'enek, bɛ eezɛsik pɛ boo kwan, bɛ eekɛlɛɛ bɛ náá: <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />«Bis bela ɛ́ ndjaa membok ndiila ɛnyɔɛpe, bɛmbaalel tin é edi bɔɔ, é mɛbɛ mɛ ndjaa. Kabela ɛ́ náá, bis ààpabee mot tɔ tak.» <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Dáa bɛ nagwak deenek ɛ, ye naadhaa kukuma bɛmbaalel ɛ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa nɛ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb ghwyil, bɛ moo tin esɔs dum nɛ sa sael nɛ bot ɛ lwoma ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />É di'enek, dhiiti mot eezɛtuula, nyɛ eezɛlɛɛ bɛ náá: «Gwakeka! Bot ɛ bi nakɔɔl é membok ɔ, bɛ ɛ́ pɛ tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa elyo bot mɛlyo mɔɔ.»<verse eid="ACT 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Bhii tak, kukuma bɛmbaalel eezɛtɔ́ bɛ nɛ bot bɛ, étɛp bɛ neekɛnɔɔ bot ɛ lwoma, bula nɛ nɔɔ. Tin bɛ naalii nɛ nɔɔ mɛdjɛ-mɛdjɛ, ààbɛ nɛ bhel, ekaab náá, bot ɛ dɛl ɛzɛkɛwus bɛ nɛ mɛkok. <verse eid="ACT 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Bhii bɛ nakabula nɛ nɔɔ ɛ, bɛ eezɛpɛ́ɛ bɛ sok bhwoob boo kwan eYuda. Tin, boo ghaa-Zɛɛb moo tin edji bɛ mɛdjin. <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bis di ɛ́ bis eezelu bin ɛlyelɛpe náá, bi nàbaalyo bot dum nɛ din ɛ mot'enɔk. Ghuna bi eebatasa náá, mɛlyo men kɛdjala kɔ ghaada Yeluzalɛm djas. Bi kwyɛl ɛsaŋ ɛ́ náá, embee ebaka e ɛsyee ɛ mot tak kwyɛ kɔ elo bis é?» <verse eid="ACT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Pyɛɛd bɛ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ lwoma eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Ye goka nɛ ɛlooba nɛ zɛ, nɛ bot ohoo, nɛ Zɛɛb? <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Zɛɛb bɛbhaab binaka eegomal Yezu bi nagó nyɛ, mbema kɔ mɛlaaba ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Zɛɛb eetel nyɛ tetel pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ bɛ, nyɛ eedjɛ nyɛ dék ɛdi mɛkoozi nɛ Mɛtsik-bot. Nyɛ nasa deenek ɛ́, étɛp ɛdjɛ bot ɛ mbyak Yisalaɛl ze étɛp bɛ neeswoola mɛfulu mɔɔ, bɛ neebela ɛpelak ɛ mesyem mɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Bis ɛ́ bɛtyaasɛs e etɛp binek djas, bisɔ nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ Zɛɛb nadjɛ bot ɛ di elooba nɛ nɛ ɔ.»<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Wɔ gwaa, ɛbuk baazɛsa bot ɛ boo kwan eYuda ɛbuɛpe, bhii bɛ nazegwak mɛkpa menek ɛ. Tin, gwyes ɛgó ɛ́ bot ɛ lwoma nasa bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Bela náá, tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ lɔɔ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti Falizyɛ din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Ghamalyɛl, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ ghaa-mɛkana mɛ etsi ɛ Moiiz, bot nadi eduwal nyɛ ɛbuɛpe. Wɔ gwaa nyɛ zɛwyɛl tyaa tetel kuku ɛbwak ɛ zɛɛga bot ɛ boo kwan, nyɛ eezɛke náá, bɛ wyisal bot ɛ lwoma pɛ kel ba mɔɔ pes ɛwala. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Bhii tak nyɛ eezɛke nɛ bot ɛ kwan náá: «Bot ɛ Yisalaɛl, bi ɛ́ kobaka nɛ sa bi aasa nɛ bot bak ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Ye dinaa ààpakobɔya, wak koko ɛ koko ye nabɛ ɛ́ Tedas natuula náá, nyɛy ɛ́ yɛ kuma mot. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ botom tyee mɛtaŋ bɛdhet-ɛná (400) naadu nyɛ. Bela náá, nyɛ naagóaa, bhii tak, bot ɛ nadu nyɛ ɔ naawyɛɛza bɔɔ djas, tin zɛɛga tak naazɛgwyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Bhii nyɛy, é sok ɛlɛɛga ɛ mɛtaŋ mɛ bot, Yudas mot Ghalile naazɛsɛɛg zukamwaa nɛ mot nadu nyɛ ɔ. Tin, nyɛ naabaagóaa yɛ pe, é di'enek bot djas nadu nyɛ ɔ naazɛwyɛɛza gwyiiŋ. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Nenak mɛ kalɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, sa mot ààkabaabis bɛ. Betka bɛ, bɛ tɔ́, etɛɛ náá, yɛ bɛ náá, ɛsuk ɛ egwyes bɔɔ nɛghu mɛsa mɔɔ dus ɛ́ nɛ bɔɔ bɛmet ɔɔ, yɛ waasi. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Yɛ kabɛ náá, ɛsuk ɛ egwyes bɔɔ nɛghu mɛsa mɔɔ dus ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, bi tok nɛ ghwyil ɛpul yɛ. Nàgheegka mɛnyel é ɛdi ɛ́ bot ɛ mɛbhuka ɛ Zɛɛb.» Tin, zɛɛga boo kwan eezɛmyaal etɛp ee Ghamalyɛl nalɛɛ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Tin, bɛ boobaazɛdjóo bot ɛ lwoma, bɛ eezɛnyuu bɛ nɛ eghwyɛs. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛlyak bɛ náá, bɛ nàbaalyo bot dum nɛ din ɛ Yezu, é di'enek bɛ eezɛbet bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Bot ɛ lwoma eezɛdus é di kwan nɛ mɛmyaala, etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb eebee náá, bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ di egoka nɛ ɛzukaa kɔ ɛsu ɛ din ɛ Yezu ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Tin mɛlu djas tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa, mendjaa nɛ mendjaa, bot ɛ lwoma nadi etɔ́ nɛ ɛlyo, nɛ ɛgoola Mbɛɛ bhaadal ɛ Yezu Mɛsia.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s1">Bot ɛtɛn nɛ bɛbá eesɛ́ɛaa étɛp ɛkwyee bot ɛ lwoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />É ghɛŋ tak, bela náá, mɛtaŋ mɛ bɛdjekel nabɛ ɛ́ yɛ eebaazebilel ɛbuɛpe. EYuda ee di elii lii eGhɛlɛk ɔ, nabɛ ɛ́ bɛ eetaŋal dum nɛ bot ɛ nadi elii eBhele ɔ. Bɛ nadi eke ɛ́ náá, yɔbɔ bɛkus ɛ boa nabɛ ààdi ekwyɛɛgaa mɛlu djas é ghɛŋ bɛ nadi ekekaa edee ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Bot ɛ lwoma kam nɛ bɛbá ɛ́ boozɛsɛɛg bɛdjekel djas, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Yɛ ààgoka náá, bis bet ɛgoola Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, étɛp ɛkɛkaa edee. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Deenek, bɔn-nyɛɛg, sɛ́ɛka pak'en bot ɛtɛn nɛ bɛbá di sosoob nɛ epiki ɔ, bot ɛ di tɔɔɔ nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ nɛ etsoŋ ɔ. Da mena ɛ́ djɛ bɛ mɛsa mɛ tak. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Tinaak, bisɔ aakadi ɛ́ esa mɛsa mɛ mendjaala nɛ ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal.» <verse eid="ACT 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Bot ɛ zɛɛga djas naamyaal egeka e tak. É di'enek, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛsɛ́ɛ Etiɛn mot nadi nɛ boo ɛdum koŋ ɛbuɛpe nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, nyɛ eelwood nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́, dɔɔ nɛ Filip, Polokɔɔd, Nikanɔɔd, Timɔn, Paalemenas, nɛ Nikolas mot dɛl ɛ Antiɔs, mot namyaal ɛdjaala Zɛɛb eYuda ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Bhii tak bɛ eezɛlyaal bɛ nɛ bot ɛ lwoma, tin bɛ eezɛdjaala Zɛɛb nɛ ɛkɛl ɛ́ bɛ mɛbɔ. <verse eid="ACT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Tin, Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nadi egoolel ɛbuɛpe. Mɛtaŋ mɛ bɛdjekel nadi ebilel, ɛbilel nɛ ɛbilel pɛ Yeluzalɛm. Deenek, bɛtɛ nɛ bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nadi edum ekoŋ nɛ Yezu.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Etiɛn eemɛtaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Etiɛn tɔɔɔ nɛ ghwyil enɛm nɛ embɛɛ e Zɛɛb, nɛ mɛbwala, nyɛ nadi esa bɛtɛ nɛ endem e mɛbwala ɛbuɛpe tɔ bot. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Tin, bɛdhiiti bot ɛ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda zokazɛbyen lek'ɛ. Bot ɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́ kyee wat, bot ɛ mɔɔ ndjaa mendjaala nadi edjóoaa «Ekwom Pɛka» ɔ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ eYuda e kyee dik Silɛn nɛ yii Alɛkzandili. Yak kyee eYuda kyee dik Silisi nɛ pɛ pes kyee dik Azi. Bɛ moo tin esuu mɛso nɛ Etiɛn. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Tin bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkwak nyɛ, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nalelii ɛ́ nɛ etsoŋ ee Sisim na Dɛɛ nadi edjɛ nyɛ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Tin, wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛdjɛ bot epata étɛp bɛ neeke náá: «Bis eegwak nyɛ elóo mɛkpa mɛ mɛlee dum nɛ Moiiz nɛ Zɛɛb!» <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Tin bɛ eezɛni ebesal mɛdhuu mɛ bot, bɛpaa nɛ bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi. É di'enek bɛ eezɛmɛt Etiɛn zaka, bhii tak, bɛ eezɛtɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ zɛɛga boo kwan eYuda. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zokabaazyɛ nɛ etyaasɛs e etsal binɔk. Bɛ eezɛke náá: «Mot'ak ààkat ɛnyek ɛ́ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa na dɛɛ, dɔɔ nɛ etsi ɛ Moiiz! <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Bis eegwak nyɛ eke náá, Yezu mot Nazalɛt tak ɛ́ waabwak kok Ndjaa-ebuwa, da nyɛ ɛ́ swoola etsi ee Moiiz nalik mena yɛ ɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Bot djas nadi mendiindil tɔ ndjaa é di boo kwan eYuda ɔ, moo tin dhuuu nɛ mis é nyel ɛ Etiɛn, tin bɛ eezɛbee náá, bhwoob'ɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ye moo tyee wat nɛ yii fofop.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Taŋal ɛ Etiɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Boo ghaa-Zɛɛb eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Etɛp ee bɛ di elii kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɔ'aak ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ?» <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Etiɛn eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam nɛ bɛsɛɛg bam, gwakeka mɛ! Zɛɛb duu naatel bhaab'enaka Abalaam nyel, é sok nyɛ nadi pɛ kyee dik Meezopotami ɛ, ɛsok nɛ nyɛ kɛdi pɛ dɛl ɛ Alan. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />É di'enek, nyɛ naake nɛ nɛ náá: “Dusa kyee dik'ɔ, beta bot ɛ mɛbyel mɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ tɔ́ pɛ kyee dik mɛ aalyaal wɔ ɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Tin Abalaam ɛ́ boozɛdus kɔ kyee dik Salede, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ kɛdi pɛ kyee dɛl ɛ Alan. Tinaak, bhis ɛsyee ɛ sɛɛg, Zɛɛb eezɛdis nyɛ kɔ kyee dɛl ɛ Alan, tɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ bi kadi mos'aak. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Bela náá, Zɛɛb nabɛ ɛ́ ààdjɛ nyɛ pes bɔs, ààkobɛ mɔɔ pes bɛɛdok wat dáa ɛbɔ. Tin bela náá, Zɛɛb naazekɛk náá, nyɛ waadjɛ nyɛ tu dik, bɛdha bɛ ɛ́ waalik nɛ yɛ bhii koŋ'ɛ. Bela náá, é ghɛŋ tak nabɛ ɛ́, Abalaam di náá, ààkobɛ-bɛak nɛ mɔn. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Beeka etɛp ee Zɛɛb nalɛɛ ɛ: “Bɛdha bɔ aadi ɛ́ kɔ mɛdhik mɛ mɛdjoŋ, é di bɛ aadi ekwom ɔ, é di bɛ aatiigaa membu bɛdhet-ɛná (400) ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Tin, mɛ waapɛ́ɛ mɛdhik mɛ bɛ aadi e ekwom é tak ɛ. Bhii tak, bɛ waadus é di'enek, bɛ waakɛsɛɛga é mendjaala é di'ak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">v. 2-3 <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Mɛk 12.1</ref></char> v. 4 <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 11:31">Mɛk 11.31</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 12:4">12.4</ref></char> v. 5 <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Mɛk 12.7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 13:15">13.15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 15:18">15.18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:8">17.8</ref></char> v. 6-7 <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:13-14">Mɛk 15.13-14</ref></char> Ɛwy 3.12.</char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Deenek, Zɛɛb naagwakel nɛ Abalaam, étɛp ɛkwyal ɛbhɛŋ, ndem tak ɛ́ beka. Yɛ ɛ́ kɔ lo mɛsɔ mɛ tak ɛ Abalaam naniigal Izak mɔn'ɛ beka, é mɛlu mɛtɛn nɛ elɛl bhis ɛbyel ɛ lɛ, tyee wat nɛ dáa Izak naniigal Zakɔɔb mɔn'ɛ beka ɛ, Zakɔɔb zokaniigal bɔn bɛ, bot ɛ di bɛsɛɛg ɛ bɛbhaab ɛ membyak kam nɛ ebá e Yisalaɛl ɔ, beka.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Bɛbhaab ɛ tak nadi ɛ́ nɛ mɛbhuka nɛ Zozɛf. Tin, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛbɔmsa nyɛ, étɛp nyɛ needi kwom pɛ Eziptɛ. Tin, Zɛɛb nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ nɛ lɔɔg. <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />Nyɛ nadi epɛk nyɛ tɔ mezuk mɛ djas, nyɛ naadjɛ Zozɛf etsoŋ, nyɛ naasa náá, nyɛ djɛ edjɔɔ é mis mɛ Falaɔŋ, mɛkoozi mɛ Eziptɛ. Nyɛ naazɛdjɛ Zozɛf bóó ekukuma kɔ kyee dik Eziptɛ, nɛ tɔ ndjaa mɛkoozi mɛ djas. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Wɔ gwaa, pwom zɛni kɔ kyee dik Eziptɛ djas nɛ Kanan: ye nabɛ ɛ́ boo mezuk. Tin bɛbhaab binaka nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ edee e dek. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Dáa Zakɔɔb nagwak náá, edee nabɛ ɛ́ pɛ Eziptɛ ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boolwom bɛbhaab bina lwoma mɛkɛn. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Dáa bɛ nabaatɔ́-tɔ́ak tyee tɔ́ak esok ebá ɛ, Zozɛf ɛ́ bootel bɔn-nyɛɛg nyel. É di'enek ɛ mɛkoozi mɛ dik Eziptɛ nazɛgu bot ɛ mɛbyel ɛ Zozɛf. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Tin, Zozɛf eezɛlwom bot bɛ kɛnɔɔ Zakɔɔb sɛɛg, zɛnɔɔ bot ɛ mɛbyel mɛ djas. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ bot mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ ebá nɛ ɛtɛn (75). <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Tin, Zakɔɔb ɛ́ boozɛtɔ́ pɛ Eziptɛ pɛ pak nyɛ nakɛgwyɛ ɛ, zɛnɔɔ bɛdhiiti bɛbhaab bena. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Bɛ naanɔɔ myoŋ mɛ bot bɔɔ, tɔ́ nɛ yɛ pɛ dɛl ɛ Sisɛm. Bɛ ɛ́ bookɛdel bɛ tɔ ɛvit ɛ Abalaam nabɔm nɛ epata é mɛmbɔ mɛ bɔn Amɔɔd pɛ Sisɛm ɛ.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />Dáa ye nabɛ náá, ɛwala ɛ Zɛɛb nadi ekwyɛl ɛsa sa nyɛ nakɛk Abalaam ɛ, Zɛɛb nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ eezebil mɛtaŋ mɛ bot, tin, bot bina moo ɛbuɛpe kɔ Eziptɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Tin, dhiiti mɛkoozi mɛ sis nadi ààgu Zozɛf ɔ, eezɛnɔɔ bóó mɛkoozi kɔ Eziptɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Mɛkoozi mɛ tak naakɔɔ bot ɛ mbyak yena. Nyɛ naazuk bɛbhaab bina é ɛlwom bɛ nɛ bhel náá, bɛ bet bɔn etɔlɔɔ bɔɔ étɛp bɛ neegwyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />É ghɛŋ tak ɛ́ Moiiz nabyel, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛm mɔn motom Zɛɛb nakwyɛl ɔ. Nyɛ naabaalaa bɛngɔn ɛlɛl tɔ ndjaa sɛɛg. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />É sok nyɛ naanɛɛgaa pɛ kel ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ɛsyes ɛ mɛkoozi mɛ dik Eziptɛ ɛ naatek nyɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛwyel nyɛ dáa mɔn'ɛ met. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Tin, Moiiz naadjek ɛgu nɛ etsoŋ e bɔs bot ɛ Eziptɛ, ye naasa náá, nyɛ di mot mbyok dum nɛ elii bɛ, nɛ esesɛɛ bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Dáa nyɛ nadi nyɛ moo nɛ membu mɛkam-mɛná (40) ɛ, Moiiz ɛ́ boozɛke náá, ye goka ɛ́ náá, nyɛ pookotɔ́ kɛbee bɔn-nyɛɛg, bot ɛ mbyak Yisalaɛl. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Tin, wɔ gwaa nyɛ zɛbee dhiiti mot kyee dik Eziptɛ ezuk ngɔt tɔ lɔɔ. Nyɛ ɛ́ zɛkɛm mot nadi ezukaa ɔ, é ghɛm tak, nyɛ naazɛgó mot dɛl ɛ Eziptɛ tak. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Nyɛ nadi egek náá, bɔn-nyɛɛg bot ɛ Yisalaɛl nadi egu náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ dum nɛ nɛ ɛ́, Zɛɛb naawaapɛk bɛ é ekwom. Tin, kabela ɛ́ náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààgu. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Yii myɛn tak, nyɛ eezɛbaatɔ́ pɛ daa lɔɔ, nyɛ kabela ɛ́ bot ɛ Yisalaɛl bɛbá eduu pak'ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛsuu ɛbee ɛ́ bɛ, nyɛ neebulal ɛgwakel pak'ɔɔ. Nyɛy náá: “Bɛwɛn, bi ɛ́ bɔn-nyɛɛg, étɛp yé bi di egenel pak'en?” <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Tin, mot nadi ezuk mɔɔ sɔ ɔ, eezɛlóo Moiiz embee mɛkpa, nyɛy náá: “Ɛzɛ djɛ wɔ bóó ekukuma, wɔ needi tetɛp kɔ les? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Wɔ kwyɛl ɛ́ wɔ neegó mɛ dáa wɔ nagó mot Eziptɛ koko ɛ?” <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Dáa Moiiz nagwak mɛkpa menek ɛ, nyɛ boozɛkaab, kɛdi pɛ kyee dik Madyan. Penek, nyɛ naabya bɔn botom ɛbá.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />Membu mɛkam-mɛná (40) bhii tak, pɛ tɔ kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ, é ngwoob ɛtsok ɛ Sinayi, fofop ngɔt zokazɛtuula Moiiz pɛ tɔ ngel du tɔ ɛkpak. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Nyɛ naadjoka é ɛbee mbi yenek mɛvyɛkɛlɛ mɛ nyɛ natelaa ɛ. Tin, esok nyɛ nadi esaa étɛp nyɛ neebee ɛnyɔɛpe é ngwoob ɛ, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zokazɛgwak gwood ɛ Ghɛŋ eke náá: <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />“Yɛ ɛ́ mam Zɛɛb bɛbhaab bɔ, Zɛɛb ɛ Abalaam, Zɛɛb ɛ Izak, nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ Zakɔɔb”. Gbegbaagba nɛ bwoo, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkadjheebal ɛgwyák pɛ yiizaag. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Tin, Ghɛŋ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: “Disa mɛpapa mɔ, etɛɛ náá, di wɔ di wak'aak, yɛ ɛ́ bɔs na Dɛɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Mɛ eebee dáa bɛ di ezuk bot ɛ mbyak'am pɛ kyee dik Eziptɛ ɛ. Mɛ eegwak etsim bɔɔ, é di'enek ɛ, mɛ zyɛ zɛpɛk bɛ. Deenek, tɔ́a, mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ mɛ lwom wɔ pɛ dik Eziptɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.34 <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 3:1-10">Ɛwy 3.1-10</ref></char></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />Yɛ ɛ́ Moiiz tak ɛ bot ɛ Yisalaɛl nabyen, é ɛlóo mɛkpa náá: “Ɛzɛ djɛ wɔ bóó ekukuma, wɔ needi tetɛp kɔ les?” Zɛɛb eedhis nyɛ tyee kukuma, pɛkel-bot, é ze ɛ fofop nalyaal nyɛ nyel tɔ ngel ɛkpak ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Yɛ ɛ́ Moiiz ɛ nawyisal bɔn ɛ Yisalaɛl kɔ dik Eziptɛ, nɛ endem e mɛbwala mɛ nyɛ nadi esa kɔ dik tak ɛ, pɛ boo dii mɛsɔn na tɔɔbelaa, nɛ tɔ kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ é membu mɛkam-mɛná (40). <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Yɛ ɛ́ Moiiz tak ɛ nabaake nɛ bɔn ɛ Yisalaɛl náá, “Zɛɛb ɛ́ waadhis bin ngoolel-mɛkpa mɛ dáa mam, nyɛ aadi ɛ́ mot mbyak'en.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.37 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 18:15-18">Mɛd 18.15-18</ref></char></char></note>” <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Baabela náá, é sok bɔn ɛ Yisalaɛl nadi esɛɛga tɔ kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ nadi etyaa pak bɛbhaab binaka nɛ fofop nadi elii nɛ nɛ pɛ kɔ ɛtsok ɛ Sinayi ɛ. Nyɛ naabela mɛkpa mɛ tsik yii Zɛɛb, étɛp nyɛ neezɛgoola mena yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Tin, ye kabela náá, bɛbhaab bina nabɛ ɛ́ ààgwak nyɛ. Bɛ naabyen nyɛ, bɛ kakwyɛl ɛ́ ɛsik pɛ Eziptɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Bɛ naalɛɛ nɛ Aalɔn náá: “Sa bis bɛzɛɛb ɛ di ekɛ sok bhwoob'es ɛ, etɛɛ náá, bis ààgu sa sael nɛ Moiiz, mot wyisal bis tɔ kyee dik Eziptɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛlul naghisɛ, mɔɔ ngom ngɔmbɛ é di Zɛɛb, bhii tak, bɛ eezɛka naghisɛ tak buwa. Bɛ eezɛbɔl ɛbyoŋ nɛ mɛmyaala ɛbuɛpe dum nɛ sa bɛ nalul bɔɔ bɛmet ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />É di'enek, Zɛɛb eezɛliig bɛ koŋ, nyɛ eezɛbet bɛ, bɛ duwal ekwyikwyen tɔ gwoo. Etɛp e tak sael ɛ́, dáa ye di kwyala tɔ mɛkana mɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">“Bot ɛ mbyak eYuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ bi nadjɛ ebuwa e bɛtit nɛ edhiiti embi ebuwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">é membu mɛkam-mɛná (40) mena nadika</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">tɔ kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ.<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Ààbɛ! Ghuna, bi naabɛp pɛt ɛ zɛɛb Molok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">nɛ ekpaka-ekpaka kwyikwyen zɛɛb'en Lefan!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Bɛzɛɛb ɛ bɛnaghisɛ binɔk, bi nakpak bɛ ɛ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">étɛp bi needuwal bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, mɛ waakyeed bin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">kɛdhaa ghaada Bhabhilɔn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.43 <char style="xt"><ref loc="AMO 5:25-27">Amɔ 5.25-27</ref></char></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />Kɔ kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ, bɛbhaab binaka nadi ɛ́ nɛ pɛt ɛbhɛŋ ɛ Zɛɛb, bɛ nawa ɛbup ɛ mɛkana di elii etɛp ɛbhɛŋ ɛ. Ye nasael ɛ́ dáa Zɛɛb nalɛɛ Moiiz ɛ, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ naake nɛ Moiiz náá, nyɛ zosum ɛ́ ɛzel wat nɛ yii nyɛ nabee ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ Pɛt na Dɛɛ ɛ Zɛɛb tak nalik nɛ bɛbhaab bina, nɛ bot ɛ nakadu yɔbɔ bhis ɔ. Bɛ naazɛnɔɔ Pɛt tak, tɔ́ nɛ yɛ, é ghɛŋ Zozue nadi ndulel lɔɔg'ɔɔ ɛ. Bɛ naadɛk mɛdhik mɛ membyak mɛ Zɛɛb nadi esɔ bɛkum ɛ tak sok bhwoob'ɔɔ ɛ. Pɛt na Dɛɛ ɛ Zɛɛb tak naadi tin, kɛkum é sok Dhavid nadi mɛkoozi ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Tin, Dhavid naabela mbɛɛ bhwoob é mis ɛ Zɛɛb. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛwaab náá, Zɛɛb gek nyɛ goŋ, étɛp nyɛ neesum ndjaa-Zɛɛb bɛdha ɛ Zakɔɔb. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Tin, Salomɔŋ ɛ nakasum nyɛ ndjaa. <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Bela náá, Zɛɛb Mɛkaake ààdi tɔ mendjaa mɛ zumal bot. Dáa ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nalɛɛ náá:<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />“Ghɛŋ lɛɛ ɛ́ deenek náá,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">gwoo ɛ́ bóó mɛkoozi mam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">bɔs ɛ́ di di mɛbɔ mam di enyal ɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Yɛ ɛ́ yaa kwaambi ndjaa biyɔ aakosum mɛ yɛ ɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">É yaa di mɛ aakwak ɛdi?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Ye tok mam nasa yɛ nɛ mɛmbɔ mam ɛmet é<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.50 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 66:1-2">Eza 66.1-2</ref></char></char></note>?”<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Biyɔ bot ɛ maa-ɛlɔ, bot ɛ di náá, elyem nɛ mɛlɔ men eezɛdiyalel dum nɛ ndjóoel ɛ Zɛɛb di edjóo bin ɔ. Bi ɛ́ nɛ maa-ɛlɔ dum nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ! Bi ɛ́ dáa bɛbhaab bin! <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Baa bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, bɛbhaab bin nadi ààtiigaa? Bɛ naagó bot ɛ nagoola bhaadal náá, Mot Epiki ngɔt ɛpezyɛ ɔ. Yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ bi naka nyɛ, nɛ ɛgó ɛ́ nyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Biyɔ bot ɛ efofop nadjɛ etsi e Zɛɛb ɔ, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààduwal yɛ!»<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛsyee ɛ Etiɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Dáa bot ɛ boo kwan eYuda nagwak deenek ɛ́, bɛ naazɛkpaa elyem, nɛ ɛkwaal ɛ mɛtsok kɔ ɛsu ɛ Etiɛn. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Tin, nyɛy tɔɔɔ nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ tɔ lɛ, nyɛ eezɛben mis pɛ ɛko, gwyák tɔ gwoo. É di'enek nyɛ eezɛbee mɛkas ɛ Zɛɛb, zɛnɔɔ Yezu Klisto tetel pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Tin, Etiɛn eezɛke náá: «Mɛ ɛpebee gwoo mbek, Sɛɛŋɛlɛ Mɔn Mot tetel pɛ mbɔ eghɛŋ ɛ Zɛɛb.» <verse eid="ACT 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Bɛ eezɛtsim ɛlyelɛpe, bhii tak, bɛ eezɛdiyal mɛlɔ, bɔɔ djas eewyis kaab, zɛduma nyɛ é nyel. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Bɛ eezɛtɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ bhii dɛl, tin, bɛ moo zɛbyaal nyɛ nɛ mɛkok, étɛp bɛ neegó nyɛ. Wɔ gwaa, bɛtyaasɛs zokadjɛ ekaad bɔɔ nɛ dhiiti mɔɔ ngbaaz din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Sɔl, nyɛ baal bɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />É sok bɛ nadi ewus nyɛ nɛ mɛkok ɛ, Etiɛn nadi ɛ́ edjaala náá: «Ghɛŋ Yezu, nɔŋa sisim yam!» <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛkwyɛ mɛboŋ si, nyɛ eezɛtsim ɛlyelɛpe náá: «Ghɛŋ, nàkɛl syem'ak kɔ lɔɔ!» Bhii nyɛ nake deenek ɛ́, nyɛ eezɛsil eswos.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Sɔl naamyaal náá, Etiɛn góaa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Sɔl ɛpetiig bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">É dwoo tak wat ɛ́, mezuk mɛ bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala Yeluzalɛm nakan. Bot djas nadi edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ naazɛwyɛɛza, tɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Yude, nɛ pɛ Samaali. Tin bot ɛ lwoma ɛ́ nazokalik. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Bɛsosoob ɛ bot ɛ́ boonɔɔ muu ɛ Etiɛn, kɛdel, wɔ gwaa bɛ zɛdje nyɛ ɛbuɛpe.<verse eid="ACT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Tin, yɛ kabɛ Sɔl ɔɔ, nyɛ nadi esa mɛghaaz étɛp ɛkɛwaaz ezɛɛga mendjaala. Bhii tak, nyɛ nadi etɔ́ mendjaa nɛ mendjaa, kɛmɛt boa nɛ botom nadi edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, ewa bɛ é membok. <figure style="fig" alt="Saul fait souffrir les gens qui croient en Christ" file="DN00500b.tif" size="span" loc="8.3" copy="Darwin Dunham" ref="8.3">Sɔl ɛpetiig bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Yezu ɔ</figure><verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filip ɛpegoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal pɛ kyee dik Samaali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Bot ɛ nawyɛɛza djas ɔ, nadi ekɛ mɛl ɛ mɛl kɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filip eezɛtɔ́ pɛ boo ghaada kyee dik Samaali. Tin, nyɛ eezɛni elyo bot ɛ dɛl dum nɛ Mɛsia. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Bot ɛ dɛl djas nadi egwak etɛp ee Filip nadi elɛɛ bɛ ɛ nɛ lyem wat, é ghɛŋ bɛ nagwak nɛ ɛbee endem e mɛbwala mɛ nyɛ di esa ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Deenek, embee esisim nadi ewyis tɔ membel ebo eboo etsim. Tin, dɔɔ nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ nazesɔɔb ɔ, nɛ bot edjam nadi etsak. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Deenek, bot naadyeebamyaala ɛbuɛpe kɔ dɛl ɛ tak.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Dhiiti mot din ɛ lɛ nabɛ Simɔŋ, nyɛ naaloobe di sok kɔ dɛl ɛ tak. Nyɛ naasa mɛvyɛkɛlɛ mɛ bot ɛ Samaali nadi edjodjoka ɛ. Nyɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛlyaal ɛ́ náá, nyɛ ɛ́, yɛ ngék mot. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Tin, mengbaaz djas nɛ eboo bot, nadi egwak nyɛ nɛ lyem wat. Bɛ nadi eke ɛ́ náá: «Mot'ak ɛ́ nɛ mɛbwala ɛ Zɛɛb, yii di edjóoaa “boo mɛbwala” ɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Bɛ nadi egwak nyɛ ɛbuɛpe, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ eeloozyɛ nɛ ɛsa náá, bot gheedjoka mɛsa mɛ mɛvyɛkɛlɛ mɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Tin, dáa bɛ namyaal Mbɛɛ Bhaadal Filip nadi elɛɛ bɛ dum nɛ ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ dum nɛ din ɛ Yezu Klisto ɛ, tin, bɛ naazɛduwa Zɛɛb botom nɛ boa. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Dɔɔ nɛ Simɔŋ nyɛy ɛmet naadum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, nyɛy pe zokaduwa Zɛɛb. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́ é ngwoob ɛ Filip, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ edjodjoka ɛbuɛpe, é sok nyɛ nadi ebee endem e mɛbwala mɛ nadi esael ɛ.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Dáa bot ɛ lwoma, bot ɛ nadi pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɔ, nagwak náá, bot ɛ Samaali naazemyaal Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, é di'enek, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛkyeed bɛ Pyɛɛd bɛ nɛ Zaŋ. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Dáa bɛ nakakum pɛ Samaali ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛdjaala Zɛɛb étɛp bot ɛ nazedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, neebela Sisim na Dɛɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Deenek, Sisim na Dɛɛ nabɛ ɛ́, ye dinaa ààkosul-sulak kɔ mot ngɔt. Bɛ zoduwa Zɛɛb ɛ́ tɔ mɛdii nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Tin, Pyɛɛd bɛ nɛ Zaŋ eezɛkɛl bɛ mɛmbɔ, deenek, bɛ eezɛbela Sisim na Dɛɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Dáa Simɔŋ nabee náá, bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ naadjɛaa Sisim na Dɛɛ é sok bot ɛ lwoma nakɛl bɛ mɛmbɔ ɛ, nyɛ eezɛgek ɛdjɛ Pyɛɛd nɛ Zaŋ epata. <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />Nyɛy náá: «Djɛka dɔɔ nɛ mam pe mɛbwala mɛ tak, etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ mɛ aagheekɛl mɛmbɔ kɔ lɔɔ ɔ, neebela Sisim na Dɛɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Tin, Pyɛɛd eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Beta náá, wɔy nɛ epata bɔ bi pulel, etɛɛ náá, wɔ gek ɛ́ náá, ɛkɛɛ ɛ Zɛɛb bɔmaa ɛ́ nɛ epata! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Wɔ tok nɛ ɛkɛɛ, wɔ aakobela-bɛlak di, tɔ tɛp'ak, etɛɛ náá, lyem'ɔ tok piki é mis ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Deenek, swoola embee esiiza bɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ djaala Ghɛŋ, nɛghu nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛpel embee esiiza ee wɔ di yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Etɛɛ náá, mɛ eebee náá, lyem'ɔ ɛ́ tɔɔɔ nɛ embee esesɛɛ, é di'enek, wɔ moo ɛ́ kwom mesyem.» <verse eid="ACT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Tin, Simɔŋ eezɛke nɛ Pyɛɛd bɛ Zaŋ náá: «Biyɔ bɛmet djaalaka Ghɛŋ étɛp'am, etɛɛ náá, sa bi ke ɛ́ needi ààsael nɛ nam.» <verse eid="ACT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Bhii bot ɛ lwoma bɛbá nazebaŋa bot etɛp binek nɛ ɛgoola mɛkpa ɛ Ghɛŋ ɛ, tin bɛ eezɛsik pɛ Yeluzalɛm. Ze ɛ ze bɛ nadi egoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal pɛ kɔ bɛtɛ nɛ mɛl mɛ kyee dik Samaali.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filip eeboma nɛ dhiiti boo kukuma dik Etsopi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Dhiiti fofop ɛ Ghɛŋ eezɛke nɛ Filip náá: «Wyɛla, da wɔ ɛ́ tɔ́ pɛ kyɛ bɔs, pɛ ze di edus pɛ Yeluzalɛm etɔ́ pɛ dɛl ɛ Ghaaza ɛ, ze di edhaa tɔ bal ɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />É di tak wat, Filip eezɛghɛɛ nyel, tɔ́. Tin, é ze, dhiiti mot eezɛtuula, mot tak nabɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ di ààbɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛba mɛba ɔ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ mot kyee dik Etsopi. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ boo kukuma, mɛsa mɛ nabɛ ɛ́, ɛbaal epata nɛ esa djas ɛ Kandase, moma di mɛkoozi mɛ Etsopi ɔ. Nyɛ nazyɛ pɛ Yeluzalɛm étɛp ɛzɛduwal Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Tin, nyɛ nadi esik pɛ dɛl ɛ lɛ. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́ ndiindel kɔ mbem yaaga, nyɛ nadi elaa mɛkana mɛ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Ezayi. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Tin, Sisim na Dɛɛ eezɛke nɛ Filip náá: «Tɔ́a pɛ kyee mbem yaaga di'enek.» <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Tin, Filip eezɛtɔ́ kaab pɛ mot tak nadi ɛ, nyɛ kagwak ɛ́ mot'enɔk elaa mɛkana mɛ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Ezayi. Filip eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Wɔ nɛ gu sa mɛkpa mɛ wɔ di elaŋ'enek, di ekwyɛl ɛlɛɛ?» <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Mot'enɔk eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Mɛ aagu yɛ dáa, mot ɛ di ààlyaal mɛ ɔɔ?» <figure style="fig" alt="Philippe et le chef qui travaillait chez Candace reine d’Éthiopie" file="lb00331c.tif" size="col" loc="8.31" copy="Louise Bass" ref="8.31">Filip bɛ nɛ kukuma nadi esa mɛsa pɛ daa Kandase, moma di mɛkoozi mɛ Etsopi ɔ</figure></para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:31">Tin, nyɛ eezɛdjóo Filip nyɛ eezɛdisi é ngwoob'ɛ kɔ mbem yaaga. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Pes Ekwyala e Zɛɛb nyɛ nadi elaŋ ɛ, nabɛ ɛ́ yak:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">«Nyɛ nadi ɛ́ dáa mɔn bhata di etɔ́aa nɛ nɛ kɛtsakaa ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">dáa mɔɔ bhata di ààtsim sok bhwoob bot ɛ di etsik nyɛ mya ɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">Nyɛy nɛ nuub ndiila.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Nyɛ naadhuselaa, ààbɛ nɛ mot kɛm nyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Ɛzɛ aakwak ɛlii kɔ ɛsu ɛ bɛdha bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Etɛɛ náá, bɛ naadis bim mɛlu mɛ tsik'ɛ kɔ bɔs<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.33 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:7-8">Eza 53.7-8</ref></char></char></note>.»<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Tin, kukuma yenɔk ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ Filip náá: «Mɛ ɛpedjaala nɛ nɔ, lɛɛa mɛ, kɔ ɛsu ɛzɛ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb di elii deenek? Nyɛ lii ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ met ohoo, nɛghu kɔ ɛsu ɛ mot sis?» <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />É di'enek, Filip eekan ɛlii nɛ nɛ dum nɛ pes mɛkpa mɛ Ekwyala e Zɛɛb nyɛ laŋ ɛ, nyɛ moo tin egoola nyɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Yezu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Bɛ eezɛgoola tɔ́, ze bɛ nadi etɔ́ yɔbɔ ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛkum é dhiiti di nadi nɛ dii ɔ. Deenek, kukuma yenɔk eezɛke náá: «Beea mɛdii, ɛyé di elu náá, mɛ duwa Zɛɛb?» [ <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Filip eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ myaal nɛ lyem'ɔ djas ɔɔ, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛ duwa Zɛɛb.» Tin, mot'enɔk eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Mɛ eemyaal náá, Yezu ɛ́ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb.»] <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />É di'enek, nyɛ eezɛke náá, mbem yaaga tyaa, bhii tak, bɛ nɛ Filip eezɛsul tɔ dii, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛduu nyɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Dáa bɛ nakasɛɛ tɔ dii ɛ, Sisim ɛ Ghɛŋ eezɛdis Filip é mis mɛ kukuma tak, nyɛ moo tin, ààkabee Filip. É di'enek nyɛ eezɛkpaa, tɔ́ yɛ pɛ pak nyɛ nadi etɔ́ ɛ, nɛ boo mɛmyaala. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Filip kakɛtuula yɛ ɛ́ pɛ dɛl ɛ di edjóoaa Azɔt ɛ, nyɛ moo tin etɔ́ kɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal, kɔ mɛl djas nyɛ nadi edhaŋ ɛ́, kɛkum pɛ ghaada Sezaale.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Ɛliig ɛ lyem ɛ Sɔl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />É ghɛŋ tak, mɛsa mɛ Sɔl nabɛ ɛ́, ɛtiig nɛ ɛwun ɛ ɛgó ɛ bɛdjekel ɛ Ghɛŋ. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛtɔ́ kɛbee boo ghaa-Zɛɛb, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛwaab mɛkana mɛ di edjɛ nyɛ ze, náá, nyɛ neekɛbee mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda di pɛ ghaada Dhamas ɛ. Nyɛ nasa deenek ɛ́, nɛghu nyɛ waabela boa nɛ botom ɛ di edu Ze ɛ Ghɛŋ ɔ, étɛp nyɛ neemɛt bɛ, da nyɛ ɛ́ sik nɛ nɔɔ kɔɔla pɛ Yeluzalɛm. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Dáa nyɛ nadi nyɛ dinaa é ze nyɛy etɔ́ ɛ, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nyɛ moo ekunaa nɛ ghaada Dhamas, kasɛka ɛ́, dhiiti ngel eezɛdus tɔ gwoo, mɛkas mɛ tak eezɛbutal nyɛ.<figure style="fig" alt="Saul rencontre Jésus sur la route de Damas" file="WA03960b.tif" size="span" loc="9.3" copy="Graham Wade" ref="9.3">Sɔl eeboma nɛ Yezu é ze ghaada Dhamas</figure><verse eid="ACT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛduma si, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛgwak gwood wat eke nɛ nɛ náá: «Sɔl, Sɔl, étɛp yé wɔ di etiig mɛ?» <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Nyɛ eezɛdji náá: «Wɔy ɛzɛ, Ghɛŋ?» Tin gwood yenek eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ mam Yezu mot wɔ di etiig ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Deenek, wyɛla, da wɔ ɛ́ ni tɔ ghaada, tin bɛ waalɛɛ wɔ sa wɔ di egoka nɛ ɛsa ɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Bot ɛ nadi ekɛ sama wat nɛ Sɔl ɔ zokazɛtyaa, ààlóo ɛkpa ɛ wat. Bɛ nadi egwak gwood, tin ààbee mot. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Tin Sɔl eewyɛl, nyɛ eezɛbɛɛ mis, kabela ɛ́ náá, nyɛ ààkabee. Bɛ eezɛmɛt nyɛ é mbɔ, tɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ Dhamas. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Mɛlu mɛlɛl naadhaa, nyɛy ààkabee, tin nyɛ nadi ɛ́ ààdɛ edee nɛ mɛdii.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Pɛ kɔ ghaada Dhamas, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti djekel ngɔt din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Ananias. Ghɛŋ zokazɛtuula nyɛ tɔ sisim, nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Ananias!» Nyɛ eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Beea mɛ Ghɛŋ.» <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Ghɛŋ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Tɔ́a nenak yak, pɛ gba di edjóoaa “Piki” ɛ. Pɛ tɔ ndjaŋ ɛ Yudas, djia dhiiti mot dɛl ɛ Taalas, din ɛ lɛ ɛ́ Sɔl. É di mena di nenak'aak nyɛ ɛpedjaala Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Tin, tɔ sisim'ɛ nyɛ eebee dhiiti mot ngɔt din ɛ lɛ ɛ́ Ananias eni tɔ ndjaa étɛp ɛkɛl nyɛ mɛmbɔ, mis mɛ neebɛŋel-bɛŋela sis.» <verse eid="ACT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Ananias eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Ghɛŋ, bot ɛbuɛpe eedyeebalii nɛ nam kɔ ɛsu ɛ mot'ak, dum nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ embee etɛp ee nyɛ di esa, nɛ bot ɛ na dɛɛ bɔ pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Deenek, nyɛ zyɛ wak ɛ́ nɛ eghɛŋ ee boo ghaa-Zɛɛb nadjɛ nyɛ ɛ, étɛp ɛmɛt bot djas di edjaala nɛ din ɛ lɔ ɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Tin, Ghɛŋ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɛ náá: «Tɔ́a, etɛɛ náá, mɛ eetɔ mot'ak étɛp nyɛ neetɔ́ kɛgoola din ɛ lam pɛ daa bot ɛ membyak mɛ sis nɛ bɛmɛkoozi mɔɔ, zɛnɔɔ bot ɛ mbyak Yisalaɛl. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Mam mɛ ɛmet mɛ waalyaal nyɛ mezuk djas mɛ nyɛ aazuk kɔ ɛsu ɛ din ɛ lam ɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Tin, Ananias eezɛtɔ́. Nyɛ eezɛni tɔ ndjaa tak, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛkɛl Sɔl mɛmbɔ, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Sɔl, mɔn-nyaagam, Ghɛŋ Yezu mot tel wɔ nyel é gba pɛ ze wɔ di ezyɛ ɛ, lwom mɛ ɛ́, étɛp wɔ neebaazɛbee-beea sis, da wɔ ɛ́ lwoodel nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />É di tak wat, dhiiti mbi esonok tyee epapa eezɛkwyit é mis ɛ Sɔl, tin, nyɛ moo tin ebaazɛnyaasok. Nyɛ eezɛwyɛl, nyɛ eezɛduwa Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛdɛ edee, nyɛ eezɛbela ghwyil.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Sɔl ɛpegoola Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb pɛ Dhamas</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Sɔl zokazɛkpaa ba mɛlu é di wat bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel ɛ nadi pɛ Dhamas ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Ààkobɔya deenek, nyɛ moo tin egoola Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb pɛ tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda náá, Yezu ɛ́ Mɔn ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Bot ɛ nadi egwak nyɛ djas ɔ, nadi edjoka, tin, bɛ ɛ́ boodi edji náá: «Ye tok mot'ak nadi etiig ɛlyelɛpe bot ɛ nadi etuwal din ɛ Yezu pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɔ? Wɔ ke ɛ́ náá, nyɛ aazyɛ wak ɛ étɛp ɛzɛmet bɛ, nyɛ neesik nɛ nɔɔ pɛ daa boo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb é?» <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Tin, mɛlu djas, Sɔl nadi ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel dhaa tyɛ é ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal nɛ ghwyil djas. Tɔ mbi mɛlyo mɛ, nyɛ nadi elyaal popoopwon nɛ Eyuda ee nadidi pɛ Dhamas ɔ, náá Yezu ɛ́ Mɛsia, tin bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkabaabɛ nɛ ɛkpa ɛbɔɔza nyɛ.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Ba mɛlu bhii tak, wɔ gwaa eYuda djas zokagwakel étɛp bɛ neegó Sɔl. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Tin, Sɔl eezɛgu boob'ɔɔ. Bɛ nadi ebaal mɛbɛ mɛ ɛniel ɛ ghaada ɛ́ mwos nɛ pum, étɛp bɛ neegó nyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Tin, é pum, wɔ gwaa, bɛdjekel bɛ zokanɔɔ nyɛ, tɔ́ nɛ nɛ, étɛp ɛkwyɛɛg nyɛ pɛ yii kyee peeb ghaada tɔ djhan.<figure style="fig" alt="Les disciples ont sorti Paul hors du mur du village dans une corbeille" file="WA03999b.tif" size="col" loc="9.25" copy="Graham Wade" ref="9.25">Bɛdjekel eewisal Pɔl bhii peeb dɛl tɔ djhan</figure><verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sɔl pɛ Yeluzalɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Dáa nyɛ nakum pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ, wɔ gwaa, Sɔl zokazɛgek ɛsɛɛga bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel. Bɔɔ djas nadi ɛ́ nɛ bwoo, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi emyaal ɛnyɔɛpe náá, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ djekel nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Tin, Bhaanabhas ɛ́ boozɛnɔɔ nyɛ, tɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ daa bot ɛ lwoma. Nyɛ eezɛbaŋa bɛ dáa Sɔl naboma nɛ Ghɛŋ é ze ɛ, nɛ dáa Ghɛŋ nalii nɛ nɛ ɛ. Nyɛ eebaazɛlɛɛ bɛ mbi ɛbwaalel ɛ Sɔl nadi nɛ yɛ, étɛp ɛlyo bot nɛ din ɛ Yezu pɛ Dhamas ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Kana ɛwala ɛlenek, Sɔl ɛ́ boozɛdi bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ. Nyɛ nadi ekɛ pɛ tɔ Yeluzalɛm djas, é ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal nɛ ɛbwaalel djas nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Nyɛ nadi elii nɛ eYuda ee di elii lii Ghɛlɛk ɔ, nyɛ nadi esuu mɛso bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ, ghuna bɔɔ nadi esaŋ ɛ́, ɛgó ɛ nyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Dáa bɔn-nyɛɛg nagwak náá, bɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛgó nyɛ ɛ, bɛ eezɛtɔ́ nɛ Sɔl pɛ ghaada Sezaale, étɛp bɛ neekɛkyeed nyɛ pɛ ghaada Taalas.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Zɛɛga bot ɛ mendjaala nadi ɛ́ tɔ egwyem kɔ kyee dik Yude, Ghalile nɛ Samaali djas ɔ. Bɛ nadi ɛ́ bɛ eezelyel tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, bɛ nadi ɛ́ tɔ tsik ɛgwak ɛ Ghɛŋ. Zɛɛga bot ɛ mendjaala nadi ebɔk, ɛbɔk nɛ ɛbɔk, etɛɛ náá, Sisim na Dɛɛ nadi ekwyee bɛ.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsik ɛ Ene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Pyɛɛd mot nadi kɔ kyee dik tak djas ɔ, zokazɛtɔ́ dhiiti dwoo pɛ daa bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, bɛ nadidi ɛ́ pɛ dɛl ɛ Lidha. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛbela dhiiti motom din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Ene. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ eesa membu mɛtɛn nɛ elɛl ndjaasi, etɛɛ náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nyɛ eezesɔɔb. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Pyɛɛd eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Ene, Yezu Klisto eetsik wɔ! Wyɛla da wɔ ɛ́ koobal goŋ'ɔ.» Kasɛka ɛ́, Ene eezɛwyɛl. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Bot ɛ ghaada Lidha djas nɛ bot ɛ bal Saalɔn naabee nyɛ, wɔ gwaa bɛ zokaliig elyem, du Ghɛŋ.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛgom ɛ Dhɔɔlekas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Pɛ kɔ dɛl ɛ Zafa, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti moma nadi edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ «<char style="sc">Tabita</char>» din ɛ tak kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ tɔ lii Ghɛlɛk ɛ́ «Dhɔɔlekas», ɛsuk ɛ tak lɛɛ ɛ́ «kwyee». Mɛlu djas mɛsa mɛ nabɛ ɛ́, ɛsa enɛm esa, nɛ ɛkwyee ɛ bɛdjel ɛ bot. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />É ghɛŋ tak wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛbɛ́, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛgwyɛ. Bhii bɛ nagwyii muu ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ kɛnɛɛg yɛ tɔ dhɛŋ, pɛ ɛko tɔ ndjaa. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Bɛdjekel ɛ nadi pɛ Zafa ɔ, naagwak náá, Pyɛɛd nadi ɛ́ pɛ Lidha, ye nadi ɛ́ ɛkunaaɛpe nɛ Zafa. Bɛ eezɛkyeed bot ɛbá nɛ bhaadal yak: «Bis eedjaala nɛ nɔ, lela ɛzyɛ kaab pɛ yesɔ.» <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />É di tak wat Pyɛɛd eezɛghɛɛ nyel tɔ́ bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ. Dáa bɛ nakum ɛ, bɛ eezɛdul nyɛ tɔ dhɛŋ, pɛ ɛko tɔ ndjaa. Bɛkus ɛ boa djas eezɛtiila pɛ daa lɛ nɛ mɛgwyɛ, bɛ moo tin elyaal nyɛ ekuwa nɛ endjookuwa ee Tabita nalat é sok nyɛ nadi nyɛ dinaa nɛ tsik ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Pyɛɛd eezɛwyisal bot djas pɛ kel, é di'enek, nyɛ eezɛkwyit mɛboŋ si edjaala. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛliigel pɛ muu nadi ɛ́, nyɛ eezɛke náá: «Tabita wyɛla!» Tabita eezɛbɛɛ mis, tin, dáa nyɛ nabee Pyɛɛd ɛ, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel disi. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Pyɛɛd eezɛmɛt nyɛ é mbɔ étɛp ɛkwyee nyɛ, nyɛ neewyɛl. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛdjóo bot ɛ di dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ nɛ bɛkus ɛ boa, nyɛ eezɛtel bɛ nwyak, nyɛy nɛ tsik. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Wɔ gwaa, bot ɛ ghaada Zafa djas zokagwak menduk mɛ tak, é di'enek, bot ɛbuɛpe naazɛdum koŋ nɛ Ghɛŋ. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Pyɛɛd zokadi kɔ Zafa bɛtɛ nɛ mɛlu pɛ daa dhiiti mot nadi esa mɛsa mɛ ekwood e bɛtit ɔ. Din ɛ mot tak nabɛ ɛ́ Simɔŋ.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Pyɛɛd eedjóoaa pɛ daa Kɔɔdnɛy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Pɛ ghaada Sezaale, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mot din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Kɔɔdnɛy, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ kukuma tɔ lɔɔg esodja bot ɛ Lɔm di edjóoaa: «Mwaka esodja bot ɛ Itali» ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Mot tak nabɛ ɛ́ sosoob, dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ mɛbyel mɛ djas. Nyɛ nadi ezezyɛ zɛɛga mendjaala mɛ bot nadi eduwal Zɛɛb ɛ. Nyɛ nadi ekwye-kwyee bɛdjel ɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda nɛ lyem wat, nyɛ naadjedjaala Zɛɛb é mɛwala djas. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Bhii kuku dwoo, é ɛwala ɛ elɛl, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zokazɛbee tɔ sisim. Nyɛ naabee popoopwon fofop ɛ Zɛɛb ngɔt eeni pɛ daa lɛ, nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Kɔɔdnɛy!» <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Nyɛ eezɛgwyák fofop nɛ lyem bwoo, bhii tak, nyɛ eeke nɛ nɛ náá: «Ɛyé Ghɛŋ?» Fofop eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Zɛɛb eegwak mendjaala mɔ, nɛ ghwyikwyee wɔ di ekwyee bɛdjel ɛ bot ɛ, nyɛ ààpadjisa wɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Tinaak, kyeeda bot pɛ Zafa bɛ neekɛdjóo dhiiti mot nɛ din ɛ Simɔŋ, di ebaadjóoaa Pyɛɛd ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Nyɛ di ɛ́ pɛ daa dhiiti mot di esa mɛsa mɛ ekwood bɛtit ɔ, din ɛ lɛ ɛ́ Simɔŋ, ndjaŋ'ɛ ɛ́ é ɛboŋ ɛ boo dii mɛsɔn.» <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Dáa fofop nadi elii nɛ nɛ natɔ́ ɛ, Kɔɔdnɛy eezɛdjóo bot ɛ mɛsa mɛ bɛbá, zɛnɔɔ ngɔt nadi eduwal Zɛɛb tɔ esodja nadi esa mɛsa pɛ daa lɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Nyɛ eezɛbaŋa bɛ etɛp ee nadhaŋ ɛ djas, bhii tak nyɛ eezɛlwom bɛ pɛ Zafa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Djɛmɛn tak, bɔɔ é ze, bɛ moo ekunaa nɛ Zafa, Pyɛɛd eezɛbyet kɔ ɛko ɛ ndjaa, kuku mwos, kɛdjaala Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Tin, za eezɛsa nyɛ. Dáa bɛ nadi edjaab nyɛ edee ɛ, nyɛ eezɛbee etɛp tɔ sisim. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Zɛɛb eezɛbɛɛ nyɛ mis, nyɛ kabee ɛ́, gwoo eebɛŋel, dhiiti sonok eesul pɛ kyee nyɛ nadi ɛ: Ye nabɛ ɛ́ dhiiti sonok tyee boo pes lɛmbɛ, mɛta é mɛlɔ mɛ tak ená, esul é bɔs. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Tɔ tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɛtit ɛ di ekɛ nɛ mɛko mɛná ɔ, bɛtit ɛ di nɛ epapa ɔ, nɛ membi me enen djas. <figure style="fig" alt="Pierre a fait un rêve de manger des animaux impures" file="45_Acts10.11-12_Peter'sVision-UncleanAnimals.tif" size="span" loc="10.12" copy="Gordon Thompson" ref="10.12">Pyɛɛd eedjem dhyam ɛ dɛ ɛ bɛtit ɛ di nɛ edhuud ɔ</figure><verse eid="ACT 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Dhiiti gwood eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Wyɛla, Pyɛɛd, góa, da wɔ ɛ́ dɛ!» <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Tin, Pyɛɛd eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Hooo ààbɛ! Ghɛŋ, etɛɛ náá, mɛ dinaa ààpakodɛ sok sa di tɔ etsi e mbyak eYuda ɛ, nɛ sa di nɛ edhuud ɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Gwood'enek eebaazɛgék-géka sis, eke náá: «Nàbee edhuud kɔ sa Zɛɛb ke náá, yɛ ɛ́ dɛɛ ɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Ye naasael deenek tyee esok elɛl, bhii tak, sonok tak eezɛbyet tɔ gwoo.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Tin, Pyɛɛd moo zɛdji sa sisim tak nadi ekwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ. Ghuna, é ɛwala ɛ tak ɛ, bot ɛ Kɔɔdnɛy nalwom ɔ, nadi edji bot étɛp bɛ neegu ndjaa Simɔŋ nadi tɔ tak ɛ. Ye kabela ɛ́ bɛ moo é ɛniel ɛ peeb. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Bɛ eezɛdjóo, bhii tak, bɛ eezɛdji náá: «Simɔŋ, mot di baadjóoaa Pyɛɛd ɔ, di ɛ́ wak é?» <verse eid="ACT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Ye nabela ɛ́, Pyɛɛd dinaa kuku esiiza dum nɛ sisim nyɛ nabee ɛ. É di'enek Sisim na Dɛɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Gwaka, bot ɛlɛl ɛpesaa wɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Wyɛla, sula, da wɔ ɛ́ tɔ́ bi nɛ bɛnɔɔ, sa wɔ ààbem ba, etɛɛ náá, yɛ ɛ́ mam ɛ lwom bɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Pyɛɛd eezɛsul pɛ bot ɛ tak nadi ɛ́, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mot bi di ɛsaŋ ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ mam. Bi zyɛ étɛp yé?» <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ Kɔɔdnɛy, kukuma tɔ lɔɔg esodja bot ɛ Lɔm ɛ lwom bis. Nyɛ ɛ́ mot epiki, nyɛ nɛ duwal Zɛɛb, zɛbela náá, eYuda djas nɛ kwyɛl nyɛ. Fofop ɛ Zɛɛb ngɔt lwom nyɛ ɛ́, nyɛ lɛɛ wɔ náá, wɔ tɔ́ pɛ daa lɛ étɛp wɔ neekɛlɛɛ nyɛ lɛŋ wɔ di nɛ yɛ ɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Tin, Pyɛɛd eezɛniigal bɛ tɔ ndjaa, bhii tak nyɛ eezɛdjɛ bɛ edi e mendjɛk.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Tɔ mɛlem, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ, bɛdhiiti bɔn-nyɛɛg tɔ mendjaala tɔ ghaada Zafa, zokatɔ́ sama wat nɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Bhii ɛlu ɛ tak, bɛ eezɛkum pɛ Sezaale. Kɔɔdnɛy nadi ebwood bɛ, nyɛy, bɛ nɛ bot ɛ mɛbyel mɛ, nɛ bɛsɔ bɛ nyɛ nadjóo ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Dáa Pyɛɛd nadi nyɛ moo ekwyɛl ɛni ɛ, Kɔɔdnɛy eezɛboma nɛ nɛ. Tin, nyɛ eezɛmalal, étɛp nyɛ neeswos nyɛ nɛ duu. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Tin, Pyɛɛd eezɛwyɛl nyɛ, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Wyɛla, etɛɛ náá, mam pe, mɛ ɛ́ mot dáa wɔy.» <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Tin, bɔɔ kuku elɛŋ bɛ nɛ Kɔɔdnɛy, nyɛ eezɛni pɛ tɔ ndjaa, é di zukamwaa nɛ mot nazesɛɛga ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />É di'enek, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi nɛ gu náá, mot mbyak eYuda ààgoka nɛ ɛbeya ɛsɔ, nɛghu, ɛtɔ́ tɔ mendjaa mɛ bot ɛ membyak mɛ sis e! Deenek, Zɛɛb eelyaal mɛ náá, yɛ ààgoka náá, mɛ bee mot dáa mot edhuud, nɛghu dáa mot di ààgoka náá, bot tɔ́ pɛ daa lɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, dáa bi djóo mɛ ɛ, mɛ ɛ́ boozyɛ ààbyen. Mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ mɛ gu tɛp bi djóo mɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Kɔɔdnɛy eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Ye moo mos ɛ́ nɛ mɛlu mɛlɛl, é ɛwala ɛlak wat, é ɛwala elɛl bhii kuku dwoo, mɛ nadi edjaala Zɛɛb pɛ ndjaŋ'am. Kasɛka é di tak wat ɛ, dhiiti mot nɛ ekaad ee na kas-kas eezɛtuula sok bhwoob'am. <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />Tin, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nam náá: “Kɔɔdnɛy, Zɛɛb eegwak mendjaala mɔ, nyɛ eesiiza ghwyikwyee yɔ dum nɛ bɛdjel ɛ bot. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Kyeeda bot pɛ Zafa, étɛp bɛ neekɛdjóo Simɔŋ, di baadjóoaa Pyɛɛd ɔ. Nyɛ di ɛ́ pɛ daa dhiiti mot din ɛ lɛ Simɔŋ, nyɛ sa ɛ́ mɛsa mɛ ekwood bɛtit, ndjaŋ'ɛ é ɛboŋ ɛ boo dii mɛsɔn.” <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />É di tak ɛ, mɛ leelwom bot, bɛ kɛ ɛsaa wɔ, tin, wɔ eemyaal ɛzyɛ. Nenak, bisɔ djas bis ɛ́ wak é mis ɛ Zɛɛb, étɛp bis neegwak etɛp ee Ghɛŋ lwom wɔ, wɔ zyɛ zɛlɛɛ bis ɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lɛŋ ɛ Pyɛɛd pɛ daa Kɔɔdnɛy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Pyɛɛd eezɛkan ɛlii nyɛy náá: «Nenak, mɛ eezegu nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, Zɛɛb kwyɛɛg bot djas ɛ́ tyee wat. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Deenek, nyɛ kwyɛl ɛ́ bot djas, ye nakoozodi bot ɛ membyak mɛ sis, zuka nɛ tak ɛ́ náá, mot di eduwal nyɛ, nɛ ɛkɛ tɔ epiki. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Tin, Zɛɛb naakyeed bhaadal yɛ pɛ daa bot ɛ mbyak Yisalaɛl. Mbɛɛ Bhaadal tak ɛ́ egwyem nɛ Yezu Klisto mot di Ghɛŋ bot djas ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Bi nɛ gu sa napookodhaa sok pɛ Ghalile ɛ, bhii tak pɛ kɔ kyee dik Yude djas, Zaŋ naatuud náá: “Duwaka Zɛɛb!” <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Bi nɛ gu dáa nyɛ naasɛ́ɛ Yezu mot Nazalɛt nɛ ghwyil Sisim na Dɛɛ ɛ. Bi nɛ baagu dáa Yezu nadi ekɛ kɔ bɔs é ɛsa enɛm esa, nɛ ɛtsik ɛ bot djas nadi si bhel dim mot mɛkɔŋ ɔ. Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb nadi egyee nɛ nɛ lɔɔg wat. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Tin, bis ɛ́ bɛtyaasɛs e etɛp ee nyɛ nasa pɛ kyee dik eYuda nɛ pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ. Bɛ naagó nyɛ, bem nyɛ kɔ mɛlaaba. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Deenek, Zɛɛb eebulal nyɛ tsik é ɛlu ɛ elɛl bhis ɛsyee. Nyɛ eedjɛ nyɛ ghwyil ɛtel bot nyel, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />ààkabɛ nɛ bot djas, nyɛ nazotel ɛ́ nɛ bisɔ bot ɛ Zɛɛb naloozesɛ́ɛ náá, bis di bɛtyaasɛs ɔ. Bis naadɛ edee nɛ mɛdii é di wat, bhii Zɛɛb nagomal nyɛ bhis ɛsyee ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Nyɛ lwom bis ɛ́, bis goola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal pɛ daa bot, nɛ ɛlyaal náá, yɛ ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ di mot Zɛɛb nasɛ́ɛ étɛp nyɛ neepɛ́ɛ bot ɛ di nɛ tsik nɛ bot ɛ nazegwyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb djas naalii kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ, bɔɔ náá, mot aadum koŋ nɛ nɛ ɔ waabela ɛpelak ɛ mesyem mɛ, nɛ ghwyil din ɛ lɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, eebela Sisim na Dɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Bela náá, Pyɛɛd nadi ɛ́, nyɛ dinaa elii, Sisim na Dɛɛ eezɛsul kɔ bot ɛ nadi egwak etɛp ee nyɛ nadi elii ɛ djas. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Bot ɛ mbyak eYuda, di dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, nazyɛ bɛ nɛ Pyɛɛd ɔ, naadyeebadjoka ɛbuɛpe. Etɛɛ náá, bɛ nabee náá, Sisim na Dɛɛ Zɛɛb nadjɛ ɛ naasul dɔɔ nɛ kɔ bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Etɛɛ náá, bɛ nadi egwak bɛ elii tɔ elii membyak mɛ sis, nɛ ɛduwal ɛ́ mɛnyɔ ɛ Zɛɛb. Tin, Pyɛɛd ɛ boozɛke náá: <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />«Mena ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛlu bot bak nenak náá, bɛ naduwa Zɛɛb tɔ mɛdii, dáa bɛ di náá, bɛ eebela Sisim na Dɛɛ dáa menabɛlka ɛ?» <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Tin, wɔ gwaa nyɛ zɛlwom náá, bɛ duu bɛ Zɛɛb nɛ din ɛ Yezu Klisto. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá, nyɛ kwyɛɛg ba mɛlu bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Taŋal ɛ Pyɛɛd sok bhwoob bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala pɛ Yeluzalɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Bot ɛ lwoma nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg bɔɔ nadi pɛ kyee dik Yude ɔ, naazɛgwak náá, bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ naamyaal pe Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Dáa Pyɛɛd nasik pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ, bot ɛ mbyak eYuda nadum koŋ nɛ Yezu ɔ, moo tin ebyak nyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />Bɔɔ náá: «Wɔ eeni tɔ ndjaa ezibo, wɔ eekɛdɛ edee bi nɛ bɛnɔɔ!» <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Tin, Pyɛɛd ɛ́ boozɛbaŋa bɛ popoopwon etɛp ee nadhaŋ ɛ djas. Nyɛ nalɛɛ ɛ́ náá: <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />«Mɛ nadi ɛ́ pɛ tɔ ghaada Zafa, mɛ nadi edjaala, é di tak mɛ eezɛbee tɔ sisim, dhiiti sonok esul pɛ kyee mɛ nadi ɛ. Sonok tak nadi enɔŋel nɛ boo pes lɛmbɛ, mɛta é mɛlɔ mɛ tak ená, yɛ nadi edus tɔ gwoo, sul é bɔs, zɛkum pɛ mɛ nadi ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Mɛ eezɛgwyák tɔ tak piii, mɛ kabee ɛ́, bɛtit ɛ di ekɛ nɛ mɛko mɛná ɔ, bɛtit ɛ dik, nɛ bɛtit ɛ di nɛ epapa ɔ, zɛnɔɔ enen. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Wɔ gwaa, mɛ zɛgwak gwood wat eke nɛ nam náá: “Wyɛla, Pyɛɛd, góa, da wɔ ɛ́ dɛ!” <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Tin, mɛ eezɛbɔɔza náá: “Hooo ààbɛ! Ghɛŋ, etɛɛ náá, mɛ dinaa ààpakodɛ sok sa di tɔ etsi e mbyak eYuda ɛ, nɛ sa di nɛ edhuud ɛ dinaa ààpakɛ tɔ nuub'am.” <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Tinaak, gwood'enek eebaazɛgék-géka sis, eke tɔ gwoo náá: “Nàbeea edhuud sa Zɛɛb ke náá, yɛ ɛ́ dɛɛ ɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Yɛ naasael deenek tyee esok elɛl, bhii tak sonok tak eezɛbyet tɔ gwoo. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Tin, é ɛwala ɛ tak wat, wɔ gwaa, bot ɛlɛl zokazɛkum pɛ ndjaa mɛ nadi ɛ. Bɛ nadus ɛ́ pɛ ghaada Sezaale, bɛ nadi esaa pɛ mɛ nadi edi ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Sisim na Dɛɛ eezɛke nɛ nam náá, mɛ tɔ́ bis nɛ bɛnɔɔ, sa mɛ ààbem ba. Deenek, bɔn-nyɛɛg bam bɛtɛn nɛ wat mɛ nazyɛ nɛ nɔɔ wak ɛ, bɛ naakɛkyeed mɛ pɛ Sezaale. Bisɔ djas, bis bɛ ɛ́, bis eeni tɔ ndjaŋ ɛ Kɔɔdnɛy. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Kɔɔdnɛy eezɛkaada bis dáa nyɛ nabee fofop tetel tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ, elɛɛ nyɛ náá: “Kyeeda bot pɛ Zafa, étɛp bɛ neekɛdjóo Simɔŋ di ebaadjóoaa Pyɛɛd ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Mot tak ɛ́ waalɛɛ wɔ mɛkpa mɛ di náá, wɔy nɛ bot ɛ mɛbyel mɔ djas ɛ, waabela tsik nɛ yɛ ɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Tin, dáa mɛ nadi mɛ moo ekan ɛlii ɛ, wɔ gwaa, Sisim na Dɛɛ zɛsul kɔ lɔɔ, dáa ye nasul kɔ les é mɛkɛn ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Tin, mɛ eezɛtaala sa Ghɛŋ nalɛɛ ɛ: “Zaŋ naduu bot Zɛɛb ɛ́ tɔ mɛdii, yɛ kabɛ biyɔ ɔɔ, bi aaduwaa Zɛɛb ɛ́ tɔ ghwyil Sisim na Dɛɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ Zɛɛb nadjɛ bɛ mbi ɛkɛɛ ɛ tak wat, nyɛ nadjɛ mena, é ghɛŋ mena nadumka koŋ nɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu Klisto ɛ. Mam nadi zɛ, étɛp mɛ neekɛla etɛp ee Zɛɛb di esa ɛ?» <verse eid="ACT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Bhii bɛ nagwak etɛp binek djas ɛ, elyem bɔɔ djas eezɛsila, bɛ moo tin eduwal Zɛɛb eke náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, Zɛɛb eebaadjɛ pe bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, ghwyil ɛswoola mɛfulu mɔɔ, nɛ yii ɛbela tɛtɛ tsik.»<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zɛɛga mendjaala mɛ bot ɛ ghaada Antiɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Bhis Etiɛn nagóaa ɛ, bot ɛ nadi edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, naadyeebatiigaa, ye naasa náá, bɛ wyɛɛza. Bɛdhiiti bot naatɔ́, batakɛkum pɛ kyee dik Fenisi, pɛ ghola Siipɛlɛ, nɛ pɛ boo ghaada Antiɔs. Bela náá, bɛ nazogegoola Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, pɛ daa bot ɛ mbyak eYuda. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Bela náá, bɛdhiiti bot ɛ nadi edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, bot ɛ Siipɛlɛ nɛ Silɛn, naatɔ́ pɛ Antiɔs. Bɛ nadi elii nɛ bot ɛ membyak mɛ sis, é ɛgoola bɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Ghwyil ɛ Ghɛŋ nadi ɛ́ nɛ nɔɔ lɔɔg wat, ye naasa náá, zukamwaa nɛ mot swoola mɛfulu mɔɔ, da dum koŋ nɛ Ghɛŋ. <verse eid="ACT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala Yeluzalɛm naagwak menduk me tak. Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛlwom Bhaanabhas pɛ Antiɔs. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Dáa nyɛ nakum ɛ, tin, nyɛ eezɛbee dáa Zɛɛb nazesɛɛ bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ mɛtel ɛ, nyɛ eezɛmyaala. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛdjɛ bɛ mɛghaaz mɛ ɛwa lyem, étɛp bɛ neewa zii ɛdu ɛ Ghɛŋ tɔ esosoob. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Bhaanabhas nadi ɛ́ mbɛɛ mot, Sisim na Dɛɛ nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb tɔɔɔ tɔ lɛ. Tin, wɔ gwaa zukamwaa nɛ mot zokamyaal ɛdu ɛ Ghɛŋ.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Bhii tak, Bhaanabhas eezɛtɔ́ pɛ dɛl Taalas kɛsaa Sɔl. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Bhii nyɛ nakabela nyɛ ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ bootɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ Antiɔs. Tin, bɔɔ bɛbá naazɛdhaa tu mbu tɔ zɛɛga mendjaala mɛ tak. É di'enek, bɛ naalyo bot ɛbuɛpe dum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. Yɛ ɛ́ kɔ ghaada Antiɔs ɛ bɛdjekel nakan ɛdjóoaa sok «ekeletyɛ». <verse eid="ACT 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />É ghɛŋ tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb naazɛdus pɛ Yeluzalɛm tɔ́ pɛ Antiɔs. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Dhiiti pak'ɔɔ, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Aghabis, Sisim na Dɛɛ eepem nyɛ, nyɛ eezɛni é ɛlɛɛ náá, boo za moo aatuula kɔ bɔs djas. Bela náá, mbi za tak naasael é sok Kolood nadi mɛkoozi mɛ Lɔm ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Tin, bɛdjekel eezɛgwakel náá, mot nɛ mot ɛ́ waadjɛ yɛ ba bim nyɛ aabela ɛ, étɛp ɛkwyee bɔn-nyɛɛg bɔɔ nadi pɛ kyee dik Yude ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Bɛ nasa ɛ́ deenek, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zokakyeed esa binek pɛ daa bɛpaa ɛ eYuda, é mɛmbɔ ɛ Bhaanabhas bɛ nɛ Sɔl.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Zak eegóaa, Pyɛɛd eekɔɔlaa é membok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />É ghɛŋ tak, mɛkoozi Eelood Aghilipa moo tin etiig bɛdhiiti bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Nyɛy zokalwom bɛ, bɛ gó Zak mɔn-nyɛɛg ɛ Zaŋ nɛ pɛl. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Deenek, dáa nyɛ nabee náá, eYuda naakwyɛl yɛ ɛ, nyɛ eezɛlwom bɛ, bɛ mɛt Pyɛɛd é ghɛŋ ɛbyoŋ ɛ emapa ee di ààwaaa leviid ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Eelood eezɛlwom náá, bɛ mɛt nyɛ, da bɛ ɛ́ kɔɔl nyɛ é membok. Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ boodjɛ mɛsa mɛ ɛbaal ɛ nyɛ nɛ mɛdhuu mɛná mɛ esodja, é ɛdhuu ɛ wat, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ esodja ená. Nyɛ nadi egek ɛ́ náá, nyɛ neepɛ́ɛ nyɛ é mis mɛ bot bhis ɛbyoŋ ɛ Pak. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Tin, Pyɛɛd nadi ɛ́ kɔɔla tɔ ndjaa membok, deenek bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala nadi ewa zii tɔ ɛdjaala ɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɛlyelɛpe.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pyɛɛd eewyiselaa é membok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Bela náá, dáa Eelood nadi ekwyɛl ɛpɛ́ɛ nyɛ é mis mɛ bot ɛ, é pum, Pyɛɛd nadi ɛ́ egɔ́ pak esodja ebá. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ kɔɔla nɛ ekel e ghwooz ebá. Bɛmbaalel ɛ ndjaa membok nadi ɛ́ tin é edi bɔɔ, é ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa membok. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Kasɛka ɛ́, dhiiti fofop ɛ Ghɛŋ ngɔt eezɛtuula tin, tɔ dhɛŋ moo tin bweee nɛ mɛkas. Tin, fofop eezɛkwyɛt nyɛ é bhaaz, nyɛ eezɛdjem nyɛ, nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Lela ɛdjem, wyɛla!» Tin, wɔ gwaa ekel é ghwooz nyɛ nakɔɔlaa nɛ yɛ é mɛmbɔ ɛ, zokakwyit. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Tin, fofop eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Bɔta bhɛtɛ yɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ kɔl ekel e mɛpapa mɔ.» Pyɛɛd eezɛgwak nyɛ, bhii tak, fofop eebaazɛbil náá: «Bɔta ndjookuwa yɔ, da wɔ ɛ́ du mɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Wɔ gwaa, Pyɛɛd zɛwyis tɔ membok, nyɛ moo tin edu fofop. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààgek náá, etɛp ee fofop nadi esa ɛ, nabɛ ɛ́ etɛp e tsɛɛtsɛ. Nyɛ nagu ɛ́ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ tɔ dhyam. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Bɛ eezɛdhaa esum di e bɛmbaalel yii mɛkɛn, bhii tak yii bhɔɔba, bɛ eezɛkum pɛ ɛbɛ ɛ membok nasael nɛ ghwooz ɛ. Ɛbɛ ɛ tak tuula ɛ́ kɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ ɛ dɛl. Ɛbɛ ɛ tak zokazɛdiiel nyɛ ɛmet é mis mɔɔ. Bɛ eezɛwyis, tin, bɛ eezɛtiila é gba, é di tak wat, kasɛka ɛ́ fofop eezɛdiib nyɛ é mis. <verse eid="ACT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Tin, Pyɛɛd eezɛsiiza ɛnyɔɛpe sa nasael ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke náá: «Wak nenak mɛ moo bee náá, yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ. Ghɛŋ eedhis fofop'ɛ, nyɛ eepɛk mɛ si ghwyil ɛ Eelood, nɛ mezuk mɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda di ekwyɛl náá, mɛ bee ɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Dáa nyɛ nazegwyak di nyɛ nadi ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛtɔ́ pɛ ndjaŋ ɛ Maali, nyɛɛg ɛ Zaŋ, di ebaadjóoaa Malak ɔ. Tin, bɛtɛ nɛ bot naasɛɛga étɛp ɛdjaala Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Pyɛɛd eezɛdiig é ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa, tin, moma mɛsa ngɔt eezɛzyɛ, étɛp nyɛ neezɛdii ndjaa. Din ɛ moma tak nabɛ ɛ́ Lood. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Nyɛ eezɛgwyak gwood ɛ Pyɛɛd, nyɛ moo tin tɔ mɛmyaala. Ye waagoka ɛ́ náá, nyɛ dii ndjaa, tin, nyɛ ààpakadii ndjaa, nyɛy kasik ɛ́ kaab kɛlɛɛ bot tɔ ndjaa náá, Pyɛɛd ɛ́ pɛ kel. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ ɛpelyet e!» Tin, nyɛ eezɛbasal náá, yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ. É di'enek, bɛ eezɛke náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ fofop'ɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Tinaak, Pyɛɛd kuku ɛdiig ɛ́ ɛbɛ yenek, dáa bɛ nakazɛdii ndjaŋ ɛ, bɛ eezɛbee nyɛ, bɛ naadyeebadjoka ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Nyɛ eezɛlyak bɛ nɛ mbɔ náá, bɛ di gwyem. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛni elɛɛ bɛ, dáa Ghɛŋ nawyisal nyɛ é membok ɛ. Nyɛ eebaazɛke náá: «Lɛɛka Zak nɛ bɛdhiiti bɔn-nyɛɛg bina sa dhaŋ ɛ.» Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛwyis tɔ́ pɛ kyee sis. <verse eid="ACT 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Dáa mɛlem nakalem ɛ, esodja moo tin zɛm-zɛm pak'ɔɔ. Bɛ nadi edjinel pɛ pak Pyɛɛd natɔ́ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Eelood eezɛlwom bot náá, bɛ kɛnɔɔ nyɛ, tin, bɛ ààpakabela nyɛ. Bɛ eezɛdji bɛmbaalel ɛ ndjaa membok, tin, nyɛ boodjɛ bɛ ɛlee náá, bɛ gó bɛ. Bhii tak, Eelood eezɛtɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Yude pɛ Sezaale, penek nyɛ naasa ba bim mɛlu.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛsyee ɛ Eelood</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Eelood naadyeebakpaa lyem nɛ bot ɛ Tiid nɛ Sidɔn. Tin, bot ɛ tak ɛ́ boozɛgwakel náá, bɛ tɔ́ pɛ daa lɛ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ eegwakel nɛ Bhalastus, kukuma di esa mɛsa tɔ ndjaŋ mɛkoozi ɔ. Tin, bɛ eezɛtɔ́ kɛlɛɛ nɛ Eelood náá, ɛgwakel bula bɛ nɛ bot ɛ eghaada e tak, etɛɛ náá, edee ee bot binɔk nadi ededɛ ɛ, nadudus ɛ́ pɛ mɛl ɛ Eelood. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Dáa ye nakum dwoo tak ɛ, Eelood eezɛbɔt kaad mɛkoozi mɛ, nyɛ eezɛdisi kɔ bóó mɛkoozi mɛ. Tin, nyɛ eezɛni elii nɛ nɔɔ é mis mɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Mɛdhuu mɛ bot binɔk eezɛtsim náá, «Yɛ ɛ́ gwood dhiiti zɛɛb, ààkabɛ yii mot!» <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Tin, é di tak wat, wɔ gwaa, fofop ngɔt ɛ Ghɛŋ zokazɛdjɛ Eelood baka, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ naakwyɛl ɛnɔɔ duu di náá yɛ ɛ́ yii Zɛɛb ɛ. Elum zokazɛdɛ nyɛ nyel, nyɛy batagwyɛ.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Ghuna, Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nadi egoolaaa, ɛgoolel nɛ ɛgoolel. <verse eid="ACT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Yɛ kabɛ Bhaanabhas bɛ nɛ Sɔl ɔɔ, bhii bɛ nasilal lwomel yɔɔ pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ, bɛ eezɛsik, tin, bɛ katɔ́ ɛ́ nɛ Zaŋ, mot di ebaadjóoaa Malak ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Bhaanabhas bɛ nɛ Sɔl eezɛsɛ́ɛaa étɛp bɛ neetɔ́ é lwomel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Pɛ tɔ zɛɛga mendjaala Antiɔs, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ bɛlyoel, ye nabɛ ɛ́: Bhaanabhas, Simɛyɔŋ mot di ebaadjóoaa na «Dhɔɔ» ɔ, Lusius mot dɛl ɛ Silɛn, Manaɛn sɔ ɛ Eelood kana edhɔma, zɛnɔɔ Sɔl. É ghɛŋ tak, Eelood ɛ́ nadi ekɔk kɔ Ghalile. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Dhiiti dwoo, é ghɛŋ bɛ nadi tɔ mendjaala nɛ ɛtsi ɛ edee étɛp ɛduwal Ghɛŋ ɛ, Sisim na Dɛɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Sɛ́ɛka mɛ Bhaanabhas bɛ nɛ Sɔl, étɛp bɛ neekɛsa mɛsa mɛ mɛ nadjóo bɛ étɛp tak ɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />É di'enek, bhii bɛ nazedjaala nɛ ɛtsi ɛ edee ɛ, bɛ eezɛkɛl bɛ mɛmbɔ, bhii tak, bɛ eezɛbet bɛ, bɛ tɔ́.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhaanabhas bɛ nɛ Sɔl pɛ ghola Siipɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Dáa Sisim na Dɛɛ nalwom bɛ ɛ, bɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ ɛboŋ ɛ Selesi, pɛ bɛ nazɛni tɔ boo elɛɛd étɛp bɛ neetɔ́ pɛ ghola Siipɛlɛ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Dáa bɛ nakum pɛ dɛl Salamin ɛ, bɛ eezɛni é ɛgoola Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda. Bɛ nadi ɛ́ bɛ nɛ Zaŋ-Malak, étɛp nyɛ neegheekwyee-kwyee bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Bɛ naazɛkɛ kɔ ghola tak djas kɛkum pɛ dɛl Pafɔs. Penek, bɛ eezɛboma nɛ dhiiti mot mɛsimba mɛ ɛlyeeb, din ɛ lɛ ɛ́ Bhaal-Yezu, dhiiti mot mbyak eYuda nadi eke náá, nyɛ ɛ́ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Nyɛ nadidi ɛ́ pɛ daa kukuma dɛl, din ɛ lɛ ɛ́ Seedyus Polus, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ mot mɛtselal. Wɔ gwaa, mot tak zɛdjóo Bhaanabhas bɛ nɛ Sɔl, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛgwak Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Tin, mot mɛsimba mɛ ɛlyeeb, nadi edjóoaa Elimas tɔ lii eGhɛlɛk ɔ, eezɛni nɛ ɛsuu ɛ́ mɛso nɛ nɔɔ, nyɛ moo tin esaa náá, kukuma nàdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Tin, Sɔl mot nabaadi edjóoaa Pɔl ɔ, moo tin tɔɔɔ nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ, nyɛ eezɛgwyák nyɛ kpɛɛɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke náá: «Mot mɛkɔŋ nɛ embee esa, mɔn ɛ dim mot mɛkɔŋ, mot bhyen embɛɛ esesɛɛ djas! Wɔ aanàkwaabookat ɛlet ɛ́ mɛze ɛ Ghɛŋ é? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Nenak, gwaka: Ghɛŋ ɛ́ waadjɛ wɔ baka, wɔ waabɛ́ edhim, wɔ aanàkabaabee mɛkas mɛ gwyes é ba bim mɛlu.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">É di tak wat, mis ɛ Elimas eezɛdipel, nyɛ moo tin tɔ ghooghom: Nyɛ ɛ́ moo tin bako-bako eliigel é ɛgwyák é mengwoob djas, nyɛ nadi esaa mot, étɛp nyɛ neemɛt nyɛ é mbɔ, étɛp ɛlyaal ɛ nyɛ ze. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Dáa kukuma nabee sa nadhaŋ ɛ, nyɛ eezɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, etɛɛ náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ mɛlyo naadyeebakwyɛsa nyɛ tɔ lyem ɛbuɛpe.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl bɛ nɛ Bhaanabhas pɛ ghaada Antiɔs kɔ Pisidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Pɔl bɛ nɛ bot ɛ sama yɛ eezɛni tɔ boo elɛɛd pɛ Pafɔs, bhii tak, bɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ ghaada Panfili kɔ Pɛɛledje. É di'enek, Zaŋ-Malak ɛ́ boozɛlik bɛ, sik pɛ Yeluzalɛm. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Bɛ eezɛdus Pɛɛledje, goola tɔ́ pɛ ghaada Antiɔs kɔ Pisidi. Dwoo saba, bɛ naazɛni tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda, bɛ eezɛnɔɔ mɛnyel, disi. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Bhii bɛ zelaa tɔ mɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ yii bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, ekukuma e ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda ɛ́ boolwom bot, bɛ lɛɛ nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bɔn-nyɛɛg, bi ɛ di nɛ etɛp ɛlii nɛ bot ɛ zɛɛga étɛp bɛ neebela mɛghaaz nɛ zii ɔɔ, bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛlii nenak.» <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Tin, wɔ gwaa Pɔl zɛwyɛl, nyɛ eezɛsa dhiiti tseŋa nɛ mbɔ, bɛ di gwyem, nyɛ eezɛke náá: «Biyɔ bot ɛ Yisalaɛl, nɛ biyɔ bot ɛ zyɛ é mendjaala mena zɛdjaalaka Zɛɛb ɔ, gwakeka mɛ! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Zɛɛb bot ɛ mbyak Yisalaɛl naatɔ bɛbhaab bena. Nyɛ naasa náá, mɛtaŋ mɛ bot byet, é sok bɛ nadi é mɛdjoŋ pɛ Eziptɛ ɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ naazɛwyisal bɛ kɔ kyee dik tak nɛ ghwyil mɛbwala. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Nyɛ naadyeebamaad ebus bɔɔ, membu mɛkam-mɛná (40) bɔɔ tɔ kyee dik bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛsilal bot ɛ membyak mɛtɛn nɛ ebá pɛ kyee dik Kanan bhɛɛɛ. Nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ mɛdhik mɛ tak djɛ nɛ bot ɛ mbyak'ɛ, bɛ di bɛkum ɛ tak. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Deenek, ye naasa tyee membu bɛdhet-ɛná nɛ membu mɛkam-mɛtɛn (450).</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛdjɛ bɛbhaab bina bɛtetɛp, kɛkum é ɛlu ɛ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Samyɛl. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛwaab náá, Zɛɛb djɛ bɛmɛkoozi. Tin, Ghɛŋ ɛ́ boozɛdjɛ bɛ Sɔl mɔn Kis, mot mbyak Bhɛzamɛ. Sɔl tak naadi ɛ́ kukuma yɔɔ membu mɛkam-mɛná (40). <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Bhii nyɛ nakazɛbyen Sɔl ɛ, Zɛɛb ɛ́ boozɛdjɛ bɛ Dhavid, nyɛ di mɛkoozi mɔɔ. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ eeke kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ náá: “Mɛ eebela Dhavid mɔn Yese, mot tak ɛ́, mot lyem'am kwyɛl ɔ. Nyɛ waasa esa ee lyem'am di ekwyɛl ɛ djas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.22 <char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 8:5">Sm1 8.5</ref>,<ref loc="1SA 8:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 10:21">10.21</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 13:14">13.14</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:12">16.12</ref></char></char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Ngɔt tɔ bɛdha ɛ Dhavid nabɛ ɛ́ Yezu, mot Zɛɛb nadjɛ nyɛ di ɛdi ɛ Mɛtsik-bot étɛp mbyak Yisalaɛl ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ dáa nyɛ nakɛk ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Ɛsok nɛ Yezu nɛ zyɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, Zaŋ naagoola Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ membyak djas yii Yisalaɛl, etɛɛ náá, bɛ neeliig elyem bɔɔ, da bɛ ɛ́ duwa Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />É ghɛŋ Zaŋ nadi nyɛ moo pɛ ɛsik ɛ mɛsa mɛ ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ naake náá: “Bi gek náá, mam ɛ́ zɛ? Mam tok mot bi di ebwood ɔ. Tin, gwakeka: Nyɛ ɛpezyɛ bhii koŋ'am, bela tin náá, mam aanàkwaakobela-belak duu ɛmalal étɛp ɛkotii-tiiak ekel e ekoko bɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.25 <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:7">Mak 1.7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luk 3.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:20">Zaŋ 1.20</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 1:27">27</ref></char></char></note>”<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg, biyɔ bɛdha ɛ Abalaam, nɛ biyɔ bot ɛ zyɛ wak étɛp ɛzɛdjaala Zɛɛb ɔ: Yɛ ɛ́ nɛ menabɛlka djas ɛ Zɛɛb dhis bhaadal yak, étɛp ɛtsik ɛ́ mena. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, bot ɛ dɛl ɛ Yeluzalɛm nɛ ekukuma bɔɔ nabɛ ɛ́, ààgu mbi mot Yezu nadi ɛ. Bela náá, bɛ àànyɔ ɛgwak mɛkpa ɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb di elaŋaa dwoo esaba djas ɛ. Tin, bɛ naadjɛ Yezu epɛ́ɛ e ɛsyee, etɛɛ náá, mɛkpa menek neebela mɛsuk. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Baabela náá, bɛ nabɛ ààbela lo mɛsɔ mɛ nyɛ napɛ́ɛaa epɛ́ɛ e ɛsyee étɛp tak ɛ. Bɛ naake nɛ Pilat náá, nyɛ gó nyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Bhii bɛ nazesa etɛp djas ee Ekwyala ɛ Zɛɛb nalɛɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɛ, bɛ eezɛsil nyɛ kɔ mɛlaaba, bhii tak, bɛ eekɛnɛɛg nyɛ tɔ ɛvit. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Wɔ gwaa, Zɛɛb zɛgomal nyɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Mɛlu ɛbuɛpe Yezu nadi elyaal bot ɛ nadi egyee nɛ nɛ ɔ nyel, dusa pɛ Ghalile tɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm. Bot ɛ tak moo mos ɛ́ bɛtyaasɛs é mis mɛ bot ɛ mbyak Yisalaɛl. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Bisɔ bɛmet, bis ɛpezɛgoola bin Mbɛɛ Bhaadal. Mbɛɛ Bhaadal tak ɛ́ sa Zɛɛb nakɛk bɛbhaab binaka ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />Nyɛ nasa deenek ɛ́, kɔ ɛsu ɛ lenaka, menabɛlka bɛdha bɔɔ, nyɛ naagomal Yezu bhii ɛsyee. Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ tɔ mɛkana mɛ Mɛdjeeb ɛlaŋel ebá ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">«Yɛ ɛ́ wɔy ɛ di Mɔn'am,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">kana dwoo pan mos'ak, mɛ ɛ́ Soog.»<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Zɛɛb nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ eelɛɛ náá, nyɛ waagomal nyɛ bhis ɛsyee, étɛp nyɛ needi ààsik kɛbɔ tɔ ɛvit. Nyɛ nake ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">«Mɛ waasɛɛ bin tɛtɛ mɛtel mɛ e dɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">yii etsɛɛtsɛ mɛ nakɛk Dhavid ɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />«Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ nyɛ di ebaalɛɛ tɔ dhiiti Ekwyala náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">“Wɔ aanàkwaabet náá mot'ɔ na dɛɛ kɛsyep tɔ ɛvit<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.33-35 <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Mɛd 2.7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 55:3">Eza 55.3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 16:10">Mɛd 16.10</ref></char></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />É ghɛŋ ɛ Dhavid, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nyɛ naasa etɛp ee Zɛɛb nadi ekwyɛl ɛ. Bhii nyɛ nakagwyɛ ɛ, nyɛ nakɛdelaa ɛ́ é ngwoob bɛbhaab bɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nyɛ naabɔ. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Ghuna, mot Zɛɛb nagomal ɔ nabɛ ààbɔ. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38-39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38-39" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg, ye goka ɛ́ bi gu náá: Yɛ ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ Yezu ɛ ɛpelak e mesyem men di egoolaaa. Yɛ ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɛ́ di náá, bot djas aadum koŋ nɛ nɛ ɔ, bɛ waapɛkel tɔ bhel mesyem djas. Mɛpɛkel mɛ tak tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbɛlel tɔ ɛduwal ɛ́ etsi e Moiiz. <verse eid="ACT 13:38-39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Dika ndjem, etɛɛ náá, etɛp ee bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nakwyal ɛ needi ààsael nɛ biyɔ bɛmet. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ náá:<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />“Beeka biyɔ bot ɛ ɛbet!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Djokaka, da bi ɛ́ dus mɛ é mis,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">etɛɛ náá, é mɛlu mɛ tsik'en, mɛ waasa dhiiti ndem di náá,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">mot ɛ kaada bin yɛ ɔɔ, bi aanàkwaamyaal nyɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.41 <char style="xt"><ref loc="HAB 1:5">Hab 1.5</ref></char></char></note>!”»<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Dáa Pyɛɛd bɛ nɛ Bhaanabhas nawyis tɔ ndjaa mendjaala ɛ, bɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá, bɛ baabula é saba poon, étɛp bɛ neebaazɛlyo bɛ mɛkpa mɛ tak wat. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Bhii zɛɛga tak, bɛtɛ nɛ bot e mbyak eYuda nɛ bot ɛ nazemyaal ɛdjaala Zɛɛb eYuda ɔ, zokazɛdu Pɔl bɛ nɛ Bhaanabhas. Bɛ nadi elii nɛ nɔɔ, nɛ ɛdjɛ bɛ mɛghaaz mɛ ɛdi bɛsosoob si esɛɛa mɛtel ɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Dáa ye nakum yak dwoo saba ɛ, bɛtɛ nɛ bot tɔ ghaada djas zɛsɛɛga, étɛp bɛ neezɛgwak mɛkpa ɛ Ghɛŋ. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Dáa eYuda nabee mɛdhuu mɛ bot binɔk ɛ, ye nakpaa bɛ elyem. Bɛ moo tin elet etɛp ee Pɔl nadi elii ɛ, tin, bɛ eezɛlee nyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Pɔl bɛ nɛ Bhaanabhas eezɛlɛɛ bɛ nɛ ɛbwaalel djas náá: «Ye bɛ ɛ́, ye goka náá, Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb pookogoolaaa sok pɛ daa len. Dáa ye di náá, bi ɛpebyen yɛ ɛ, nɛ dáa bi di ebee náá, tsik na kɔm-kɔm tok dhiiti vaŋ sonok é mis men ɛ, akiba, bis katɔ́ ɛ́ pɛ daa bot ɛ di ààdi bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Beeka dáa Ghɛŋ nake nɛ nes ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">“Mɛ eenɛɛg wɔ dáa ngel étɛp membyak djas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">étɛp wɔ neetɔ́ bɛ nɛ tsik kɛkum pɛ edum e bɔs<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.47 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 49:6">Eza 49.6</ref></char></char></note>!”»<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Dáa bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ nagwak deenek ɛ́, bɛ naamyaala. Bhii tak, bɛ moo tin eduwal mɛkpa ɛ Ghɛŋ. Tin, bot djas nazesɛ́ɛaa étɛp bɛ neebela tsik na kɔm-kɔm ɔ, eezɛliig elyem, bɛ moo edu Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Mɛkpa ɛ Ghɛŋ nadi egoolaaa, ɛgoola nɛ ɛgoola kɔ kyee dik'enek djas. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Tin, eYuda eezɛbesal bɛdhil ɛ boa di bɛkum, eduwal Zɛɛb ɔ, nɛ bɛdhil ɛ botom ɛ ghaada, étɛp bɛ neewa Pɔl bɛ nɛ Bhaanabhas tɔ tsik mezuk. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛsɔ bɛ kɔ kyee dik'ɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Bot ɛbá binɔk ɛ boozɛkut piib é mɛko mɔɔ étɛp ɛdul ɛ bɛ mɛlɔ, bhii tak, bɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ dɛl ɛ Ikoniɔm. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Yɛ kabɛ bɛdjekel pɛ bɛ nadi pɛ Antiɔs ɔɔ, bɛ nadi ɛ́ tɔ boo mɛmyaala nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ tɔ lɔɔ na tɔɔɔ.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Pɔl bɛ nɛ Bhaanabhas pɛ ghaada Ikoniɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Pɛ ghaada Ikoniɔm, Pɔl bɛ nɛ Bhaanabhas naabaazɛni tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda, bɛ moo tin elyo. Mɛlyo mɛ bɛ nadi elyo bot ɛ naasa náá, bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda nɛ bot ɛ nadi ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Tin, bot ɛ mbyak eYuda nabyen ɛdu ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, zokazɛful bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ elo, étɛp bɛ needi nɛ embee esiiza nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg bɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Deenek, Pɔl bɛ nɛ Bhaanabhas naadi mɛlu ɛbuɛpe pɛ dɛl ɛ Ikoniɔm. Bɛ nadi elii-lii ɛ́ nɛ eghɛŋ djas, zɛnɔɔ ɛbwaalel nɛ Ghɛŋ. Ghɛŋ nadi edjɛ bɛ ghwyil ɛsa endem e mɛbwala, deenek, étɛp ɛlyaal etsɛɛtsɛ etɛp ee bɛ nadi elyo bɛ, dum nɛ enɛm esa e Zɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Tin, bot ɛ dɛl zokazɛbɛka: Ɛdhuu ɛ wat pɛ kyee bot ɛ nadi edu eYuda ɔ, yak ɛdhuu pɛ kyee bot ɛ nadi edu bot ɛ lwoma ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Bot ɛ mbyak eYuda, nɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, nɛ bɛmɛkoozi mɔɔ, nadi egwakel étɛp bɛ neezuk Pɔl bɛ nɛ Bhaanabhas, da bɛ ɛ́ gó bɛ nɛ mɛkok. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Dáa bot ɛbá tak nagwak ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛkaab tɔ́ pɛ mɛl mɛ Lisetɛ nɛ Dhɛlɛɛb, eghaada e kyee dik Likaoni, nɛ mɛl mɛ di é mengwoob ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Kɔ mɛl mɛ tak, bɛ eezɛni é baagoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl bɛ nɛ Bhaanabhas pɛ kɔ ghaada Lisetɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Pɛ kɔ ghaada Lisetɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mot nadi ààbɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛtyaa tetel ɔ, etɛɛ náá, mɛko mɛ nadi ɛ́ esɔɔbela. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́ boka kana edhɔma bɛ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛkɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Nyɛ nadi egwak etɛp ee Pɔl nadi elii ɛ. Tin Pɔl eezɛgwyák nyɛ piii, nyɛ eezɛbee náá, ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɛ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ́ waasa náá, mot tak bela tsik. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Nyɛ eezɛben gwood, zɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Wyɛla, tyaŋa tetel nɛ mɛko mɔ met!» <figure style="fig" alt="Paul guéri un homme paralysé" file="DN00505b.tif" size="col" loc="14.10" copy="Darwin Dunham" ref="14.10">Pɔl eetsik boka mot</figure></para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 14:10">Vaskala, mot'enɔk eezɛtyaa tetel, nɛ mɛko mɛ, nyɛ moo tin ekɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Dáa mɛdhuu mɛ bot nabee sa Pɔl nasa ɛ, bɛ eezɛtsim tɔ lii'ɔɔ, din ɛ lii tak ɛ́ Likoniɛ, bɔɔ náá: «Bɛzɛɛb eenɔɔ mɛnyel mɛ bot, tin, bɛ eesul pɛ pak mena dika'aak!» <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛget Bhaanabhas din ɛ «Zees», bɛ kaget Pɔl ɛ «Ɛɛlmɛs», etɛɛ náá, Pɔl nadi ɛ́ ngoola-ngoola. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Ndjaa-zɛɛb ɛ Zees nadi ɛ́ é ɛniel ɛ dɛl. Wɔ gwaa, ghaa-zɛɛb ɛ Zees zokazyɛ nɛ engɔmbɛ ee bɛ nazekomsa nɛ epyeeda e mɛzɛm mɛ ele bɛ napyeed ɛ, é ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa-zɛɛb tak. Bɛ nasa deenek ɛ́, étɛp bɛ needjɛ Pɔl bɛ nɛ Bhalnabas buwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Tin, dáa bot ɛ lwoma binɔk bɛbá nagwak menduk mɛ tak ɛ, bɛ eezɛnyaa ekaad bɔɔ. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛlel ɛni tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ bot é ɛtuud náá: <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />«Bɛwɛn, bi sa deenek étɛp yé? Bis ɛ́ bot, dáa biyɔ. Bis zɛgoola bin ɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal, bis ke nɛ nen ɛ́ náá, bi bet ɛduwal ekpaka-kpaka nɛ elula-lula, ye tok dhiiti vaŋ sonok. Duka Zɛɛb di nɛ tsik ɔ, mot nakus gwoo nɛ bɔs, nɛ boo dii mɛsɔn nɛ esa ee di tɔ tak ɛ djas. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />É membu mɛ nadhaŋ'enek, ye nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ naabet náá, membyak nɛ membyak sa esa ee elyem bɔɔ di ekwyɛl ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Bela náá, nyɛ nadi enyen é mis mɛ bot, nɛ enɛm esa ee nyɛ di esa ɛ. Nyɛy tɔ gwoo, nyɛ ɛpedhis bin bɛbhi, étɛp ye neesa náá, bhek nɛ bhek kwyil é yɛ mbu, nyɛ ɛpedjɛ bin edee, nɛ ɛlwoodal elyem bin nɛ mɛmyaala.» <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Bɛ nakoozolii deenek, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ɛlyelɛpe nɛ bot ɛ lwoma, bɛ lyak ɛdhuu bot binɔk náá, bɛ nàdjɛ bɛ buwa.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Bhii tak, eYuda eezɛzyɛ pɛ Antiɔs kɔ Pisidi nɛ pɛ Ikoniɔm. Tin, mɛkpa mɛ bɛ naloo nɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ, naasa náá, bɛ kwyɛl bɛ. Wɔ gwaa, Pɔl zɛwusaa nɛ mɛkok étɛp nyɛ neegóaa, bhii tak bɛ eezɛwyisal nyɛ kɔ dɛl, bɛ nadi egek ɛ́ náá, nyɛ eezegwyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Tin, dáa bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ nazɛsɛɛga é ngwoob'ɛ, nyɛ eezɛwyɛl, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛsik tɔ ghaada. Djɛmɛn tak, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ dɛl ɛ di djóoaa Dhɛlɛɛb bɛ nɛ Bhaanabhas.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛsik ɛ Pɔl bɛ nɛ Bhaanabhas pɛ Antiɔs ɛ Siili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Pɔl bɛ nɛ Bhaanabhas nadi egoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal pɛ kɔ dɛl ɛ Dhɛlɛɛb. Tin, bɛ naabela bɛdjekel ɛbuɛpe. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛsik pɛ Lisetɛ, pɛ Ikoniɔm pɛ Antiɔs yii kyee Pisidi. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Bɛ nadi edjɛ ghwyil nɛ bot ɛ namyaal ɛdu Zɛɛb ɔ, bɛ nadi edjɛ bɛ mɛghaaz mɛ ɛwa zii tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, bɛ nadi eke ɛ́ náá: «Mena gokaka ɛ́ nɛ ɛkpaa tɔ boo tsik mezuk, étɛp mena neenika tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb.» <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Pɛ tɔ ezɛɛga mendjaala djas, bɛ nadi esɛ́ɛ bɛpaa. Deenek bhii mendjaala nɛ ɛtsi edee, bɛ nadi edjɛ bɛ ebotan ɛ Ghɛŋ, mot bɛ nadum koŋ nɛ nɛ ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Bɛ eezɛdhaa Pisidi kɛkum pɛ kyee dik Panfili. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Bɛ naagoola Mɛkpa mɛ Zɛɛb pɛ ghaada Pɛɛledje, bhii tak, bɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ ghaada Ataliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Dusa tin, bɛ eezɛnɔɔ mɛsuwa, tɔ́ pɛ Antiɔs pɛ kyee Siili, ghaada bɛ nadjɛ bɛ ebotan ɛ Zɛɛb étɛp lwomel bɛ nagoka nɛ ɛsa ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Dáa bɛ nakakum pɛ Antiɔs ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛsɛɛg bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala mɛ tak djas. É di'enek, bɛ boozɛbaŋa bɛ esesɛɛ djas Zɛɛb nasa nɛ nɔɔ ɛ, nɛ dáa Zɛɛb nadjɛ pe bot ɛ di ààdi bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, ghwyil ɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Deenek, Pɔl bɛ nɛ Bhalnabas naadi ba mɛlu ɛbuɛpe bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel ɛ dɛl ɛ Antiɔs.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala mɛ Antiɔs eezɛboma nɛ bot ɛ lwoma kɔ Yeluzalɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Bɛdhiiti bot naazɛdus pɛ kyee dik Yude, tɔ́ pɛ Antiɔs, tin, bɛ moo tin elyo bɔn-nyɛɛg náá: «Bi ɛ́ di ààni beka, dáa etsi ɛ Moiiz di elɛɛ ɔ, bi aanàkwaabela tsik<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.1 <char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Msa 12.3</ref></char></char></note>.» <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Pɔl bɛ nɛ Bhaanabhas eezɛtyaa ghiŋ nɛ bot binɔk, bɔɔ zokazɛbela boo zyaala dum nɛ tɛp tak. Bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala ɛ́ boozɛgwakel náá, Pɔl bɛ nɛ Bhaanabhas, nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ dɛl ɛ Antiɔs ɛ waatɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm étɛp ɛkɛkoobal etɛp e tak bɛ nɛ bot ɛ lwoma nɛ bɛpaa. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Wɔ gwaa, bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala mɔɔ zokazɛdjɛ bɛ esa djas nadi egoka étɛp ɛtɔ́ mɛdjoŋ nɛ yɛ ɛ. Bɛ eezɛghɛɛ tɔ́, bɛ eezɛdhaa kyee dik Fenisi nɛ Samaali, bɔɔ é ɛbaŋa bot dáa bot ɛ di ààdi bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, nazeliig elyem, du Ghɛŋ ɛ. Bhaadal tak naadyeebadjɛ boo mɛmyaala nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg djas.<verse eid="ACT 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Dáa bɛ nakakum pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ, bɛ eezɛsulal pɛ daa bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala, bot ɛ lwoma nɛ bɛpaa naazɛswos bɛ nɛ mɛmyaala. Bɛ ɛ́ boozɛbaŋa bɛ etɛp ee Zɛɛb nadi esa nɛ bot é ze'ɔɔ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Tin, bɛdhiiti bot tɔ sama ɛdhuu ɛ eFalizyɛ nazedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, ɛ́ boozɛwyɛl, bɛ eezɛke náá: «Ye goka ɛ́ náá, bot ɛ di ààdi bot ɛ mbyak eYuda nadum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, niigelaa beka. Bhii tak, da bi ɛ́ lɛɛ bɛ náá, bɛ duwal etsi ɛ Moiiz.» <verse eid="ACT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Tin, bot ɛ lwoma nɛ bɛpaa zokazɛsɛɛga étɛp ɛdjek ɛ́ tɛp tak. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Bhii bɛ nazesɔs tɛp tak ɛbuɛpe ɛ, Pyɛɛd eezɛnɔɔ lii, nyɛy náá: «Bɔn-nyɛɛg, bi nɛ gu náá, Zɛɛb naalootɔ mɛ pak'en étɛp mɛ neegoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal pɛ daa bot ɛ di ààdi bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, bɛ neegwak, bhii tak, da bɛ ɛ́ dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Deenek, Zɛɛb mot di egu elyem e bot ɔ, nyɛ eelyaal náá, nyɛ eemyaal bɛ, nyɛ eedjɛ bɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ dáa menabɛlka. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààwa mbɛk pak mena nɛ bɛnɔɔ: Dáa di náá, bɛ eezedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, nyɛ eezegwyii elyem bɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Haaa étɛp yé nenak bi di ebe mɛso nɛ Zɛɛb? Tin, bi ɛpewaab-waaba bhel nɛ bot ɛ di dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ náá, bɛ bɛp kɔm etɛp na dil-dil, di náá, ye nakoozodi menabɛlka bɛmet nɛghu bɛbhaab binaka, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛkobɛp-bɛpak ɛ! <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Ye goka ɛ́, mena myaalka náá, mena belaka tsik ɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ enɛm esa ɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu, tyee wat nɛ nɔɔ.»<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Tin, bot ɛ zɛɛga djas moo tin kup, bhii tak, bɛ moo tin egwak, dáa Bhaanabhas bɛ nɛ Pɔl nadi ebaŋa bɛ endem e mɛbwala ee Zɛɛb nasa nɛ nɔɔ, pɛ daa bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Dáa bɛ nasilal ɛlii ɛ, Zak eezɛwyɛl, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke náá: «Bɔn-nyɛɛg, gwakeka mɛ! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simɛyɔŋ eebaŋa mena, dáa Zɛɛb nalookan ɛkwyee bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda é mɛkɛn ɔ, étɛp nyɛ neesɛ́ɛ tɔ lɔɔ mbyak aadi yɛ ɛ́. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Deenek, etɛp ee bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb djas ɛpenɔŋel nɛ yak, etɛɛ náá, Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ náá:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />“Ghɛŋ lɛɛ ɛ́ náá, bhis yenek, mɛ waabula,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">étɛp ɛ́ baazɛsum ndjaŋ ɛ Dhavid nazebik ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">mɛ waawyɛl bikela epap e tak, mɛ waabulal yɛ piki.<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Tin, bot ɛ membyak djas ɛ́ waasaa Ghɛŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, bot ɛ membyak djas mɛ nadjóo náá, bɛ di bam ɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">Sa Ghɛŋ nalɛɛ ɛ́ yenek:<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Nyɛy mot naloozesa náá, bot gu egeka bɛ ɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.18 <char style="xt"><ref loc="AMO 9:11-12">Amɔ 9.11-12</ref></char></char></note>.”»<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Wɔ gwaa, Zak baazɛbil náá, mɛ bee ɛ́ náá: «Mena tokeka nɛ ghwyil ɛsaa etɛp nɛ bot ɛ di ààdi bot ɛ mbyak eYuda, di eliig elyem du Zɛɛb ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Deenek, djhookwyalka bɛmɛkana étɛp ɛlɛɛ bɛ náá, bɛ nàdɛ bɛtit ɛ edhuud kaaa étɛp ɛdjɛ bɛzɛɛb ɛ bɛnaghisɛ ebuwa ɔ, bɛ kyee mɛzɔ, bɛ nàdɛ bɛtit ɛ góaa nɛ bhiyo ɔ, bɛ nàdɛ ghiya. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Etɛɛ náá, kana é ghɛŋ bɛbhaab, bot ɛpelyo bot etsi ɛ Moiiz pɛ kɔ eghaada nɛ eghaada, yɛ ɛpelaŋaa tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda é mɛlu mɛ esaba djas.»<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛkana mɛ nakyeedaa pɛ daa bot ɛ membyak mɛ sis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Tin, bot ɛ lwoma, nɛ bɛpaa, zɛnɔɔ bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala zokagwakel náá, bɛ sɛ́ɛ bɛdhiiti bot pak'ɔɔ, bɛ neelwom bɛ pɛ Antiɔs lɔɔg wat nɛ Pɔl nɛ Bhaanabhas. Tin, wɔ gwaa bɛ zokazɛsɛ́ɛ, Zuud dhiiti din ɛ lɛ nabaadi pe ɛ́ Bhaasabhas, zɛnɔɔ Silas. Bot ɛbá tak nabɛ ɛ́ tɔ sama bot ɛ nadi kɔ elo ee bot ɛ zɛɛga ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Bɛ ɛ́ booke nɛ nɔɔ náá, bɛ tɔ́ nɛ mɛkana di elɛɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 15:23">«Bot ɛ lwoma, nɛ bɛpaa, bɔn-nyɛɛg bin eeswos bɔn-nyɛɛg bɔɔ di ààdi bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, di kɔ ghaada Antiɔs, pɛ kyee dik Siili, dɔɔ nɛ pɛ Silisi ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Bis eegwak náá, bɛdhiiti bot ɛ dus pɛ dɛl ɛ les ɔ, eezɛm bin nɛ ɛpul ɛ bin esiiza, nɛ etɛp ee bɛ di elɛɛ ɛ. Bisɔ ààpalwom bɛ, bɛ zɛlii nɛ nen dum nɛ etɛp binek. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Étɛp tak ɛ, bisɔ djas gwakel náá, bis sɛ́ɛ bot ɛ bis aadhis ɔ. Bot ɛ tak neezɛkyeed Pɔl bɛ nɛ Bhaanabhas bɛsɔ bena, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />bot ɛ nawaagel mɛnyel kɔ ɛsu ɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Bis eedhis bin Zuud bɛ nɛ Silas bɛ neezɛlɛɛ bin nɛ enuub bɔɔ bɛmet, etɛp ee bis kwyal wak ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Yɛ ɛ́ náá, bisɔ nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ nabɛ ɛ́, bis eegwakel náá, bis aanàbaabil bin dhiiti kɔm na dil-dil, bhii mɛsa mak, yɛ ɛ́ di nɛ boo mɛgham ɛ: <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Nàdɛka bɛtit ɛ kaaa étɛp ɛdjɛ bɛzɛɛb ɛ bɛnaghisɛ ebuwa ɔ, nàdɛka ghiya, ààdɛ epuud é tit góaa nɛ bhiyo ɔ, sa bi ààsa mɛzɔ. Bi ɛ́ sa deenek ɔɔ, yɛ aadi ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe. Dika ɛnyɔɛpe!»<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Deenek, bɛ eezɛbet bot ɛ bɛ nalwom ɔ, bɛ tɔ́ pɛ Antiɔs. Tin, bɛ eezɛsɛɛg bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛdjɛ bɛmɛkana. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛlaa yɛ, mɛkana mɛ tak naadjɛ bɛ mɛghaaz, bɛ moo tin nɛ mɛmyaala. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Dáa Zuud bɛ nɛ Silas nadi bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb bɔɔ bɛmet ɛ, bɛ naazɛlii nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg bɔɔ ɛbuɛpe étɛp ɛdjɛ bɛ ghwyil nɛ mɛghaaz tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Bhii bɛ nadhaa ba bim mɛwala é di tak ɛ, bɔn-nyɛɛg bɔɔ eezɛmwana nɛ nɔɔ, bɛ sik tɔ egwyem pɛ daa bot ɛ nalwom bɛ ɔ. [<verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Tin, Silas ɛ́ booke yɛ náá, nyɛ lik tinaak.] <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Bela tin náá, Pɔl bɛ nɛ Bhaanabhas eezɛlik pɛ Antiɔs. Bɛ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot, bɛ nadi elyo bot nɛ ɛgoola mɛkpa ɛ Ghɛŋ.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl bɛ nɛ Bhalnabas eebɛka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Ba mɛwala bhii tak, Pɔl eezɛke nɛ Bhaanabhas náá: «Djhoosikeka, kɛgwyák bɔn-nyɛɛg bina pɛ kɔ eghaada djas mena nagoolaka mɛkpa ɛ Ghɛŋ ɛ, mena neekɛbee dáa bɛ di penek ɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Bhaanabhas nakwyɛl ɛ́, bɛ tɔ́ lɔɔg wat bɛ nɛ Zaŋ, mot di ebaadjóoaa Malak ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Tin, Pɔl nabɛ ɛ́ ààkwyɛl geka tak, etɛɛ náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ naabet bɛ, é sok bɛ nadi pɛ kyee dik Panfili ɛ, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààtɔ́ bɛ nɛ nɔɔ pɛ ze lwomel. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />É di'enek, ye nabɛ ɛ́ bɛ naabela boo zyaala, batasa náá, bɛ bɛka. Tin, Bhaanabhas eezɛnɔɔ Malak, bɛ eezɛni tɔ mɛsuwa, tɔ́ bɛ nɛ nɛ pɛ ghola Siipɛlɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Pɔl eezɛnɔɔ yɛ Silas, tɔ́ nɛ nɛ, bhii bɔn-nyɛɛg bɔɔ nazewa bɛ é mɛmbɔ mɛ Ghɛŋ tɔ mendjaala ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Pɔl eezɛkpaa kɔ eghaada Siili nɛ Silisi, é ɛdjɛ mɛghaaz nɛ ghwyil nɛ bot tɔ ezɛɛga mendjaala.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timote ɛpegyee bɛ nɛ Pɔl nɛ Silas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Pɔl eezɛkum pɛ dɛl ɛ Dhɛlɛɛb, nɛ pɛ ghaada Lisetɛ. Tin ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mot nadi edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Timote, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ mɔn dhiiti moma mbyak eYuda nadi edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, sɛɛg nabɛ ɛ́ mot mbyak eGhɛlɛk. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg nadi edi pɛ Lisetɛ nɛ pɛ Ikoniɔm ɔ, nadi ɛ́ nɛ mbɛɛ taŋal dum nɛ Timote. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Pɔl eezɛsɛ́ɛ nyɛ, étɛp nyɛ neegyee nɛ nɛ. Tin, nyɛ eezɛniigal nyɛ beka, étɛp bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ee nadi kɔ kyee mɛdhik menek ɔ. Nyɛ nasa deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bot djas nadi egu náá, sɛɛg nadi ɛ́ mot mbyak eGhɛlɛk. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Pɛ kɔ eghaada ee bɛ nadi edhaŋ ɛ, bɛ nadi ebaŋa bot ɛ di edu Zɛɛb ɔ, etɛp ee bɛ nɛ bot ɛ lwoma nɛ bɛpaa nakɛlii pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ, nɛ ɛbaalɛɛ bɛ náá, bɛ kɛ deenek. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala nadi ebela ghwyil tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, mɛtaŋ mɛ bot nadi ebilel, ɛbilel nɛ ɛbilel.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dhyam ɛ Pɔl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Sisim na Dɛɛ eezɛlu bɛ náá, bɛ nàkɛgoola Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb pɛ kyee dik Azi. Tin, bɛ eezɛdhaa kyee dik Fiilizi nɛ Ghalasi. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Dáa bɛ nakum é ngwoob pes dik Misi ɛ, bɛ eezɛbela ɛkwosak ɛ ɛtɔ́ pɛ pes dik Bhitini. Tin, Sisim ɛ Yezu naazɛlu bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Bɛ eezɛkpaa pɛ Misi, zɛtɔ́ pɛ ɛboŋ ɛ Toloas. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />É pum, wɔ gwaa, Pɔl zɛdjem dhyam. Nyɛ eezɛbee dhiiti mot kyee dik Masedwan, tetel edjaala nɛ nɛ náá: «Dhaŋa pɛ kyee dik Masedwan, da wɔ ɛ́ zɛkwyee bis!» <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Ààbɔya bhii dhyam yenek, bis eezɛsaŋ ɛtɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Masedwan, etɛɛ náá, bis nabɛ ɛ́ bis eebee tsɛɛtsɛ náá, Zɛɛb nabɛ ɛ́ nyɛ eedjóo bis náá, bis kɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal pɛ daa bot ɛ kyee dik tak.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lydi eedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ghaada Filip</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Bis eezɛdus pɛ boo ghaada Toloas tɔ mɛsuwa, tɔ́ pɛ ghola Somatalas, bhii tak, é yak ɛlu pɛ ghaada Neapolis. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Bhii tin, bis eezɛtɔ́ pɛ Filip, ghaada mɛkɛn pes dik Masedwan, ghaada bot ɛ Lɔm nasum ɛ. Bis naadhaa mɛlu ɛbuɛpe kɔ ghaada tak. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />É dwoo saba, bis eezɛwyis kɔ ghaada, tɔ́ pɛ ɛboŋ, pɛ bis nadi egek náá, bis ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛbela sum di mendjaala mɛ eYuda ɔ. Bis eezɛnɔɔ mɛnyel disi, bhii tak, bis moo elii nɛ boa ɛ nasɛɛga tin ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Tɔ boa ɛ tak, din ɛ ngɔt nadi ɛ́ Lydi, nyɛ nadus ɛ́ pɛ ghaada Tyatiid, nyɛ nadi ebɔmsa etina ekaad e na nyɔ-nyɔ, na tɔɔbelaa, nyɛ nadi eduwal Zɛɛb ɛbuɛpe. Nyɛ nadi egwak bis, Ghɛŋ naabɛɛ nyɛ mɛlɔ étɛp nyɛ neegwak nɛ ɛmɛt mɛkpa mɛ Pɔl nadi elii ɛ ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛduwa Zɛɛb bɛ nɛ bot ɛ mɛbyel mɛ, bhii tak nyɛ eezɛdjóo bis pɛ daa lɛ, nyɛy náá: «Bi ɛ myaal nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, mɛ eemyaal Ghɛŋ ɔɔ, dha dika pɛ daa lam.» Nyɛ eezɛsa náá, bis myaal.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl bɛ nɛ Silas tɔ ndjaa membok pɛ ghaada Filip</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Dhiiti dwoo, dáa bis nadi etɔ́ pɛ sum di mendjaala mɛ tak ɛ, wɔ gwaa, dhiiti kwom moma zokazyɛ zɛboma nɛ nes. Pɛ tɔ lɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ mbee sisim nadi esa náá, nyɛ gheenenaa bot eghaa etɛp ee di eezyɛ pɛ sok ɛ. Nyɛ nadi ebela bɛtɛ nɛ epata étɛp bɛkum bɛ, tɔ ɛnaŋ ɛ́ eghaa bɛ nyɛ nadi enaŋ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Tin, nyɛ eezɛni edu bis nɛ Pɔl, nyɛy etsim náá: «Bot bak ɛ́ bot ɛ mɛsa ɛ Zɛɛb Mɛkaake! Bɛ ɛpelyo bin ze di edjɛ tsik ɛ!» <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Nyɛ naasesa deenek mɛlu ɛbuɛpe. Bhii tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ Pɔl naazɛbiyo, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛliig mis, nyɛy nɛ mbee sisim náá: «Nɛ din ɛ Yezu Klisto mɛ lɛɛ wɔ ɛ́, wyisa tɔ lɛ!» Tin, é di tak wat sisim eezɛwyis. <verse eid="ACT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Dáa bɛkum bɛ nabee náá, bɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbaabela epata, é ze'ɛ, bɛ boozɛmɛt Pɔl bɛ nɛ Silas, tɔ́ nɛ nɔɔ kɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ ɛ bot djas, sok bhwoob ekukuma e ghaada tak. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Bɛ eezɛtɔ́ nɛ nɔɔ pɛ daa bɛtetɛp ɛ nadi bot ɛ Lɔm ɔ, bɔɔ nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bot bak ɛpekus ɛzɛm kɔ ghaada yena. Bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda, <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />bɛ ɛpelyo bot mɛzel mɛ di náá, menabɛl bot ɛ Lɔm tokeka nɛ ghwyil ɛdu nɛ ɛsa yɛ ɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Tin, dɔɔ nɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot zokazɛbyen bɛ. Bɛtetɛp ɛ́ boozɛke náá, bɛ sɔ Pɔl nɛ Silas ekaad é nyel, bɛ eezɛlwom náá, bɛ nyuu bɛ nɛ eghwyɛs. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Bhii bɛ nasilal ɛnyuu bɛ nɛ eghwyɛs esok nɛ esok ɛ, bɛ boozɛkɔɔl bɛ tɔ membok, bɛ eezɛlɛɛ nɛ mbaalel ndjaa membok mɛ tak náá, nyɛ baal bɛ ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Dáa mbaalel tak nagwak dáa bɛtetɛp nalii ɛ, mbaalel ndjaa membok ɛ́ bookɛwa bɛ tɔ dhiiti dhɛŋ pɛ ɛsik tɔ membok, bhii tak, bɛ eezɛwa bɛ mɛko tɔ embwak.<figure style="fig" alt="Paul et Silas en les pieds cloués dans la prison" file="lb00337c.tif" size="span" loc="16.24" copy="Louise Bass" ref="16.23-35">Pɔl bɛ nɛ Silas é mbwak tɔ membok</figure><verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Ye moo etiila kuku pum, Pɔl bɛ nɛ Silas nadi edjaala nɛ ɛduwal Zɛɛb nɛ mɛdjeeb, tin, bɛdhiiti bot ɛ membok nadi egwak bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />É di'enek wat, wɔ gwaa, bɔs zɛdheegel ɛlyelɛpe, ghus-zumal membok zokakuu. Mɛbɛ mɛ ndjaa membok djas zokabɛŋel, é di tak wat, eghwooz e bot ɛ membok nakɔlaa nɛ yɛ ɛ́ zokatiiel. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Mbaalel ndjaa membok eezɛdjem, dáa nyɛ nabee náá, ɛbɛ ɛ ndjaa membok nadi ɛ́ mbek ɛ, nyɛ boowaal pɛl'ɛ étɛp nyɛ neegó nyel. Nyɛ nasa deenek ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, tɔ egeka bɛ, nyɛ nadi eke ɛ́ náá, bot ɛ membok eezekaab. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Tin, Pɔl eezɛtsim nɛ ghwyil'ɛ djas náá: «Nàzuk nyel'ɔ, bisɔ djas ɛ́ wak!» <verse eid="ACT 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Tin, mbaalel ndjaa membok eezɛwaab náá, bɛ tuub twol. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛwyis kaab, ni tɔ dhɛŋ tak, nyɛy egbakba nɛ bwoo, nyɛ eezɛduma si mɛko ɛ Pɔl nɛ Silas. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Tin, nyɛ eezɛwyisal bɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Ekukuma bam, mɛ goka nɛ sa dáa étɛp mɛ neebela tsik?» <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Duma koŋ nɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu, tin, wɔ waabela tsik, wɔy nɛ bot ɛ mɛbyel mɔ.» <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />É di'enek, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛgoola nyɛy nɛ bot ɛ ndjaŋ'ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Ghɛŋ. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />É ɛwala ɛ tak wat, mbaalel ndjaa membok eezɛtɔ́ nɛ nɔɔ é pum kɛgwyii bɛ, nɛ ɛgwom ɛ́ bɛ mɛpyoŋ. É di tak wat, nyɛ eezɛduwa Zɛɛb bɛ nɛ bot ɛ ndjaŋ'ɛ djas. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Nyɛ eezɛbyet nɛ Pɔl bɛ nɛ Silas pɛ ndjaŋ'ɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛdjɛ bɛ edee e dek. Mot tak nɛ bot ɛ mɛbyel mɛ djas nadi ɛ́ tɔ mɛmyaala etɛɛ náá, bɛ naadum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Dáa mɛlem nakalem ɛ, bɛtetɛp ɛ nadi bot ɛ Lɔm ɔ eezɛlwom bot, étɛp ɛkɛlɛɛ nɛ mbaalel ndjaa membok náá: «Beta bot binɔk.» <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Mbaalel ndjaa membok eezɛlɛɛ Pɔl náá: «Bɛtetɛp eedhis bhaadal náá, bi wyiselaa. Deenek bi ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛkawyis, da bi ɛ́ tɔ́ tɔ egwyem.» <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Pɔl eezɛbɔɔza nɛ bot ɛ nalwomaa ɔ náá: «Bɛ eelwom náá, bis nyuŋaa nɛ eghwyɛs é mis mɛ bot djas, dhi bis di bot ɛ ghaada kyee dik Lɔm. Bhii tak, bɛ eekɔɔl bis é membok. Bisɔ ààpɛ́ɛaa dáa ye di egoka nɛ ɛsael ɛ. Deenek, sa bɛ di ekwyɛl ɛsa nenak ɛ́ yɛ ɛ́ ɛwyisal ɛ bis tyee syaab é? Ààbɛ deenek! Ye goka ɛ́ bɛ zɛwyisal bis bɔɔ bɛmet.»<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Bot binɔk eezɛsik kɛlɛɛ etɛp binek pɛ daa bɛtetɛp ɛ nadi bot ɛ Lɔm ɔ. Dáa bɛ nagwak náá, bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ dɛl Lɔm ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, bwoo naasa bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Tin, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛwaab ɛpelak pɛ daa lɔɔ, bhii tak, bɛ eezɛwyisal bɛ é membok, bɛ eezɛdjaala nɛ nɔɔ náá, bɛ dus kɔ ghaada. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Dáa Pɔl bɛ nɛ Silas nawyis é membok ɛ, bɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ daa Lydi. Bhii bɛ naazɛboma nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg bɔɔ, nɛ ɛdjɛ bɛ mɛghaaz nɛ ghwyil tɔ ɛdu ɛ Zɛɛb, bhii tak, bɛ eezɛnɔɔ mɛnyel tɔ́.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Pɔl bɛ nɛ Silas pɛ ghaada Tesalonik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Bɛ eezɛdhaa pɛ eghaada Anfipolis nɛ Apoloni, tin, bɛ eezɛkum pɛ ghaada Tesalonik pɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda nadi nɛ ndjaa mendjaala ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Dáa nyɛ nabela nɛ ɛsesa sok ɛ, Pɔl eezɛtɔ́ é esaba elɛl tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda, bɛ nadi elii dum nɛ Ekwyala e Zɛɛb, bɛ nɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Nyɛ nadi elyo nɛ ɛlyaal ɛ́ bɛ náá, ye nagoka ɛ́ náá, Mɛsia zukaa, da nyɛ ɛ́ gom bis ɛsyee. Nyɛ nadi eke nɛ nɔɔ ɛ́ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ Yezu mɛ di elii nɛ nen kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ'aak, nyɛy ɛ di Mɛsia.» <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Bɛdhiiti bot tɔ sama bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ, naamyaal etɛp é tak, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛdu Pɔl nɛ Silas. Dɔɔ nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ mbyak eGhɛlɛk ee nadi eduwal Zɛɛb ɔ, naazɛsɛɛga nɛ nɔɔ, zɛnɔɔ bɛtɛ nɛ bɛdhiiti bɛdhil ɛ boa. <verse eid="ACT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Tin, zok naazɛsa eYuda, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛsɛɛg edhiiti ewo e mengbaaz bɛ nabela é gba ɛ, bɛ boozɛkus ɛzɛm tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛkus ɛghuub kɔ ghaada. Bɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ ndjaŋ ɛ Zasɔn kɛsaa Pɔl nɛ Silas, étɛp bɛ neemɛt bɛ, zyɛ nɛ nɔɔ é mis mɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Dáa bɛ nadi ààbela bɛ ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛmɛt Zasɔn bɛ nɛ bɛdhiiti bɔn-nyɛɛg, tɔ́ nɛ nɔɔ pɛ daa ekukuma é ghaada. Bɛ moo tin etsim náá: «Bot bak ɛpezɛm dik djas, deenek, nenak bɛ eezezyɛ nɛ yɛ wak! <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Zasɔn eemyaal náá, bot ɛ tak sulal pɛ daa lɛ! Bot ɛ tak djas ààsa dáa etsi ɛ mɛkoozi Sezaad nadi elɛɛ ɛ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ ke ɛ́ náá, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mɛkoozi mɛ sis, din ɛ lɛ ɛ́ Yezu.» <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Etɛp binek naadjɛ ekukuma nɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot ɛ ghaada bwoo. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Bot ɛ tak naasa náá, Zasɔn bɛ nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg zɛdjɛ boo etuud pɛ daa ekukuma, étɛp bɛ neebetaa.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl bɛ nɛ Silas pɛ dɛl ɛ Bheede</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Dáa ɛgwyitok nagwyiidela ɛ, bɛdhiiti bot ɛ nadi edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ ɛbookyeed Pɔl bɛ nɛ Silas náá, bɛ tɔ́ pɛ dɛl ɛ Bheede. Dáa bɛ nakum ɛ, bɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ embee elyem dáa bot ɛ Tesalonik. Bɛ naagwak Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ mbɛɛ lyem. Mɛlu djas bɛ nadi esɛɛga étɛp ɛdjek Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ ɛfyal ɛ etsɛɛtsɛ e Ekwyala ee Pɔl nadi elɛɛ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Yɛ ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ bɛtɛ nɛ bot pak'ɔɔ nabɛ, bɛ moo edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, dɔɔ nɛ tɔ sama bot ɛ mbyak eGhɛlɛk, bɛdhil ɛ boa nɛ botom ɛbuɛpe, namyaal ɛdu ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Dáa bɛdhiiti eYuda e dɛl Tesalonik nagwak náá, Pɔl nabaadi egoola Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb pɛ Bheede ɛ, bɛ eezɛzyɛ zɛkus ɛghuub, nɛ ɛzɛm tɔ mɛdhuu mɛ bot. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg eezɛkyeed Pɔl kaab ɛ́ kaab pɛ ze boo dii mɛsɔn. Tin, Silas bɛ nɛ Timote eezɛlik pɛ Bheede. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Bot ɛ nakɛkyeed Pɔl ɔ, zokatɔ́ nɛ nɛ kɛkum pɛ ghaada Atɛn. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛlel ɛsik yɔbɔ pɛ Bheede nɛ mɛbhaadal mɛ Pɔl nakyeed Silas bɛ nɛ Timote ɛ. Nyɛ nake nɛ nɔɔ ɛ́ náá, bɛ lel ɛkɛboma nɛ nɛ.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Dáa Pɔl nadi ebwood bɛ pɛ Atɛn ɛ, wɔ gwaa, ghoŋ zɛmɛt nyɛ ɛlyelɛpe dáa nyɛ naabee dɛl tɔɔɔ nɛ bɛzɛɛb ɛ elula-lula ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Nyɛ moo tin elii tɔ ndjaa mendjaala bɛ nɛ eYuda nɛ bot ɛ sis nadi eduwal Zɛɛb ɔ, dɔɔ nɛ kɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ, é di bot djas di edi ɔ. Mɛlu djas nyɛ nadi elii nɛ bot ɛ nyɛ nadi eboma nɛ nɛ ɔ. <figure style="fig" alt="Paul enseigne la parole de Dieu à Athènes" file="WA03982b.tif" size="span" loc="17.17" copy="Graham Wade" ref="17.17">Pɔl ɛpelyo Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb pɛ ghaada Atɛn</figure><verse eid="ACT 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Bɛdhiiti bɛlyoel ɛ nadi djóoaa «Bot a Epikyiid» nɛ bot nadi é djóoaa «Bot ɛ Zenɔŋ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zenɔŋ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bot ɛ tak nabaadi edjóoaa pe ɛ́ «bɛɛstoyisyɛ», etɛɛ náá, bɛ nadi edu ɛ́ esiiza nɛ egeka e dhiiti mot din ɛ lɛ ɛ́ Zenɔŋ. </char></note>» ɔ, zokazɛlii nɛ nɛ. Bɛdhiiti eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Mot ɛtap ɛlak kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ yé?» Bɛdhiiti náá: «Ye di ɛkɛɛ náá, nyɛ ɛpelyo bot bɛzɛɛb ɛ sis.» Bɛ nake deenek ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, bɛ nadi egwak Pɔl egoola Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ Yezu nɛ étɛp ɛgom ɛ lɛ bhis ɛsyee. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Bɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyɛ, tɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ sum di zɛɛga bɛ di edjóo «Ɛlopaaz» ɛ. Tin, bɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Bis ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛgu mɛlyo mɛ na bes wɔ di eke ɛ? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Wɔ ɛpelyaal bis etɛp e na bes, bis kwyɛl ɛ́ náá, bis gu mɛsuk mɛ tak.» <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Ye goka ɛ́, wɔ gu náá, bot ɛ ghaada Atɛn djas nɛ bɛdjoŋ ɛ nadidi bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ ɔ, nadhaa mɛwala mɔɔ ɛ, bɔɔ é ɛsɔs nɛ ɛgwak etɛp e na bes tak. <verse eid="ACT 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />É di'enek, Pɔl tetel kuku ɛbwak ɛ zɛɛga pɛ «Ɛlopaaz», nyɛ eezɛke náá: «Bot ɛ ghaada Atɛn, mɛ eebee náá, bi nɛ dyeebaduwal bɛzɛɛb bin ɛbuɛpe tɔ etɛp djas. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Deenek, é sok mɛ di ekɛ kɔ ghaada yen ɛ, mɛ di ebee emesa e bɛzɛɛb ɛ elula-lula bi di eduwal ɛ, mɛ eebee dɔɔ nɛ mɔɔ di na dɛɛ wat, kɔ tak kwyala náá: “Yɛ ɛ́ yii zɛɛb ngɔt bot di ààgu ɛ.” É di'enek, yɛ ɛ́ yii bi di eduwal ààgu ɛ, mɛ zyɛ ɛ́ zɛgoola bin nwyak. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Zɛɛb mot nakus bɔs nɛ esesɛɛ ɛ djas ɔ, Ghɛŋ gwoo nɛ bɔs. Nyɛy ààdi tɔ mendjaa me bɛzɛɛb ɛ bɛnaghisɛ, bot di esum nɛ mɛmbɔ mɔɔ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Nyɛ tok pe nɛ gwyes náá, bɛ kwyee nyɛ nɛghu bɛ djɛ nyɛ yak sonok, etɛɛ náá, nyɛy ɛ́ di edjɛ bot djas tsik, eswos nɛ esonok djas kalik ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Kɛkan nɛ mot ngɔt, nyɛ naasa membyak djas, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛdjɛ mot nɛ mot yɛ di kɔ bɔs. Étɛp'ɔɔ, nyɛ naakoobal membu, nɛ mɛsik nɛ mɛtsek mɛ mɛdhik mɛ bɛ nagoka nɛ ɛdi kɔ tak ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Nyɛ nasa deenek ɛ́, étɛp bɛ neesaa nyɛ, ye nakoozolyel, bɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛbela nyɛ. Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, Zɛɛb ààtseta nɛ mot ngɔt pak'ena, <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />etɛɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">“Yɛ ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɛ mena dika nɛ tsik,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">mena di ekuuka, mena dika.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Yɛ ɛ́ etɛp ee bɛdhiiti bɛsaŋel ɛ esesa bin nazolɛɛ ɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">“Menaka ɛ́ bɔn bɛ pe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pɔl baŋa wak ɛ́ etɛp ee bɛsaŋel ɛ esesa bɛbá é mbyak eGhɛlɛk nadi edjóoaa «Ɛpimeniid nɛ Alatɔs» ɔ. </char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Dáa ye di náá, menaka ɛ́ bɔn bɛ ɛ, mena tokeka nɛ ghwyil ɛgek náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ dáa sonok lulaa nɛ lɔɔd, nɛ ghwooz di esaaa epata nɛ yɛ ɛ, nɛghu nɛ ɛkok ɛ mot di esa nɛ egeka nɛ etsoŋ bɛ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Ghuna, Zɛɛb ààkabis etɛp ee nasael sok nɛ bot nadi tɔ ɛdjak ɔ, deenek, nenak, nyɛ ɛpelɛɛ bot djas pɛ edi ee bɛ di ɛ, bɛ swoola mɛfulu mɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ naazekoobal ɛlu ɛ nyɛ aazɛpɛ́ɛ bot ɛ bɔs djas epɛ́ɛ é epiki ɛ, nɛ mot nyɛ nazesɛ́ɛ ɔ. Nyɛ naatel bot djas ndem, tɔ ɛgomal ɛ nyɛ gomal mot yenɔk pak bɛmyoŋ ɛ!»<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Dáa bɛ nagwak Pɔl elii dum nɛ ɛgom bhis ɛsyee ɛ, bɛdhiiti bot eezɛduk nyɛ, bak tak eezɛke náá: «Bis ɛ́ waaboogwak wɔ kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak dhiiti dwoo.» <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />É di'enek ɛ, Pɔl nazɛlik bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Ye kabela tin ɛ́ náá, bɛdhiiti bot naazeni zɛɛga yɔɔ, bɔɔ dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. Tɔ sama bot ɛ tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́, Dhenis mot zɛɛga boo kwan nadi pɛ Ɛlopaaz ɔ, dhiiti moma din ɛ lɛ ɛ́ Dhamalis, nɛ bak bɛdhiiti bot.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Pɔl pɛ ghaada Koolɛt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Bhis yenek, Pɔl eezɛtɔ́ pɛ ghaada Atɛn bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ ghaada Koolɛt. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛboma nɛ dhiiti mot mbyak eYuda, din ɛ mot tak nabɛ ɛ́ Akilas, nyɛ nabyel ɛ́ pɛ kyee dik Pɔŋ. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nyɛ dinaa ààbɔya nɛ dus ɛ pɛ kyee dik Itali bɛ nɛ myɛl Pilisil, etɛɛ náá, Kolood, mɛkoozi mɛ Lɔm, naalɛɛ nɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda djas náá, bɛ dus kɔ ghaada Lɔm. Tin, Pɔl zokatɔ́ kɛboma nɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />Nyɛ nadi esa mɛsa mɛ wat bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ, mɛsa mɛ tak nadi ɛ́ ɛsum ɛ bɔɔ epɛt nɛ eket e bɛtit. Nyɛ naazɛsulal pɛ daa lɔɔ, étɛp nyɛ neesa mɛsa. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />É mɛlu mɛ esaba djas, Pɔl nadi elii tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda, nyɛ nadi elyo bot, nyɛ nadi esaŋ ɛ náá, bot ɛ mbyak eYuda nɛ yii eGhɛlɛk dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Dáa Silas bɛ nɛ Timote nadus pɛ dik Masedwan ɛ, tin, Pɔl eezɛdjɛ lyem'ɛ djas tɔ ɛlyo bot Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. Nyɛ naalyaal eYuda náá, Yezu ɛ́ Mɛsia. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Wɔ gwaa, eYuda zɛbe mɛso nɛ ɛlee ɛ́ nyɛ. É di'enek, nyɛ eezɛkut bɛ piib ekaad bɛ, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi ɛ wo ze ɔɔ, mɛbɛ mɛ tak aadi ɛ́ kɔ elo e bin, biyɔ bɛmet. Yenek ààkagwyák mam. É ɛwala ɛlak, mɛ aakatɔ́ ɛ́ pɛ daa bot ɛ membyak mɛ sis.» <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Nyɛ eezɛdus tin, tɔ́ pɛ daa dhiiti mot, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Titus Yustus, mot tak nadi eduwal Zɛɛb, ndjaŋ'ɛ nadi ɛ́ é ngwoob ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Kilipus kukuma ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda zokamyaal Ghɛŋ, bɛ nɛ bot ɛ mɛbyel mɛ djas. Wɔ gwaa bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ ghaada Koolɛt nadi egwak Pɔl ɔ, zokazɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, bhii tak, bɛ naakɛduwa Zɛɛb.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />É dhiiti pum, Pɔl zokazɛdjem dhyam, tɔ dhyam tak, Ghɛŋ nalɛɛ nyɛ ɛ́ náá: «Nàbem ba, gheelii, sa wɔ ààdiyal nuub, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />etɛɛ náá, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ nɔ sama, mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛzuk wɔ, etɛɛ náá, bot ɛbuɛpe tɔ ghaada yak ɛ́ bot bam.» <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Pɔl zokazɛdi kɔ ghaada Koolɛt tyee mbu wat nɛ pes, nyɛ nadi elyo bot djas Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />É membu mɛ Ghaliɔn nadi kukuma dik Akayi ɛ, eYuda zokazɛgwakel étɛp ɛmet ɛ́ Pɔl. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛtɔ́ nɛ nɛ di di epɛ́ɛaa etɛp ɔ, <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />bɔɔ náá: «Mot'ak ɛpeful bot lo náá, bɛ duwal Zɛɛb dhiiti mbi duwala sis, ààbɛ dáa etsi di elyo ɛ!» <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Dáa Pɔl nawaadi ekwyɛl ɛlii ɛ, Ghaliɔn eezɛbɔɔza nɛ eYuda náá: «Yɛ bɛ náá, nyɛ eesa boo tɛp ɔɔ, nɛghu nyɛ eesa eboo embee etɛp ɔɔ, yɛ ɛ́ mɛ kanɔɔ nyel disi étɛp mɛ neegwak bin, biyɔ eYuda. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Dáa ye di náá, yɛ ɛ́ ɛsuu ɛ mɛso dum nɛ mɛkpa, nɛ min, zɛnɔɔ etsi bin met ɔ, yenek gwyák ɛ́ biyɔ bɛmet. Mɛ eepɛɛ ɛdi ɛ́ tetɛp embi etɛp deenek!» <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛswaal bɛ sok bhwoob zɛɛga bɛtetɛp. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Tin, wɔ gwaa bɔɔ djas zɛmɛt Sɔstɛn, mot nadi kukuma ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda ɔ, zɛduma nyɛ é nyel é mis mɛ bot ɛ zɛɛga bɛtetɛp. É di'enek, Ghaliɔn nabɛ ɛ́ ààkobis yɛ.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl eezɛsik pɛ Antiɔs pɛ dik Siili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Pɔl eebaazɛdhaa ba bim mɛlu ɛbuɛpe pɛ kɔ ghaada Koolɛt. Tin, nyɛ eezɛlik bɔn-nyɛɛg, nyɛ eeni tɔ mɛsuwa tɔ́ pɛ dik Siili, nɛ Pilisil, bɛ nɛ Akilas. Ye nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ eezewaadal lo ɛboŋ é sok nyɛ nadi pɛ dɛl ɛ Sɛɛkele ɛ, etɛɛ náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́, nyɛ eesa ekɛk nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛkum pɛ ghaada Efɛɛz. Tin, nyɛ eezɛlik Pilisil bɛ nɛ Akilas. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda, tin nyɛ eezɛmɔ bɛ nɛ eYuda. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Bɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá, nyɛ di bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ ba mɛlu, tin, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkwyɛl. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Nyɛ eezɛlik bɛ, nyɛy nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Zɛɛb ɛ kwyɛl ɔɔ, mɛ waaboobaazyɛ pɛ daa len.» Tin, nyɛ eezɛdus pɛ Efɛɛz tɔ mɛsuwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Bhii nyɛ nadus pɛ ghaada Sezaale ɛ, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ sok pɛ Yeluzalɛm, étɛp nyɛ neekɛswos bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ ghaada Antiɔs. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Nyɛ eezɛkwyɛɛg ba mɛlu penek, bhii tak nyɛ eezɛsik. Nyɛ eezɛdhaa pɛ mɛdhik mɛ Ghalasi, bhii tak, pɛ Fiilizi edje-djɛ bɛdjekel djas mɛghaaz tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apolɔs pɛ eghaada Efɛɛz nɛ pɛ Koolɛt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />É ghɛŋ tak, dhiiti mot mbyak eYuda, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Apolɔs, nyɛ nabyel ɛ́ pɛ ghaada Alɛkzandili, nyɛ naazɛkum pɛ ghaada Efɛɛz. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́ tsoŋ mot tɔ lii, nyɛ nadi egu Ekwyala e Zɛɛb ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Nyɛ naadyeebadjek ɛkɛ tɔ mɛkpa mɛ Ghɛŋ, nɛ ɛwa zii ɛbuɛpe. Nyɛ nadi egoola, nɛ ɛlyo ɛ bot nɛ lyem wat etɛp ee di edum nɛ Yezu ɛ. Ye kabela ɛ́ náá, nyɛ nazodi egu ɛ́, ɛduwa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ Zaŋ. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Nyɛ eezɛni elii nɛ bot nɛ ɛbwaalel djas tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda. Bhii bɛ nasilal ɛgwak etɛp ee nyɛ nadi elii ɛ, Pilisil bɛ nɛ Akilas eezɛnɔɔ nyɛ, tɔ́ nɛ nɛ lɔɔg wat, étɛp bɛ neekɛpɛs ɛgu ɛ lɛ dum nɛ mɛze ɛ Zɛɛb ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Bhii tak, Apolɔs eezɛgwak gwyes ɛ́ ɛtɔ́ pɛ dik Akayi. Bɔn-nyɛɛg zokadjɛ nyɛ ghwyil nɛ mɛghaaz, tin, bɛ eezɛkwyal bɛdjekel ɛ nadi pɛ kyee dik tak ɔ mɛkana, étɛp bɛ neemyaal nɛ mbɛɛ lyem náá, nyɛ sulal pɛ daa lɔɔ. Dáa nyɛ nakakum ɛ, nyɛ naadyeebakwyee bot ɛ nadum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, nɛ ghwyil enɛm nɛ embɛɛ e Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Etɛɛ náá, é mis mɛ bot djas, nyɛ nadi elyaal popoopwon náá, eYuda eezewo ze. Nyɛ nadi elyaal bɛ tɔ Ekwyala e Zɛɛb náá, Yezu ɛ́ Mɛsia.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Pɔl pɛ ghaada Efɛɛz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Dáa Apolɔs nadi pɛ Koolɛt ɛ, Pɔl nadi edhaa pɛ mɛl mɛ mɛtsok, pɛ kyee dik Azi. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛkum pɛ ghaada Efɛɛz. Nyɛ eezɛbela ba bim bɛdjekel tin, <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />nyɛ eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bi naabela Sisim na Dɛɛ, é sok bi nadum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ?» Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Bis dinaa ààpakogwak-gwakak bot elii dum nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Tin, Pɔl eezɛdji bɛ náá: «Bi duwa Zɛɛb yak kwaambi ɛduwa?» Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Ɛduwa Zɛɛb ɛ Zaŋ.» <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Pɔl eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Zaŋ naduu Zɛɛb ɛ́ bot ɛ namyaal ɛswoola mɛfulu ɔ. Nyɛ nadi eke nɛ bot ɛ mbyak Yisalaɛl náá, bɛ dum koŋ nɛ mot di ezyɛ bhii nyɛy ɔ, mot tak nabɛ ɛ́ Yezu.» <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Bhii bɛ nazegwak etɛp binek djas ɛ, bɛ eezɛduwa Zɛɛb nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Bhii tak, Pɔl eezɛkɛl bɛ mɛmbɔ, tin, bɛ eezɛbela Sisim na Dɛɛ. Bɛ moo tin elii tɔ elii membyak mɛ sis, nɛ ɛgoola bɛ mɛbhaadal mɛ Zɛɛb djɛ bɛ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Bot ɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́, bot kam nɛ bɛbá.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />É bɛngɔn ɛlɛl, Pɔl nadi etɔ́ pɛ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda, tin, nyɛ naalii nɛ ɛbwaalel djas. Nyɛ nalelii nɛ nɔɔ ɛ́, dum nɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb, nyɛ nadi esaa náá, bot ɛ nadi egwak nyɛ ɔ, myaal nyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Deenek, bɛdhiiti bɛtɛ nɛ bot naadyeebasa maa-ɛlɔ, bɔɔ byen ɛmyaal, bɛ moo tin esa avusu dum nɛ mɛze ɛ Ghɛŋ é mis mɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot. Deenek, Pɔl eezɛdus tin lik bɛ. Nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ bɛ nɛ bɛdjekel bɛ, tin, nyɛ nadi elyo bɛ mɛlu djas tɔ ndjaa mɛlyo mɛ dhiiti mot din ɛ lɛ ɛ́ Tilanus. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Deenek, ye naabɔya membu membá, ye naasa náá, bot ɛ mbyak eYuda nɛ bot ɛ mbyak eGhɛlɛk nadi pɛ kyee dik Azi djas ɔ, gwak mɛkpa ɛ Ghɛŋ.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bɔn ɛ Seeva yii botom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Zɛɛb nadi esa eboo endem mɛbwala é ze ɛ Pɔl. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ bot nadi etɔ́ pɛ daa bot ɛ mɛbɛ́ nɛ epes ekaad, nɛ ekaad ee nakee nyel ɛ Pɔl ɛ. Deenek, bɛ nadi ebela tsik, embee esisim nadi ewyis tɔ lɔɔ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Bɛdhiiti eYuda ee nadi ekɛ mɛl ɛ mɛl étɛp ɛkɛsɔ embee esisim tɔ bot ɛ mɛbɛ́ ɔ, naagek ɛsa yɛ nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu. Deenek, bɛ nakeke nɛ embee esisim ɛ́ náá: «Mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, bi wyis nɛ din ɛ Yezu, Pɔl di egoola mɛkpa mɛ ɔ.» <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ bɔn ɛtɛn nɛ bɛbá ɛ boo ghaa-Zɛɛb mbyak eYuda nadi edjóoaa Seeva ɔ, nadi esesa. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Tin, dhiiti dwoo, wɔ gwaa, mbee sisim zɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Mɛ nɛ gu Yezu, mɛ nɛ baagu pe Pɔl. Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ ɔɔ, biyɔ ɛ́ bɛzɛ?» <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />É di'enek, wɔ gwaa, mot nadi nɛ mbee sisim ɔ, zɛghaaga bɛ é mɛnyel, dáa nyɛ nadi nɛ ghwyil dhaa bɛ ɛ, wɔ gwaa nyɛ zɛduma bɛ é mɛnyel nɛ mɛbin nɛ ebhooba djas. Bɛ nadus tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ tin ɛ́, nɛ ekaab bhen toto, nɛ mɛpyoŋ é mɛnyel kpeeeŋ. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Bot ɛ dɛl Efɛɛz, bot ɛ mbyak eYuda nɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, zokagwak tɛp tak, wɔ gwaa, boo bwoo zɛmɛt bɛ. Tin, bɛ naazɛbela boo duu dum nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Bɛtɛ nɛ bot tɔ sama bot ɛ namyaal Zɛɛb ɔ nadi ezyɛ é mis mɛ bot djas zɛvaa embee esesɛɛ bɛ nadi esa ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Bɛtɛ nɛ bot tɔ sama bot ɛ nadi esa etɛp ee mɛvyɛkɛlɛ mɛ mɛsimba ɔ, zokazyɛ nɛ bɛmɛkana mɔɔ, zɛdik yɛ é mis mɛ bot djas. Dáa bɛ nalaa mɛtaŋ mɛ bɛmɛkana mɛ tak ɛ, ye naasa tyee bɛmil mɛkam-mɛtɛn mɛtaŋ mɛ eghwooz ee di esaaa epata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bɛmil mɛkam-mɛtɛn mɛtaŋ mɛ eghwooz ee di esaaa epata </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ye nabɛ ɛ́ mɛtaŋ mɛ efute ee mot di egoka nɛ ɛbela bhis mɛsa membu kam nɛ etɛn ɛ.</char></note> nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Yɛ ɛ́ deenek nɛ ghwyil ɛ Ghɛŋ ɛ, Mbɛɛ Bhaadal nadi egoolel, nɛ mɛbwala.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛghuub pɛ ghaada Efɛɛz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Bhis etɛp binek, Pɔl eezɛmyaal ɛtsaal kyee dik Masedwan nɛ Ghɛlɛs étɛp ɛtɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm. Nyɛy náá: «Bhii mɛ aakum ɛ, ye goka ɛ́ mɛ dhaa kɛbee dɛl ɛ Lɔm.» <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Tin, nyɛ eezɛkyeed bot ɛbá nadi ekwye-kwyee nyɛ ɔ pɛ Masedwan, ye nabɛ ɛ́ Timote bɛ nɛ Eelasetɛ. Tin, nyɛ naazɛlik ba mɛlu pɛ kyee dik Azi. <verse eid="ACT 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />É ghɛŋ tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́, boo ɛghuub naazɛni kɔ ghaada Efɛɛz dum nɛ bot ɛ nadi edu mɛze ɛ Ghɛŋ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Wɔ gwaa, dhiiti mot ɛswom, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Dhemetulus, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ lulel mɛsum. Nyɛ nadi elul esonok nɛ mbi eghwooz djas ee di esaaa epata nɛ yɛ ɛ, yii mɔɔ ndjaa-zɛɛb moma Aaletemis. Dhemetulus nadi esa mɛsa menek, nɛ ɛdjɛ bɛswom ɛ bot bɛtɛ nɛ epata. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛsɛɛg bot ɛ tak, nɛ bot ɛ mɛsa mɔɔ nadi enɔŋel nɛ mɛsa mɛ tak ɛ, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bɛwɛn, bi nɛ gu náá, yɛ ɛ́ mɛsa mak ɛ di edjɛka mena ekum. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Deenek, bi ɛpegwak nɛghu bi ɛpebee sa di esael ɛ: Pɔl tak lɛɛ bot ɛ́ náá, bɛzɛɛb ɛ bot di kpak nɛ mɛmbɔ ɛ, tok bɛtɛtɛ ɛ bɛzɛɛb. Nyɛ eebatasa náá, bot ɛbuɛpe di wak kɔ Efɛɛz ɔ, dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ mɛl mɛ di pɛ kyee dik Azi djas ɔ, myaal etɛp e tak. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Etɛp binek ɛ́ sa náá, mɛsa mena gwyɛ, deenek, é di tak, bot ɛ́ waabhina ndjaa Aaletemis zɛɛb moma. Tin, bot ɛ́ waadis duu ɛ Aaletemis boo zɛɛb. Bela náá, zɛɛb'ak yii moma ɛpeduwalaa kɔ kyee dik Azi djas nɛ kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs djas.» <verse eid="ACT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Dáa bɔt nagwak deenek ɛ́, bɛ boozɛkpaa elyem ɛbuɛpe, bɛ moo tin etsim náá: «Aaletemis yii bot ɛ Efɛɛz nɛ bɔk!» <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Tin, ɛzɛm eezɛni kɔ ghaada djas. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛmɛt Ghayus bɛ nɛ Aalistaalak bot ɛbá ɛ dɛl ɛ Masedwan, bot ɛ nadi egyee bɛ nɛ Pɔl é mɛdjoŋ ɔ. Tin, zukamwaa nɛ mot'enɔk eezɛtɔ́ nɛ nɔɔ kaab pɛ ɛbwak ɛ boo zɛɛga. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />É di'enek, Pɔl nadi ekwyɛl ɛni, nyɛ neekɛlyaal nyel pɛ zukamwaa nɛ mot nasɛɛga ɛ. Tin, bɛdjekel eezɛlu nyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Bɛdhiiti ekukuma e kyee dik Azi, bot ɛ nadi bɛsɔ bɛ ɔ, zokakyeed nyɛ menduk mɛ tak wat náá, nyɛ nàtɔ́ pɛ ɛbwak ɛ boo zɛɛga tak. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />É di'enek tɔ mɛdhuu mɛ bot binɔk, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ boo zyaala. Bɛdhiiti nadi etsim sa sis, bak bɛdhiiti sa sis, bak bɛdhiiti bot pak'ɔɔ nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi egu mɛsɔ mɛ tɛp bɛ nasɛɛga kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Wɔ gwaa, bɛdhiiti eYuda tɔ mɛdhuu mɛ bot binɔk zokazɛbesal dhiiti mot pɛ sok, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Alɛkzandɛlɛ. Tin, bɛ eezɛbaŋa nyɛ lo tɛp, é di'enek Alɛkzandɛlɛ eezɛben mbɔ étɛp nyɛ neelii, nyɛ neelɛɛ lo mɛsɔ. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Tin, dáa bot nagwyák náá, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ mot mbyak eYuda ɛ, bɔɔ djas ɛ́ boozɛbo boo tsim wat, ye naabɔya tyee mɛwala mɛmbá bɔɔ etsim náá: «Bɔk-bɔk ɛ di Aaletemis zɛɛb bot ɛ dɛl Efɛɛz!»<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Tin, dhiiti kukuma ngɔt ghaada eezɛsil bɛ elyem, nyɛy náá: «Bot ɛ dɛl Efɛɛz, bot djas nɛ gu náá, ghaada Efɛɛz ɛ́ di ebaal ndjaa Aaletemis boo zɛɛb moma, dɔɔ nɛ sa nakpakaa nɛ ɛkok yii di nɔŋel nɛ ɛbhwoob ɛ lɛ, nadus tɔ gwoo ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Ye tok nɛ mot aaswonal yɛ. Deenek, bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsil ɛ elyem, nàsaka etɛp dáa bot ɛ di ààdi nɛ esiiza ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Bi zyɛ wak ɛ́ nɛ bot ɛ wat di náá, bɛ ààpadjii esa ee di tɔ mendjaa mɛ zɛɛb ɛ, baabela náá, bɛ ààpalee zɛɛb'ena yii moma. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Yɛ bɛ náá, Dhemetulus, bɛ nɛ sama bɛswom ɛ bot ɛ́ nɛ tɛp bɛ di egoka nɛ ɛpit mot kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɔɔ, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ mendjaa mɛ etɛp di epɛ́ɛaa ɛ nɛ bɛtetɛp ɛ tak. Yɛ ɛ́ penek ɛ bɛ di egoka nɛ ɛkɛpit. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Tin, yɛ bɛ náá, bi dinaa nɛ dhiiti tɛp bi di baakwyɛl ɛlii ɔɔ, mena aaliika yɛ ɛ, pɛ zɛɛga mendjaala, pɛ ye di egoka nɛ ɛliiaa etɛp ee di dum nɛ etsi bina ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Etɛɛ náá, mena ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdjóoaaka bot ɛ di ekus ɛghuub ɔ, dum nɛ sa sael mos ɛ. Bela náá, mena tokeka nɛ mɛgham mɛ mena aadjɛka é mbi yak zɛɛga. Bɛ kodji ɛsuk ɛ tɛp tak ɔɔ, ye tok nɛ mot aabaŋa bot ɛnyɔɛpe lo mɛsɔ mɛ tɛp tak na sɛŋ tɔ mɛlɔ.» <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Bhii nyɛ nalii deenek ɛ́, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛswaal zukamwaa nɛ mot nadi tin ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Goŋ mɛdjoŋ ɛ Pɔl pɛ mɛdhik mɛ Masedwan nɛ Ghɛlɛs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Dáa ɛghuub nasi ɛ, Pɔl eezɛsɛɛg bɛdjekel, nyɛ eezɛni é ɛdjɛ bɛ mɛghaaz mɛ ɛwa zii tɔ ɛdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛmwana nɛ nɔɔ, deenek, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ nyel'ɛ tɔ́ pɛ dik Masedwan. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Nyɛ eezɛkpaa kɔ pes dik tak, tin, nyɛ eebaazɛdjɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg di penek ɔ, ghwyil ɛwa zii tɔ ɛdu ɛ Zɛɛb. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Ghɛlɛs, <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />pɛ nyɛ nasa bɛngɔn ɛlɛl ɛ. Nyɛ nawaadi etɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Siili tɔ mɛsuwa, dáa nyɛ nakagwak náá, bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɛ́ é boob kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke náá, ye goka ɛ́, nyɛ sik pɛ ze Masedwan. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Tin, Sopatɛɛd, mɔɔ Pyiidus mot ghaada Bheede, zokatɔ́ sama wat nɛ nɛ, zɛnɔɔ Aalistaalak nɛ Sɛkundus mot ghaada Tesalonik, Ghayus mot ghaada Dhɛlɛɛb, nɛ Timote, nɛ Tsisik zɛnɔɔ Tolofim mot kyee dik Azi. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Bɔɔ djas ɛ naleetɔ́ ɛsok, wɔ gwaa, bɛ kɛbwood bis pɛ ghaada Toloas. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Yɛ kabɛ bis ɔɔ, bis nadus pɛ ghaada Filip ɛ́ tɔ mɛsuwa, bhis ɛbyoŋ ɛ emapa ee di ààbɛ nɛ leviid ɛ. Tin, mɛlu mɛtɛn bhii tak, bis ɛ́ bookɛboma nɛ nɔɔ pɛ Toloas, é di'enek bis naadi yenga wat.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛdjoŋ mɛ mɛsik ɛ Pɔl pɛ ghaada Toloas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />É ɛlu ɛ etɛn nɛ wat e yenga, bis naazɛboma étɛp bis needɛ kɔminyɔŋ. Tin, Pɔl eezɛni nɛ ɛlii nɛ bot ɛ zɛɛga. Dáa ye nabɛ náá, nyɛ waadhaa djɛmɛn tak ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛdul ɛlii kɛkum kuku ɛgha ɛ pum. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Pɛ tɔ dhɛŋ bis nasɛɛga tɔ tak pɛ ɛko ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ elama ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Dhiiti mɔɔ ngbaaz nɛ din ɛ Etik nadi ɛ́ ndiindel kɔ ka ɛyen ɛ ndjaa Pɔl nadi tɔ tak ɛ. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛni é gɔ́ syaaaz, é sok Pɔl nadi elii ɛ. Tin, nyɛy tɔ gɔ́, nyɛ eezɛbek kɔ ɛyen ɛ ndjaa na ghɛl yii elɛl, duma si. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zokazɛghɛɛ nyɛ, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nyɛ eezegwyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Tin, Pɔl eezɛsul, nyɛ eezɛmalal kɔ lɛ, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛbɛp nyɛ kɔ mɛmbɔ mɛ, nyɛy náá: «Nàbemka kɛŋ: nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ tsik!» <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛbaabyet, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ mapa, pyak yɛ, tin nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ yɛ, dɛ. Bhii nyɛ nakabaalii ɛbuɛpe kɛkum ɛlyamla ɛ mɛlem ɛ, nyɛ boozɛnɔɔ nyel tɔ́. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Tin bɛ eekɛkyeed mɔɔ ngbaaz yenɔk, nyɛy nɛ nyel ɛnyɔɛpe nɛ tsik. Ye nabɛ ɛ́, ye naadjɛ bot djas boo mɛghaaz mɛ ɛdu ɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛdjoŋ dusa pɛ Toloas tɔ́ pɛ Milɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Bis eetɔ́ ɛsok étɛp ɛkɛni tɔ mɛsuwa mɛ natɔ́ pɛ Asɔs pɛ kyee bis nawaakɛnɔɔ Pɔl ɛ, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nakwyɛl ɛtɔ́ ɛ́ nɛ mɛko. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Dáa nyɛ nakaboma nɛ nes pɛ Asɔs ɛ, bis eezɛnɔɔ nyɛ tɔ mɛsuwa, étɛp bis neetɔ́ pɛ dɛl Mitilɛn. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Dusa bis nadus tin ɛ, bis eezɛsik, tin, djɛmɛn tak bis eezɛkum pɛ sok bhwoob Siyo. Bhii djɛmɛn tak, bis eekum pɛ Samɔs, tin, emyɛn tak, bis eezɛkum pɛ Milɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Pɔl nabɛ ɛ́ ààkwyɛl ɛtyaa pɛ Efɛɛz, ekaab náá, nyɛ zɛkɛbɔya kɔ kyee dik Azi. Nyɛ nadi etɔ́ kaab ɛ́ kaab é ɛsuu náá, dwoo Patekɔt neekɛbela nyɛ, nyɛy pɛ Yeluzalɛm.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl eezɛmwana nɛ bɛpaa ɛ Efɛɛz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Pɛ Pɔl nadi pɛ Milɛ ɛ, nyɛ eezɛkyeed mot nɛ bhaadal pɛ Efɛɛz, bɛ kɛdjóo bɛpaa ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Dáa bɛ nakakum pɛ daa lɛ ɛ, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bi nɛ gu mɛfulu mɛ mɛ nadi egyee nɛ yɛ pak'en kana dwoo mɛ nakum pɛ kyee dik Azi ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Mɛ naasa mɛsa ɛ Ghɛŋ ààbɛ nɛ ɛbet, tɔ ghoŋ nɛ mezuk dum nɛ bhoob mbee lyem bot ɛ mbyak eYuda nadi nɛ yɛ nɛ nam ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Bi nɛ gu náá, ye tok nɛ dhiiti mbɛɛ tɛp mɛ nasyel ɛlɛɛ bin. Mɛ naazegoola nɛ ɛlyo ɛ́ bin dum nɛ etɛp djas é mɛbɛsɛɛ nɛ tɔ mendjaa men. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Mɛ naadul bot ɛ mbyak eYuda nɛ bot ɛ mbyak eGhɛlɛk mɛlɔ náá, bɛ liig elyem, da bɛ ɛ́ du Zɛɛb, nɛ ɛbaadum ɛ koŋ nɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Nenak, mɛ moo tɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm, dáa Sisim na Dɛɛ lwom mɛ nɛ bhel náá, mɛ sa ɛ. Tin, mɛ ààgu sa di ebwood mɛ pɛ sok ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Sa mɛ di egu ɛ́ náá, kɔ eghaada djas, Sisim na Dɛɛ nadi elɛɛ mɛ náá, membok nɛ mezuk ɛpebwood mɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Bela náá, tsik'am met tok nɛ boo mɛtaŋ é mis mam. Yii di nɛ boo mɛtaŋ ɛ́, yɛ ɛ́ ɛtɔ́ kɛkum pɛ ɛsik ɛ lwomel'am, nɛ ɛsilal ɛ bim mɛsa mɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu nadjɛ mɛ ɛ: Ɛgoola ɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal yii enɛm nɛ embɛɛ e Zɛɛb.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />Mɛ eedhaa tɔ sama yen é ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb, tin, mɛ nɛ gu náá, ye tok nɛ mot aakabaabee mɛ tɔ sama yen. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ di elɛɛ nɛ nen mos náá, mɛ ɛ́ sosoob: mot ngɔt pak'en ɛ kɛwo ze ɔɔ, yenek ààkagwyák mɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Etɛɛ náá, mɛ eezɛlyaal bin egeka e Zɛɛb djas, ààsyel sa wat. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Bi ɛ́ konyan mis kɔ biyɔ bɛmet, nɛ kɔ ɛsaa ɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ djɛ bin bi baal ɛ. Bi ɛ́ kobaal zɛɛga mendjaala mɛ Zɛɛb nabɔm nɛ ghiya mɔn'ɛ met ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Mɛ nɛ gu náá, bhii mɛ aatɔ́ ɛ, bot ɛ di enɔŋel nɛ eben ɔ waazɛni pak'en, tin, bɛ aanàkwaagek ɛsaa ghoŋ. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Tin, dɔɔ nɛ tɔ sama yen, bot ɛ́ waani nɛ ɛlɛɛ elɛŋ e etsal, étɛp bɛdhiiti bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ needu bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Bɛɛka mis, da bi ɛ́ taala náá, tɔ membu melɛl mwos nɛ pum, mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkat ɛdul ɛ́ bin mɛlɔ, ye nakoozodi nɛ miŋal é mis.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Nenak, mɛ ɛpedjɛ bin é mɛmbɔ mɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ bhaadal enɛm nɛ embɛɛ bɛ. Nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa náá, bi wyee tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ ɛdjɛ bin esesɛɛ djas nyɛ nakwom étɛp bot bɛ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààsaa epata, ààsaa elɔɔd, ààsaa ekaad e bot. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Biyɔ bɛmet nɛ gu náá, mɛ nadi esa mɛsa nɛ mɛmbɔ mam met, étɛp mɛ neebela esa ee bis nɛ bot ɛ di egyee nɛ nam nadi nɛ gwyes tak ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Mɛ nabɛ ɛ́, mɛ eelyaal bin náá, ye goka ɛ́ bi sa mɛsa étɛp bi neekwyee bɛdjel ɛ bot. Bi baataala etɛp ee Ghɛŋ Yezu nyɛy ɛmet nake náá: “Ɛgwyena mot sonok eedhaa ɛbela sonok nɛ mɛnyɔ!”»<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Bhis yenek, Pɔl eezɛkwyit mɛboŋ si bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ, bɛ eezɛni edjaala. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Bɔɔ djas moo tin edje, bhii tak, bɛ eezɛbeedal Pɔl tɔ mɛmbɔ mɔɔ, bɛ neemwana nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Bɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ boo goŋ tɔ elyem, etɛɛ náá, Pɔl naake náá, bɛ aanàkabaaboma nɛ nɛ. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛtɔ́ kɛmwana nɛ nɛ pɛ mɛsuwa nadi ɛ.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Pɔl eetɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Bhii bis nɛ bɛnɔɔ nabɛka ɛ, bis eezɛni tɔ mɛsuwa tɔ́ pɛ ghola Kɔɔs. Djɛmɛn tak, bis eezɛkum pɛ ghola Lood, dusa bis nadus tin ɛ, bis eezɛtɔ́ pɛ ɛboŋ Patala. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Dáa bis nabela mɛsuwa é tsaal tɔ pɛ Fenisi ɛ, bis eezɛni tɔ mɛsuwa mɛ tak, bis eezɛtɔ́. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Dáa bis nadi, bis moo é ngwoob ghola Siipɛlɛ ɛ, bis eezɛdhaa pɛ pak kyɛ ghola tak, étɛp bis neetɔ́ pɛ dik Siili. Bis eezɛtɔ́ pɛ ghaada Tiid, pɛ kyee bɛ nadi ekekɛɛ esa ee nadi tɔ mɛsuwa ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Bis eezɛboma nɛ bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, bis eezɛdhaa yenga wat tin bis nɛ bɛnɔɔ. Dáa ye nabɛ náá, Sisim na Dɛɛ naazedul bɛ mɛlɔ ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛke nɛ Pɔl náá, nyɛ nàtɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Tin, dáa yenga tak nadhaŋ ɛ, bis eezɛnɔɔ mɛnyel dhaa. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛmwana nɛ nes pɛ esik ɛ dɛl, bɔɔ nɛ bɛl bɔɔ, zɛnɔɔ bɔn bɔɔ. Tin, bis eezɛkwyit mɛboŋ si é ɛboŋ ɛ boo dii mɛsɔn, bis moo tin edjaala Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Deenek, dáa bis nɛ bɛnɔɔ nasilal ɛmwana pak'es ɛ, bis eezɛni tɔ mɛsuwa, é di'enek, bɛ eezɛsik pɛ mendjaa mɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Bis nasilal goŋ mɛdjoŋ mes ɛ́, kɔ boo dii mɛsɔn, bhii tak, bis nadus pɛ ghaada Tiid, tɔ́ pɛ ɛboŋ Potolemayis ɛ. Bhis bis nasilal ɛswos bɔn-nyɛɛg bis di kɔ ghaada tak ɛ, bis eezɛkwyɛɛg ɛlu ɛ wat bis nɛ bɛnɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Djɛmɛn tak, bis eezɛsik, bis eezɛtɔ́ pɛ ghaada Sezaale. É di'enek, bis eezɛsulal pɛ ndjaŋ ɛ Filip, lyoel Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. Yɛ pɛ daa lɛ ɛ bis nadjaasi. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ngɔt tɔ bot ɛtɛn nɛ bɛbá bɛ nasɛ́ɛ pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛsyes mɛ bɔɔ boa bɛná, bɛ nadi egegoola mɛbhaadal mɛ Zɛɛb nadi edjɛ bɛ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Bis nabɛ ɛ́ bis moo nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ mɛlu tin, é ghɛŋ dhiiti ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ din ɛ Aghabis nazɛdus pɛ kyee dik Yude, zyɛ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Nyɛ eezɛzyɛ pɛ daa les, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ bhɛtɛ ɛ Pɔl, kɔl mɛko mɛ nɛ mɛmbɔ mɛ, bhii tak, nyɛy náá: «Beeka sa Sisim na Dɛɛ lɛɛ ɛ: Nakuma bhɛtɛ yak ɛ́ waakɔlaa nɛ ekel dáak nɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda, pɛ Yeluzalɛm, bhii tak, nyɛ waakaa é mɛmbɔ mɛ bot ɛ membyak mɛ sis.» <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Bhii bis nagwak etɛp binek ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bisɔ djas nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg bis e dɛl ɛ Sezaale zokazɛdjaala nɛ Pɔl náá, nyɛ nàtɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Tin, nyɛ eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Étɛp yé bi di edji nɛ ɛsa náá, bi djɛ mɛ lyem bwoo? Mam eezemyaal nɛ lyem'am, ye nakoozodi ɛkɔlaa nɛ ekel, nɛghu ɛsyee pɛ Yeluzalɛm kɔ ɛsu ɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu.» <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Dáa bis nadi ààkwak ɛlu ɛ́ nyɛ ɛ, bis nabɛ ɛ́ ààkabaanenal nyel, bis ɛ́ booke náá: «Ɛkwosak ɛ Ghɛŋ sael!»<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Dáa bis nakadhaa ba mɛlu é di'enek ɛ, bis eezɛkaŋal esa, bhii tak, bis eezɛtɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Bɛdjekel ɛ nadi pɛ Sezaale ɔ zokakɛkyeed bis, bɔɔ zokatɔ́ nɛ nes pɛ ndjaa dhiiti mot bis nawaasulal pɛ daa lɛ ɔ. Din ɛ mot tak nabɛ ɛ́ Mɛnasɔn, mot Siipɛlɛ, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ tɔ sama bɛdjekel ɛ mɛkɛn.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl eetɔ́ kɛbee Zak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Dáa bis nakum pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ, bɔn-nyɛɛg bis zokazɛboma nɛ nes, nɛ mɛmyaala djas. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Djɛmɛn tak, bis nɛ Pɔl eezɛtɔ́ pɛ daa Zak, pɛ pak bɛpaa ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala nasɛɛga ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Tin, Pɔl eezɛswos bɛ, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛni nɛ ɛbaŋa bɛ etɛp ee Zɛɛb nasa pɛ daa bot ɛ membyak mɛ sis ɛ wat-wat. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Bhii bɛ nazegwak nyɛ ɛ, bɛ eezɛduwal Zɛɛb. É di'enek, bɛ eezɛke nɛ Pɔl náá: «Mɔn-nyɛɛg wɔ eebee dáa eYuda bɛmil nɛ bɛmil moo mos eedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, elyem bɔɔ djas nɛ dyeebakwyɛsa tɔ etsi. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Ghuna, beeka sa bis nalɛɛ bɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɔ ɛ: Wɔ ɛpelyo bot ɛ mbyak eYuda djas di é di wat bɛ nɛ bot ɛ membyak mɛ sis ɔ náá, ye nyɔ ɛ́ bɛ byen etsi ɛ Moiiz. Wɔ lɛɛ bɛ ɛ́ náá, bɛ kat ɛniigal bɔn bɔɔ beka, dɔɔ nɛ ɛkat ɛdu ɛ́ mɛzel mɛ eYuda. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Bis sa dáa? Bɛ waagu nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, wɔ eezekum. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Deenek, sa sa bis lɛɛ wɔ ɛ. Menaka wak ɛ́ nɛ botom ɛná nazesa ekɛk nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Nɔŋa bɛ, da bi ɛ́ kɛgwyiia étɛp ɛdis edhuud bi nɛ bɛnɔɔ, bhii tak da wɔ ɛ́ kɛdjɛ bɛ epata ee di egoka ɛ, étɛp bɛ neetsik bɛ lo. Deenek, bot djas neegu náá, etɛp ee bot nadi elɛɛ dum nɛ nɔ ɛ, nabɛ ɛ́ etɛp ee mɛkɔŋ, deenek, dɔɔ nɛ wɔy pe wɔ ɛ duwal etsi ɛ Moiiz. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Yɛ kabɛ bot ɛ membyak mɛ sis di dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, tɔ mɛkana mɛ bis nakwyal ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ bis naalɛɛ bɛ egeka bis djas. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ náá, bɛ ààgoka nɛ ɛdɛ bɛtit ɛ nakaaa étɛp ɛdjɛ bɛzɛɛb ɛ bɛnaghisɛ ebuwa ɔ, nɛ ghiya nɛ epuud e bɛtit ɛ nagóaa nɛ bhiyo ɔ, zɛbaanɔɔ náá, sa bi ààsa mɛzɔ.»<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Tin, Pɔl eezɛtɔ́ bɛ nɛ bot ɛná binɔk, tɔ yak mɛlem tak, bɛ eezɛtɔ́ kɛsa mɛzel mɛ ɛkɛgwyiia edhuud. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa etɛp ɛkɛlɛɛ dwoo mɛzel mɛ ɛgwyiia edhuud aasi ɛ, yɛ dwoo tak ɛ́ bɛ di egoka nɛ ɛgó ɛ́ ebuwa kɔ ɛsu ɛ mot ngɔt-ngɔt pak'ɔɔ ɛ.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl eezɛmɛtaa pɛ tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́ mɛlu mɛtɛn nɛ ebá moo ekɔ nɛ ɛkum, wɔ gwaa, eYuda e kyee dik Azi zokazyɛ zɛbee Pɔl pɛ tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛful ɛdhuu ɛ bot ɛ nadi tin ɔ, elo. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛmɛt Pɔl, <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />bɔɔ é tsim náá: «Bot ɛ Yisalaɛl, dhaka zɛkwyee bis! Beeka mot di elyo bot djas, é edi djas mbee mɛlyo dum nɛ Yisalaɛl, nɛ etsi ɛ Moiiz, zɛnɔɔ dum nɛ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa ɔ. Deenek, nyɛ eezebataniigal bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ tɔ Ndjaa-ebuwa. Tin, nyɛ eezesaab Di na Dɛɛ tak!» <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Bɛ nalii deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ bɛ naabee Tolofim, mot dɛl ɛ Efɛɛz, bɛ nɛ Pɔl pɛ tɔ ghaada. Bɛ nagu ɛ́ náá, Pɔl naaniigal nyɛ tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Ɛghuub ɛ tak eezɛdjala kɔ ghaada djas, bhwak moo tin metetel nɛ ekaab, é edi djas. Bɛ eezɛmɛt Pɔl, bɛ eezɛwyisal nyɛ tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa, bhii tak, bɛ eezɛdiyal mɛbɛ mɛ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Dáa bɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛgó Pɔl ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ menduk mɛ ɛzɛm ɛ nadi esael pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ, naagék pɛ daa komanda mwaka esodja e Lɔm. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />É di tak wat, nyɛ eezɛnɔɔ bɛdhiiti ekukuma lɔɔg esodja, nɛ bɛdhiiti esodja yii pɛ si, bɛ eezɛwyis kaab, tɔ́ pɛ kyee ɛdhuu ɛ bot nadi ɛ. Dáa bɛ nabee komanda esodja nɛ bɛdhiiti esodja ɛ, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛkat ɛbi ɛ́ Pɔl. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Tin, komanda esodja eezɛtiila pɛ daa lɛ, nyɛ eezɛlwom náá, bɛ mɛt nyɛ, da bɛ ɛ́ kɔl nyɛ nɛ ekel e ghwooz ebá. Bhii tak, komanda eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Wɔy ɛzɛ, wɔ sa yé?» <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Tin, pɛ tɔ ɛdhuu ɛ bot, bɛdhiiti bot nadi etsim ɛ́ sa sis, bak bɛdhiiti sa sis. Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́, yɛ eelyel náá, komanda mɛt sa wat tɔ ɛzɛm ɛ tak. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke náá, bɛ tɔ́ nɛ Pɔl pɛ tɔ peeb esodja. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Dáa Pɔl nakum é di bot di ebyet etɛp ɛ́ ɛni tɔ peeb ɛ, ye nagoka ɛ́ náá, esodja ɛzɛghɛɛ nyɛ. Bɛ nadi ekaab ɛlyel ɛ kuukuu mɛdhuu mɛ bot, <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />etɛɛ náá, bot djas nadi edu nyɛ bɔɔ etsitsim náá: «Góa nyɛ!»<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl eezɛtaŋal yɛ taŋal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />É ghɛŋ bɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛniigal Pɔl tɔ peeb esodja ɛ, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ komanda náá: «Mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛlii é?» Tin, komanda esodja eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Wɔ nɛ gu ɛlii mbyak eGhɛlɛk é? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Deenek, wɔ tok mot dik Eziptɛ, mot nazɛkus ɛghuub koko ɛ koko wak, da nyɛ ɛ́ zɛtɔ́ nɛ bot bɛmil ɛná (4 000) di egu ɛlumla dɛɛb, kɔ kyee bɔs bɛsyɛ di ààbɛ nɛ mɛdii ɛ ɔ?» <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Tin, Pɔl eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Mam ɛ́ mot mbyak eYuda, mɛ nabyel ɛ́ pɛ ghaada Taalas, pɛ kyee dik Silisi, mot boo ghaada di nɛ boo ngék ɔ. “Mɛ eemɛt wɔ ɛboŋ”, beta náá, mɛ lii nɛ bot bak.» <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />É di'enek, komanda eezɛdjɛ nyɛ ze ɛlii. Tin, Pɔl eezɛtyaa tetel kɔ ɛgoɛl ɛ ɛniel ɛ peeb, nyɛ eezɛpyap ɛdhuu ɛ bot binɔk mbɔ, bɛ di gwyem étɛp bɛ neegwak nyɛ. Bɔɔ djas eezɛdi gwyem, tin nyɛ moo elii nɛ nɔɔ tɔ lii eBhele.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />«Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam nɛ bɛsɛɛg bam, gwakeka sa mɛ di elɛɛ bin nenak dum nɛ yam taŋal ɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Dáa bɛ nadi egwak, dáa nyɛ nadi elii tɔ lii eBhele ɛ, bɛ eebaazɛdi gwyem ɛnyɔɛpe, tin, Pɔl eezɛke náá: <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />«Mɛ ɛ́ mot mbyak eYuda, mɛ nabyel ɛ́ pɛ Taalas pɛ kyee dik Silisi, deenek mɛ nawyilaa ɛ́ wak kɔ Yeluzalɛm. Deenek, lyoel yam nabɛ ɛ́, Ghamalyɛl, nyɛy ɛ́ nalyaal mɛ ɛtiibal etsi e bɛbhaab benaka ɛnyɔɛpe. Mɛ nabɛ ɛ́, mɛ naakwyɛl mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb dhaa nyel, dáa biyɔ djas di ekwyɛl mos'aak. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Mɛ naawa bot ɛ nadi edu mɛze ɛ Ghɛŋ ɔ tɔ tsik mezuk, batakɛgó bɛ góak. Mɛ eemɛt boa nɛ botom, wa bɛ é membok. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Boo ghaa-zɛɛb nɛ bot ɛ kwan, nɛ bɛpaŋ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛ́ di bɛtyaasɛs náá, etɛp ee mɛ di elɛɛ ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bɛ naadjɛ mɛ mɛkana mɛ ɛtɔ́ pɛ daa bɔn-nyɛɛg bam yii ghaada Dhamas, deenek, mɛ naatɔ́ pɛ ghaada tak. Mɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛ́ kɛmɛt bot ɛ nadi penek ɔ, étɛp mɛ neetɔ́ nɛ nɔɔ kɔla, pɛ Yeluzalɛm, bɛ neekɛwaaa é feŋ.»<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl ɛpebaŋa dáa nyɛ naliig lyem ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />«Mɛ nadi ɛ́ gba-gba mɛ moo ekunaa nɛ ghaada Dhamas, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ye moo ekunaa nɛ kuku mwos. Wɔ gwaa, boo ngel zɛdus tɔ gwoo, mɛkas tak zokazɛkaal mɛ. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Tin, mɛ eezɛduma si, é di tak mɛ kagwak ɛ́ dhiiti gwood é ke nɛ nam náá: “Sɔl, Sɔl, étɛp yé wɔ di etiig mɛ?” <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Tin, mɛ eezɛdji náá: “Wɔy ɛzɛ, Ghɛŋ?” Gwood'enek eezɛbɔɔza náá: “Yɛ ɛ́ mam Yezu mot Nazalɛt, wɔ di etiig ɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Bot ɛ nadi egyee nɛ nam ɔ naabee ngel, saabɛgɔs kabɛ ɛ́ náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́, ààgwak gwood mot nadi elii nɛ nam ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Tin, mɛ eezɛdji náá: “Mɛ goka nɛ ɛsa dáa, Ghɛŋ?” É di'enek, Ghɛŋ eezɛke nɛ nam náá: “Wyɛla, tɔ́a pɛ ghaada Dhamas. Yɛ ɛ́ penek ɛ bɛ aalɛɛ wɔ esa ee Zɛɛb ke náá, wɔ sa ɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Dáa ye nabela náá, mɛkas mɛ ngel tak naadipal mɛ mis ɛ, bot ɛ nadi egyee nɛ nam ɔ, ɛ́ boozɛmɛt mɛ é mbɔ, bɛ ɛ́ boozɛtɔ́ nɛ nam pɛ Dhamas.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Kɔ ghaada tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mot ngɔt, din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Ananias, mot epiki nɛ esosoob tɔ etsi bena. Bot ɛ mbyak eYuda e Dhamas djas nadi eduwal nyɛ ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Nyɛ eezɛboma nɛ nam, nyɛ eezɛtyaa é ngwoob'am, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nam náá: “Sɔl, mɔn-nyaagam, mis mɔ bɛŋel!” É di tak wat, mis mam eezɛbula ɛnyɔɛpe, bhii tak, mɛ eezɛbee nyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Deenek, nyɛ eezɛbaakɛl náá: “Zɛɛb bɛbhaab binaka naazesɛ́ɛ wɔ, étɛp wɔ neegu ɛkwosak ɛ lɛ, wɔ neebee sim Mot Epiki, da wɔ ɛ́ gwak gwood'ɛ met, <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />etɛɛ náá, wɔ needi tyaasɛs'ɛ, étɛp wɔ neegoola nɛ bot djas sa wɔ bee ɛ, nɛ yii wɔ gwak ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Tin, nenak wɔ kabaabwood yé? Wyɛla, kɛduwa Zɛɛb nɛ ɛgwyii ɛ mesyem mɔ, é ɛdjóo ɛ́ din ɛ lɛ.”»<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl ɛpebaŋa dáa nyɛ nalwomaa pɛ daa bot ɛ membyak mɛ sis ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />«Mɛ eezɛsik pɛ Yeluzalɛm. Dáa mɛ nadi edjaala Zɛɛb pɛ tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa ɛ, wɔ gwaa, mɛ zɛbee tyee tɔ dhyam. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Tin, mɛ eezɛbee Ghɛŋ, nyɛy nɛ nam náá: “Lela ɛdus kɔ Yeluzalɛm, etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ dɛl ɛ tak aanàkwaamyaal etɛp ee waalɛɛ bɛ, kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam ɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Mɛ eezɛbɔɔza náá: “Ghɛŋ, bɛ nɛ gu náá, mɛ nadi etetɔ́ tɔ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda, étɛp ɛkɛmɛt bot, wa bɛ é membok nɛ ɛbi ɛ́ bot ɛ nadi edum koŋ nɛ nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Tin, é ghɛŋ bɛ nagó Etiɛn, tyaasɛs'ɔ ɛ, mam pe mɛ nadi ɛ, é di tak. Mɛ naamyaala nɛ bot ɛ nagó nyɛ ɔ, mɛ naabaal ekaad bɔɔ.” <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Tin, Ghɛŋ eezɛke nɛ nam náá: “Tɔ́a, etɛɛ náá, mɛ waakyeed wɔ ɛtsetaɛpe, pɛ daa bot ɛ membyak mɛ sis!”»<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl bɛ nɛ komanda nadi mot kyee dik Lɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Ɛdhuu ɛ bot binɔk zokagwak Pɔl kɛkum é di'enek. Bhii tak, bɔɔ djas eezɛni é tsim: «Nyɛ góaa, mbi mot dáak ààgoka nɛ ɛdi nɛ tsik kɔ bɔs'ak!» <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Bɛ nadi etsim, nɛ ɛwus ɛ́ ekaad bɔɔ pɛ ɛko, nɛ ɛghɛɛ piib, wus pɛ ɛko. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Tin, komanda nadi mot kyee dik Lɔm eezɛlwom náá, bɛ niigal Pɔl tɔ ɛbɛsɛɛ ndjaa esodja, da bɛ ɛ́ nyuu nyɛ nɛ eghwyɛs, étɛp nyɛ neetaŋal nɛ bhel. Nyɛ nasa deenek ɛ́, étɛp bɛ neegu lo mɛsɔ mɛ mɛdhuu mɛ bot nadi etsim deenek kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Tin, dáa bɛ nakɔl nyɛ étɛp bɛ neenyuu nyɛ ɛ, Pɔl eezɛke nɛ dhiiti kukuma tɔ lɔɔg esodja nadi tin ɔ náá: «Bi ɛ́ nɛ gham ɛbi ɛ́ mot ghaada kyee dik Lɔm di náá, nyɛ dinaa ààpapɛ́ɛaa ɔ?» <verse eid="ACT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Dáa kukuma esodja tak nagwak mɛkpa menek ɛ, nyɛ ɛ́ bootɔ́ kɛdul komanda mɛlɔ: «Nyɛ ɛ́ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá, wɔ kwyɛl ɛsa yé? Mot'ak ɛ́ mot dik Lɔm!» <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Tin, komanda eezɛzyɛ pɛ pak Pɔl nadi ɛ́, nyɛ eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Lɛɛa mɛ, yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, wɔ ɛ́ mot ghaada kyee dik Lɔm é?» Pɔl eezɛmyaal náá: «Iyooo». <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Tin, komanda esodja eezɛke náá: «Mam naadjɛ boo mɛtaŋ mɛ epata étɛp mɛ needi mɔn dɛl ɛ Lɔm.» Pɔl eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Yam ɛ́ yii mbyela mɔ.» <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />É di tak wat bot ɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛbi nyɛ étɛp bɛ neebesal nyɛ, nyɛ lii nɛ bhel ɔ, bɛ eezɛbula pɛ bhis, ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ nɛ. Tin, komanda esodja naazɛgwak bwoo, dáa nyɛ nagu náá, Pɔl nabɛ ɛ́ mot kyee dik Lɔm ɛ, bela náá, nyɛ naazelwom náá, nyɛ kɔlaa nɛ eghwooz.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl sok bhwoob zɛɛga ekukuma e boo kwan eYuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Komanda esodja nadi ekwyɛl ɛgu ɛnyɔɛpe lo mɛsɔ mɛ eYuda nadi epit Pɔl ɛ. Étɛp tak ɛ di náá, djɛmɛn yii ɛlu ɛ tak, nyɛ eezɛlwom náá, bɛ tii nyɛ ekel e eghwooz ee nyɛ nakɔlaa nɛ yɛ ɛ. Nyɛ eezɛdjóo eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, zɛnɔɔ zɛɛga ekukuma e boo kwan eYuda. Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛzyɛ nɛ Pɔl, tin, nyɛ eezɛpɛ́ɛaa é mis mɔɔ.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Pɔl eezɛgwyák bot ɛ zɛɛga boo kwan eYuda kpɛɛɛ, nyɛ eezɛke náá: «Bɔn-nyɛɛg yɛ ɛ́ nɛ lyem'am selele ɛ mɛ sa mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb kɛkum dwoo pan mos'ak.» <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Dhiiti boo ghaa-Zɛɛb Ananias eezɛlwom bot ɛ nadi é ngwoob ɛ Pɔl ɔ náá, bɛ nyuu nyɛ é nuub. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Tin, Pɔl eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb ɛ aakwaamyak wɔ, wɔy mot mɛdjhaaz pɛ ɛko, bhimis pɛ si! Wɔ di tin ɛ́ étɛp wɔ neepɛ́ɛ mɛ dum nɛ etsi ɛ Moiiz, bela náá, wɔy ààduwal etsi tak, etɛɛ náá, wɔ eelwom náá bɛ myak mɛ!» <verse eid="ACT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Bot ɛ nadi é ngwoob ɛ Pɔl ɔ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Wɔ lee boo ghaa-Zɛɛb!» <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Pɔl eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Bɔn-nyɛɛg, mɛ bɛ ààgu náá, ye bɛ ɛ́ boo ghaa-zɛɛb. Etɛɛ náá, Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ́ náá: “Sa wɔ aalii ɛbiyoɛpe nɛ dhiiti kukuma mbyak'ɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.5 <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 22:27">Ɛwy 22.27</ref></char></char></note>!”»<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Pɔl nadi egu náá, tɔ zɛɛga boo kwan eYuda tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́, kyee wat eSaduseɛ, yak kyee eFalizyɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ nyɛ nazɛtsim ɛlyelɛpe kuku ɛbwak ɛ lɔɔ náá: «Bɔn-nyɛɛg, mɛ ɛ́ Falizyɛ, mot nabya mɛ ɔ nyɛ ɛ́ Falizyɛ. Mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waagomal bot bhis ɛsyee, étɛp tak bi di epɛ́ɛ mɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Dáa nyɛ nazosilal ɛlii deenek ɛ́, eFalizyɛ bɛ nɛ eSaduseɛ tombooo nɛ ɛwɔ pak'ɔɔ, tin, zɛɛga eezɛbɛka. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Deenek, bɛ nadi esuu mɛso ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, eSaduseɛ ke ɛ́ náá, ɛgom bis ɛsyee tok, efofop tok, esisim tok. Yɛ kabɛ eFalizyɛ ɔɔ, bɔɔ nɛ myaal yɔbɔ náá, esonok binek djas ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Bot djas moo tin etsim ɛlyelɛpe, tin, bɛdhiiti bɛghaŋ ɛ mɛkana mɛ etsi, bot ɛ nadi bot ɛ sama eFalizyɛ ɔ eezɛwyɛl, bɛ eezɛbyen sa tak ɛlyelɛpe, bɔɔ náá: «Bis ààpabee dhiiti tɛp ɛbiyo tɔ mot'ak. Dhiiti sisim, nɛghu dhiiti fofop eelii bilak nɛ nɛ!» <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Dáa ye nadi náá, ɛwɔ nadi ebɔk, ɛbɔk, nɛ ɛbɔk dhaa tyee ɛ, wɔ gwaa komanda zɛbela bwoo ekaab náá, bɛ zɛkɛduma Pɔl é nyel, da gó nyɛ. Tin, nyɛ ɛ́ boolwom esodja bɛ náá, bɛ sul pɛ zɛɛga kwan, bɛ neekɛpɛk Pɔl é mɛmbɔ mɔɔ, bhii tak, da bɛ ɛ́ sik nɛ nɛ pɛ ɛbɛsɛɛ esodja. <verse eid="ACT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />É yak pum bhii tak, Ghɛŋ eezɛlyaal Pɔl nyel, nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Dia nɛ mɛghaaz! Wɔy ɛ́ di tyaasɛs'am wak, kɔ ghaada Yeluzalɛm, deenek, egoka wɔ tɔ́ kɛdi pe tyaasɛs'am pɛ ghaada Lɔm.»<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Boob kɔ ɛsu ɛ Pɔl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Dáa mɛlem nakalem ɛ, dhiiti ba bim eYuda eezɛgwakel é boob, bɛ eezɛtuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mɔɔ náá, bɛ aanàkwaadɛ edee nɛ mɛdii, ɛsok nɛ bɛ nɛ pookogó Pɔl. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Bot ɛ nagwakel é boob tak ɔ naadhaa bot mɛkam-mɛná (40). <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Bɛ eezɛtɔ́ kɛbee eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ bɛpaa, tin, bɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bisɔ, bis eegwakel, nɛ ɛtuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mes nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bis aanàkwaadɛ edee, bis dinaa ààgó Pɔl. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Deenek, biyɔ, sama wat nɛ bot ɛ zɛɛga boo kwan eYuda, kɛwaabka nenak nɛ komanda náá, nyɛ zyɛ bin nɛ Pɔl, kɔɔka nyɛ náá, bi ɛpekwyɛl ɛdjek tɛp'ɛ ɛnyɔɛpe. Yɛ kabɛ bisɔ ɔɔ, bis aadi ɛ́, ebwood nyɛ étɛp bis neegó nyɛ, ɛsok nɛ nyɛ nɛ kum wak.»<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Tin, dhiiti mɔn kɛl ɛ Pɔl, zokagwak dáa bɛ nadi elii é boob tak ɛ. Nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ pɛ ɛbɛsɛɛ ɛ esodja, bɛ eezɛniigal nyɛ, étɛp ɛkɛlɛɛ Pɔl etɛp ee bot binɔk nadi elii dum nɛ nɛ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Tin, Pɔl eezɛdjóo dhiiti kukuma tɔ lɔɔg esodja, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Tɔ́a nɛ mɔɔ ngbaaz'ak pɛ daa komanda, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ tɛp nyɛ di elɛɛ nyɛ ɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Kukuma esodja eezɛnɔɔ nyɛ, nyɛ eezɛtɔ́ nɛ nɛ pɛ daa komanda, nyɛy nɛ nɛ náá: «Mot membok Pɔl bɛ ɛ́ nyɛ eedjóo mɛ, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nam náá, mɛ zyɛ wɔ nɛ mɔɔ ngbaaz'ak. Nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ tɛp ɛlɛɛ wɔ.» <verse eid="ACT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Kukuma esodja eezɛmɛt mɔɔ ngbaaz tak é mbɔ, nyɛ eezɛdul nyɛ é ngwoob bɔɔ bɛbá. Tin, nyɛ eezɛdji nyɛ náá: «Wɔ kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ mɛ yé?» <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Nyɛ eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Bot ɛ mbyak eYuda eegwakel náá, bɛ ɛpezɛwaab náá, djɛmɛn, wɔ tɔ́ nɛ Pɔl sok bhwoob boo kwan eYuda. Bɛ aakɔɔ ɛ́ náá, bot ɛ tak ɛpekwyɛl ɛdjek tɛp'ɛ ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />É di'enek, sa wɔ ààmyaal bɛ, etɛɛ náá, bot, dhaa bot mɛkam-mɛná (40) pak'ɔɔ waalaab nyɛ. Bɛ sa deenek ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bɛ eezegwakel nɛ ɛtuwal myoŋ nɛ mɛsoŋ mɔɔ náá, bɛ aanàkwaadɛ edee nɛ mɛdii, ɛsok nɛ bɛ nɛ gó nyɛ. Bɛ eezekoobal etyɛ, bɛ zokabwood ɛ́ wɔ myaal.» <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Bhii tak, komanda eezɛlɛɛ nɛ mɔɔ ngbaaz tak náá, sa nyɛ ààlɛɛ bot etɛp ee nyɛ baŋa nyɛ ɛ, nyɛ eezɛswaal nyɛ.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl eekyeedaa pɛ daa mɛkoozi mɛ dik Feliksɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Bhii tak, komanda eezɛdjóo edhiiti ekukuma esodja bɛ bɛbá, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Sɛɛgka esodja bɛdhet-ɛbá (200) dɔɔ nɛ esodja ee di ekɛ kɔ eyaaga ɔ mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ mɛkam-mɛmbá (70), zɛnɔɔ bot bɛdhet-ɛbá (200) nɛ mɛkɔɔ mɔɔ, koobalka étɛp ɛtɔ́ pɛ ghaada Sezaale e pum, bhis ɛgwyiidela ɛgwyitok. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Da bi ɛ́ baakoobal dɔɔ nɛ eyaaga, étɛp bi neebɛp Pɔl tɔ́ nɛ nɛ, nyel ɛnyɔɛpe pɛ daa mɛkoozi Feliksɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛkwyal mɛkana náá:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />«Mam Kolood Lyzias eeswos wɔy, Feliksɛ mɛkoozi mɛ dik. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Ye bɛ ɛ́, eYuda eemɛt mot mɛ dhis bin nwyak'enɔk, tin, bɛ di ekwyɛl ɛgó ɛ́ nyɛ. Dáa mɛ nagwak náá, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ mot ghaada kyee dik Lɔm ɛ, bis nɛ esodja bam ɛ́ bookɛlyak, bis eezɛpɛk nyɛ é mɛmbɔ mɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Dáa mɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛgu lo mɛsɔ mɛ eYuda nadi epit nyɛ dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ, mɛ naazɛtɔ́ nɛ nɛ sok bhwoob zɛɛga boo kwan eYuda. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Mɛ eezɛgu náá, bɛ nadi epit nyɛ ɛ́, kɔ ɛsu ɛ etɛp ee di edum nɛ etsi bɔɔ ɛ. Bela náá, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ tɛtɛ tɛp nyɛ nadi egoka nɛ ɛgóaa nɛghu ɛmɛtaa é mbok kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Bhii tak, bɛ naazɛlɛɛ mɛ náá, eYuda nadi egwakel etɛp ɛgó ɛ́ nyɛ, deenek mɛ booke é di tak wat náá, mɛ dhis bin nwyak. Tin, mɛ ɛ́ boolɛɛ nɛ bot ɛ zɛpit nyɛ ɔ náá, bɛ zɛpit nyɛ sok bhwoob'ɔ.»<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Esodja eezɛsa dáa komanda yɔɔ nalɛɛ bɛ ɛ. Bɛ eezɛnɔɔ Pɔl tɔ́ nɛ nɛ pum ɛ pum kɛkum pɛ ghaada Antipatilis. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />É yak mɛlem, esodja ee natɔ́ nɛ mɛko ɔ eezɛbula yɔbɔ pɛ ɛbɛsɛɛ ɛ esodja, tin, bɛ eezɛbet bot ɛ nadi kɔ eyaaga ɔ bɛ goola mɛdjoŋ mɔɔ nɛ Pɔl. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Dáa bɛ nakum pɛ Sezaale ɛ, esodja ee nazyɛ kɔ eyaaga ɔ boodjɛ kukuma dik mɛkana mɛ komanda nadhis ɛ, bhii tak bɛ eezɛlyaal nyɛ Pɔl. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Kukuma dik eezɛlaa mɛkana, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛdji Pɔl, mot kyee dik nyɛ nadi ɛ. Bhii nyɛ nagwak náá, nyɛ ɛ́ mot kyee dik Silisi ɛ, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɛ náá: «Mɛ aadji wɔ mɛdjin ɛ́, é sok bot ɛ zɛpit wɔ ɔ, aakum ɛ.» Nyɛ eezɛlwom náá, bɛ baal Pɔl pɛ tɔ ndjaa mɛkoozi Eelood.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Mɛpita mɛ bɛ zɛpit Pɔl ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Mɛlu mɛtɛn bhii tak, boo ghaa-Zɛɛb Ananias eezɛkum pɛ ghaada Sezaade bɛ nɛ bɛdhiiti bɛpaa, zɛnɔɔ mot ghɛm-taŋal nɛ din ɛ Tɛɛltulus. Bɛ naazɛzyɛ pɛ daa kukuma dik, étɛp bɛ neezɛlɛɛ nyɛ mɛsɔ mɛ mɛpita mɛ bɛ napit Pɔl ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Bɛ naazɛdjóo Pɔl, tin, Tɛɛltulus naazɛpit nyɛ, nyɛy náá: «Dhaandiŋaa Feliksɛ, kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɔ ɛ́, bis di wak mos tɔ egwyem é etɛp djas. Yɛ ɛ́ dum nɛ etsoŋ bɔ ɛ wɔ kɛm bis, tɔ ɛswoola ɛ etɛp ɛnyɔɛpe tɔ mbyak'es. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Dhaandiŋaa Feliksɛ, bis eeghaapɛɛ wɔ dum nɛ embɛɛ esesɛɛ djas bis di ebela é mɛwala djas nɛ é edi djas ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Deenek mɛ ààpakwyɛl ɛdulal wɔ tɛp ɛdjaŋɛpe, yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ kwyɛl náá, wɔ di nɛ mbɛɛ lyem ɛgwak ɛ́ bis ba mɔɔ pes ɛwala. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Bis eebee náá, mot'ak ɛ́ mbee mot dhaa nyel: dáa ye di náá, nyɛ ɛ́ kukuma zɛɛga eNazaleyɛ ɛ, nyɛ ɛpekus ɛghuub tɔ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda djas kɔ bɔs. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6-7" />Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nyɛ eekwyɛl ɛsaab edɛɛ e Ndjaa-ebuwa. Tin, bis ɛ́ boomɛt nyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:6-7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Wɔ dji nyɛ ɔɔ, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛgu wɔy ɛmet etsɛɛtsɛ e etɛp ee bis zɛpit nyɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Tin, ekukuma eYuda naazɛkɛm taŋal tak, bɔɔ náá, etɛp ee nyɛ lii ɛ yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl eezɛtaŋal yɛ sok bhwoob ɛ Feliksɛ kukuma dik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Kukuma Feliksɛ naazɛsa dhiiti tseŋa ɛlɛɛ nɛ Pɔl náá, nyɛ lii, é di'enek Pɔl ɛ́ booke náá: «Mɛ nɛ gu náá, wɔ moo mos ɛ́ nɛ membu ɛbuɛpe ee wɔ di esa mɛsa mɛ epiki kɔ kyee dik'ena. Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ di nɛ ɛbwaalel ɛtaŋal é mis mɔ. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Wɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsaŋ ɛgu wɔy wɔ ɛmet, mɛ moo mos ɛ́ nɛ mɛlu kam nɛ ebá ee mɛ natɔ́ pɛ ghaada Yeluzalɛm, étɛp ɛkɛduwal Zɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Ye tok nɛ mot zɛbela mɛ pɛ tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa é waya bis nɛ dhiiti mot, nɛghu é ful ɛdhuu ɛ bot elo, ààkobɛ-bɛak tɔ ndjaa mendjaala mɛ eYuda nɛghu é dhiiti di sis kɔ ghaada. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Bot bak tok nɛ ghwyil ɛlyaal wɔ ɛnyɔɛpe etɛp ee bɛ zɛpit mɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak nenak ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Bela náá, sa mɛ di emyam é mis mɔ ɛ́ náá, mɛ eemyaal ɛdu ɛ mɛze ɛ Ghɛŋ, yii bɔɔ di eke náá, yɛ ɛ́ zɛɛga bot ɛ di edjaala embee bɛzɛɛb ɔ. Deenek, mam duwal ɛ́ Zɛɛb bɛbhaab benaka. Tin, mɛ nɛ myaal etɛp ee di kwyala tɔ bɛmɛkana mɛ etsi nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel nɛ Zɛɛb, ɛbwaalel ɛ tak wat ɛ, bɛ baazodi nɛ yɛ, yɛ ɛ́ náá, ye nakoozodi bot ɛ embee mɛfulu, nɛghu bot ɛ epiki, bɛ waagom bis ɛsyee. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ, mɛ di esa mɛghaaz mɛ ɛnɛɛg lyem'am sɛŋ mɛlu djas é mis ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ é mis mɛ bot.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />Bhii mɛ nadi ààbɛ kɔ dɛl membu ɛbuɛpe ɛ, mɛ eebula pɛ Yeluzalɛm étɛp ɛzɛkwyee bot ɛ mbyak'am, nɛ ɛzɛdjɛ Zɛɛb ebuwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ mɛ eezesa ɛzel ɛ ɛdis edhuud bam, bhii tak ɛ́, bɛ nazɛbela mɛ tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa. Ɛdhuu ɛ bot nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi tin, ààkobɛ-bɛak nɛ ɛzɛm. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Tin, bɛdhiiti eYuda e kyee dik Azi nadi ɛ́ tin. Deenek, tɛp ɛpedi náá, yɛ tak ɔɔ, pe yɛ ɛ́ bɔɔ ɛ zyɛzɛpit mɛ pɛ daa lɔ. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Bot ɛ di wak ɔ, kaalɛɛ wɔ mbee sa mɛ nakwyeselaa ndjɛ sɔs é tak ɛ, é ghɛŋ bɛ nazyɛ nɛ nam sok bhwoob zɛɛga boo kwan eYuda ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />Nɛghu yɛ ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ mɛ ke sok bhwoob zɛɛga boo kwan eYuda náá: “Mɛ eemyaal náá, bot ɛ́ waagom bis ɛsyee”, yɛ ɛ́ bɛ di epɛ́ɛ mɛ mos é mis mɔ'aak!»<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Feliksɛ mot nadi egu ɛnyɔɛpe etɛp djas e zɛɛga bot ɛ di edu mɛze ɛ Ghɛŋ ɔ, eezɛswaal tɛp tak, etɛɛ náá, ye neeliiaa dhiiti dwoo, nyɛy nɛ bot ɛ napit Pɔl ɔ náá: «Mɛ aapɛ́ɛ tɛp'en ɛ́, é sok komanda esodja Lyzias aazyɛ ɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Nyɛ naazɛlwom dhiiti kukuma tɔ lɔɔg esodja náá, nyɛ baal Pɔl é membok. Tin, nyɛ eezɛke náá, bɛ djɛ nyɛ ba ɛpɛɛd étɛp bɛsɔ bɛ neegheezyɛ zɛkwyee-kwyee nyɛ.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taŋal ɛ Pɔl sok bhwoob ɛ Feliksɛ bɛ nɛ Dulusil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Ba mɛlu bhii tak, Feliksɛ naazɛzyɛ bɛ nɛ myɛl Dulusil nadi moma mbyak eYuda ɔ. Nyɛ naazɛlwom náá, bɛ kɛnɔɔ Pɔl, bhii tak nyɛ eezɛgwak sa Pɔl nadi elii dum nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Yezu Klisto ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />É sok Pɔl nakan ɛlii dum nɛ tɛtɛ tsik epiki, nɛ ɛgu ɛdil ɛ nyel, zɛnɔɔ epɛ́ɛ e Zɛɛb di ezyɛ pɛ sok yenek ɛ, tin, Feliksɛ moo tin nyaa-nyaa, nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛke náá: «Yɛ eedjala, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛkatɔ́. É sok mɛ aabela ba mɔɔ ɛpɛɛd ɛ ɛwala ɛ, mɛ waadjóo wɔ.» <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Nyɛ nadi ebwaal ɛ́ náá, Pɔl ɛ́ waadjɛ nyɛ epata, yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ, nyɛ nadi edjóo nyɛ ngwyis, bɛ zɛmɔ bɛ nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Membu membá naazɛdhaa deenek, tin, Pɔlsius Fɛstus naazɛdjila Feliksɛ kɔ boo ekukuma e dik. Dáa Feliksɛ nadi esaa náá, eYuda kwyɛl nyɛ ɛ, nyɛ naazɛbet Pɔl kɔɔla é membok.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Taŋal ɛ Pɔl sok bhwoob kukuma Fɛstus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Mɛlu mɛlɛl bhii nyɛ nakum pɛ kyee dik tak ɛ, Fɛstus naazɛdus pɛ ghaada Sezaale, tɔ́ pɛ ghaada Yeluzalɛm. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Penek ɛ́, eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb nɛ eYuda di bɛdjɛɛdel ɔ, nakɛpit Pɔl pɛ daa lɛ. Bɛ naazɛdjaala nɛ nɛ náá, <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />nyɛ gek bɛ ghoŋ, da swaal bɛ Pɔl pɛ Yeluzalɛm. Bɛ nake deenek ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ bɛ naazedi boob kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ, tin, bɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛgó ɛ nyɛ é ze. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Tin, Fɛstus naazɛbɔɔza náá, Pɔl ɛ́ é membok pɛ Sezaale, ye kalik ɛ́ batsa nyɛy ɛmet neesik pɛ ghaada tak. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Bhii tak, nyɛ naabaazɛke náá: «Ye goka ɛ́ náá, ekukuma bin zyɛ bis nɛ bɛnɔɔ pɛ Sezaale, bɛ zɛpit mot tak, yɛ bɛ náá, nyɛ eesa etɛp ɛbiyo ɔɔ.» <verse eid="ACT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Fɛstus zokazɛdjaasi tin bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ, tyee mɛlu mɛtɛn nɛ elɛl nɛghu kam (8-10), bhii tak, nyɛ naazɛsik pɛ Sezaale. É dwoo nabɔɔba ɛ, nyɛ naazɛdisi pɛ sum di bɛ di pɛ́ɛ bot ɛ, nyɛ naazɛlwom náá, bɛ kɛnɔɔ Pɔl. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Dáa nyɛ nakakum ɛ, eYuda nadus pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɔ, naazɛwa nyɛ kuku ɛbwak. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zokazɛsu nyɛ bɛtɛ nɛ embee etɛp, mɛpita mɛ bɔɔ bɛmet di ààbɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛlyaal mɛsɔ mɛ tak ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Tin, Pɔl naazɛtaŋal yɛ, nyɛy náá: «Mɛ ààpasa pɔtɔ dum nɛ etsi eYuda, ààkobɛ dum nɛ Ndjaa-ebuwa, ààkobɛ-bɛak dum nɛ Sezaad, mɛkoozi mɛ Lɔm.»<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Fɛstus mot nadi ekwyɛl ɛsa náá, eYuda neekwyɛl nyɛ ɔ, nyɛ boozɛdji Pɔl náá: «Wɔ ɛpɛkwyɛl ɛtɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm, étɛp wɔ neekɛpɛ́ɛaa é mis mam dum nɛ tɛp'ak é?» <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Pɔl naazɛbɔɔza náá: «Mɛ ɛ́ tetel sok bhwoob di epɛ́ɛ e Sezaad, deenek, yɛ ɛ́ wak ɛ mɛ di egoka nɛ ɛpɛ́ɛaa. Ye tok nɛ mbee sa mɛ sa nɛ eYuda, dáa wɔy wɔ ɛmet di egu yenek. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Nɛghu mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ndjɛ ɔɔ, yɛ bɛ, mɛ eesa sa mɛ di egoka nɛ ɛgóaa kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɔɔ, mɛ ààpabyen ɛsyee. Deenek, yɛ kabɛ náá, etɛp e mɛpita mɛ bot bak pit mɛ ɛ ye tok tsɛɛtsɛ ɔɔ, mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛ́ ka mɛ é mɛmbɔ mɔɔ. Beta náá, Sezaad, mɛkoozi mɛ Lɔm, pɛ́ɛ tɛp'am!» <verse eid="ACT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Deenek, dáa Fɛstus nasilal ɛlii bɛ nɛ bɛtsoŋ ɛ bot bɛ ɛ, nyɛ naazɛbɔɔza náá: «Dáa wɔ tuwal din ɛ boo mɛkoozi Sezaad ɛ, wɔ aakakɛtaŋal ɛ́ sok bhwoob'ɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taŋal ɛ Pɔl sok bhwoob mɛkoozi Aghilipa nɛ Bheelenis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Ba mɛlu bhii tak, mɛkoozi Aghilipa bɛ nɛ Bheelenis kɛl, naazɛkum pɛ Sezaale étɛp ɛkɛswos Fɛstus. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Dáa nyɛ nadi nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ mɛlu tin ɛ, Fɛstus naazɛlii nɛ mɛkoozi kɔ ɛsu ɛ Pɔl náá: «Wak, yɛ ɛ́ nɛ dhiiti mot Feliksɛ nalik é membok ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />É ghɛŋ mɛ natɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ, ekukuma e bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, nɛ bɛpaa eYuda naazɛpit nyɛ. Bɛ naazɛke nɛ nam náá, mɛ kwyesal nyɛ ndjɛ sɔs. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Mɛ ɛ́ boozɛbɔɔza nɛ nɔɔ náá, bot ɛ Lɔm tok nɛ mɛfulu mɛ ɛka mot é mɛmbɔ mɛ bot ɛ zɛpit nyɛ ɔ, yɛ bɛ náá, bɛtetɛp dinaa ààpagwak yɛ taŋal ɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Bɛ zyɛ wak pɛ Sezaale ɛ́ bis nɛ bɛnɔɔ. Mɛ bɛ ɛ́ ààkabaakwyɛl bɔya-bɔya. Tin, djɛmɛn tak mɛ eenɔɔ di é sum di bot di pɛ́ɛaa ɔ, mɛ eezɛlwom náá, bɛ zyɛ nɛ mot tak. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Bot ɛ nadi epit nyɛ ɔ, bɛ eezɛzyɛ, é di'enek, bɛ naatuwal bɛtɛ nɛ embee etɛp nyɛ nasa ɛ, tin, ye nàbaabɛ etɛp ee mam nadi egek ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ nazosuu ɛ́ mɛso dum nɛ Zɛɛb'ɔɔ met, dɔɔ nɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ dhiiti mot din ɛ lɛ ɛ́ Yezu. Mot tak naazegwyɛ, da Pɔl ɛ́ di eke náá, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ tsik. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Yɛ kabɛ mam ɔɔ, mɛ bɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ tyee mɛ pɛ́ɛ mbi yenek tɛp. Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ dji Pɔl náá, nyɛ kwyɛl ɔɔ, nyɛ tɔ́ pɛ Yeluzalɛm, étɛp nyɛ neekɛpɛ́ɛaa dum nɛ tɛp tak. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Tin, Pɔl eebyen, nyɛ booke náá, tɛp'ɛ kɛpɛ́ɛaa pɛ daa boo mɛkoozi mɛ dik Lɔm nyɛ ɛmet. Mɛ ɛ́ boozɛlwom náá, nyɛ nɛɛgaa é membok, kɛkum dwoo mɛ aakyeed nyɛ pɛ daa Sezaad mɛkoozi mɛ dik ɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Aghilipa eezɛke nɛ Fɛstus náá: «Mɛ kwyɛl ɛ́, mɛ gwak mot'ak mam ɛmet nɛ mɛlɔ mam.» Fɛstus eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Wɔ waagwak nyɛ djɛmɛn.»<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />É yak mɛlem mɛ tak, Aghilipa bɛ nɛ Bheelenis naazɛtuula nɛ zukamwaa nɛ mot, nɛ boo duu djas bɛ nɛ ekomanda esodja, nɛ bɛdhil ɛ bot ɛ ghaada. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛni tɔ boo wal bɛ nadi ezyɛ nɛ ɛpɛ́ɛ ɛ bot ɛ. Fɛstus naazɛke náá, bɛ zyɛ nɛ Pɔl, tin, bɛ naazɛzyɛ nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />É di'enek, Fɛstus naazɛke náá: «Mɛkoozi Aghilipa nɛ biyɔ bot ɛ di wak'aak, bi ɛpebee mot'ak. Bot ɛ mbyak eYuda djas eezyɛ zɛpit nyɛ pɛ daa lam, kana pɛ Yeluzalɛm zɛkum wak, etsim bɔɔ ɛ́ náá, nyɛ ààkagoka nɛ tsik. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Yɛ kabɛ mam ɔɔ, mɛ bee ɛ́ náá, nyɛ ààpasa dhiiti tɛp di egoka náá, nyɛ góaa étɛp tak ɛ. Bela náá, nyɛy nakuma nyel bɛ ɛ́ nyɛ eelɛɛ náá, bɛ tɔ́ nɛ nɛ sok bhwoob boo mɛkoozi mɛ dik Lɔm. Mɛ eemyaal ɛkyeed ɛ nyɛ nwyak. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Tinaak, mɛ tok nɛ tɛtɛ mɛsɔ mɛ mɛ aakwyal tɔ mɛkana kyeed pɛ daa boo mɛkoozi dum nɛ tɛp'ɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ, mɛ sa náá, nyɛ taŋal é mis men, daŋ-daŋ ɛ, é mis mɔ, wɔy mɛkoozi Aghilipa, etɛɛ náá, bhii mɛdjin mɛ bi aadji nyɛ ɛ, mɛ neebela sa mɛ waakwyal tɔ mɛkana ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Etɛɛ náá, ɛkyeed ɛ́ mot é membok pɛ dɛl ɛ Lɔm ààbɛ nɛ lo mɛsɔ mɛ nyɛ mɛtaa étɛp tak ɛ, nɛ pip mam é mis.»<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Pɔl eetaŋal yɛ taŋal sok bhwoob ɛ mɛkoozi Aghilipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Mɛkoozi Aghilipa eezɛke nɛ Pɔl náá: «Bɛ eedjɛ wɔ ze wɔ taŋal.» Tin, Pɔl naazɛghɛɛ mbɔ étɛp nyɛ neelii. Wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛkan ɛzɛtaŋal náá: <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />«Mɛkoozi Aghilipa, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛmyaala tɔ lyem'am mos, etɛɛ náá, wɔ eedjɛ mɛ ze ɛtaŋal é mis mɔ kɔ ɛsu ɛ etɛp ee eYuda zɛpit mɛ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Ye nɛ baanyɔ deenek, etɛɛ náá, wɔ nɛ gu ɛnyɔɛpe etsi eYuda djas, nɛ etɛp ee bɛ dyeebadi nɛ zyaala dum nɛ tak ɛ. Mɛ eemɛt wɔ ɛboŋ, gwaka mɛ ɛnyɔɛpe. <figure style="fig" alt="Paul devant le roi Agrippa et le gouverneur Festus" file="Cn02037C.tif" size="span" loc="26.3" copy="David C Cook" ref="26.3">Pɔl sok bhwoob ɛ mɛkoozi Aghilipa nɛ kukuma Fɛstus</figure><verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />EYuda djas nɛ gu mbi mot mɛ nadi sok ɛ, kana ɛwyɛl ɛ engbaaz bam. Bɛ nɛ gu dáa mɛ nadi sok nɛ bot ɛ mbyak'am, nɛ pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Bɛ eelookan ɛgu ɛ́ mɛ. Tin, bɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdi etyaasɛs bam, bɛ kwyɛl ɔɔ! Etɛɛ náá, mɛ nadi ɛ́ tɔ sama eFalizyɛ, bot ɛ nadi ebaal etsi e Zɛɛb'ena nɛ ghwyil ɛlyelɛpe dhaa bot djas ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Nenak yak, mɛ kadi wak é pɛ́ɛaa ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel dum nɛ ekɛk ee Zɛɛb nakɛk bɛbhaab binaka ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Yɛ ɛ́ dum nɛ ɛbwaalel ɛ ekɛk binek ɛ, membyak kam nɛ bɛbá nadi tɔ ɛduwal ɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ ghwyil nɛ lyem wat mwos nɛ pum. Deenek, mɛkoozi mam, yɛ ɛ́ dum nɛ ɛbwaalel ɛlenek ɛ eYuda zɛpit mɛ! <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Étɛp yé biyɔ eYuda di ebee náá, ye tok nɛ ghwyil ɛsael, náá, Zɛɛb waagomal bot ɛ zegwyɛ ɔ?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />Mam mɛ ɛmet nadi egek ɛ́ náá, ye goka ɛ́ mɛ sa mɛghaaz étɛp ɛlu ɛ́ bot náá, bɛ byen ɛdu ɛ́ Yezu mot Nazalɛt. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Mɛ naasa yɛ pɛ Yeluzalɛm. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb naadjɛ mɛ boo eghɛŋ. Mɛ naawa bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ di dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ é membok. É sok bɛ nadi edjɛ bɛ epɛ́ɛ e ɛsyee ɛ, mɛ nadi emyaal yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />É sok nɛ é sok, bis nadi tɔ́ mendjaa nɛ mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɛ eYuda, mɛ nadi ewa bot é feŋ, mɛ nadi elwom bot nɛ bhel náá, bɛ lee din ɛ Zɛɛb. Ɛbuk ɛ lam étɛp'ɔɔ naasa náá, mɛ gheewa bɛ tɔ tsik mezuk, kɛkum pɛ tɔ eghaada bot ɛ membyak mɛ sis.»<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl eezɛbaŋa bot dáa nyɛ naswoola mɛfulu mɛ, dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />«Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ mɛ natɔ́ pɛ ghaada Dhamas nɛ eghɛŋ nɛ lwomel eboo bɛghaa-Zɛɛb, étɛp ɛkɛsa, sa bɛ nalwom mɛ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Mɛ nadi ɛ́, ze ɛ ze, kuku mwos, mɛkoozi Aghilipa, wɔ gwaa, mɛ zɛbee mɛkas edus tɔ gwoo, mɛkas mɛ tak dhaa mɛkas mɛ gwyes. Ye nadi ekas é ngwoob'am nɛ bot ɛ nadi etɔ́ mɛdjoŋ bis nɛ bɛnɔɔ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />É di'enek, bisɔ djas zokaduma si, tin, mɛ eezɛgwak gwood wat elii nɛ nam tɔ dhiiti lii bot ɛ ebhele náá: “Sɔl, Sɔl, étɛp yé wɔ di etiig mɛ? Wɔ sa ɛlyel ɛ lo ɛ́ gwyes, dáa tit di eboola nɛ ghwyɛs kukuma yɛ ɛ.” <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Mɛ eezɛdji náá: “Wɔy ɛzɛ Ghɛŋ?” Tin, Ghɛŋ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nam náá: “Yɛ ɛ́ mam Yezu mot wɔ di etiig ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Deenek, wyɛla, tyaŋa tetel, mɛ lyaal wɔ nyel ɛ, etɛɛ náá, mɛ eetɔ wɔ náá, wɔ di mot-mɛsa mam. Wɔ aakadi ɛ́ tyaasɛs'am, étɛp wɔ neekɛlɛɛ bot dáa wɔ bee mɛ mos ɛ, nɛ ɛkɛgoola sa mɛ aabaalyaal wɔ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Mɛ waatsik wɔ é mɛmbɔ mɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda nɛ edhiiti membyak mɛ sis, pɛ pak mɛ aalwom wɔ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Mɛ aakyeed wɔ ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, wɔ neekɛbɛɛ bɛ mis, étɛp wɔ neekɛdis bɛ tɔ ghooghom, zyɛ nɛ nɔɔ tɔ gwyɛ. Mɛ waapɛk bɛ si eghɛŋ ɛ Satan mot mɛkɔŋ, zyɛ nɛ nɔɔ pɛ daa Zɛɛb. Bɛ dum koŋ nɛ nam ɔɔ, bɛ waabela ɛpelak ɛ mesyem mɔɔ, nɛ ɛdi tɔ sama bot ɛ di bɛ moo ɛ́, bot ɛ zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ.”»<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl ɛpelii dum nɛ mɛsa mɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />«Deenek mɛkoozi Aghilipa, mɛ nabɛ ààbyen ɛlooba nɛ sa mɛ nabee nɛ ɛgwak tɔ djema mɛbwala mɛ nadus tɔ gwoo ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Tin, mɛ naakan ɛgoola yɛ nɛ bot ɛ Dhamas, nɛ bot ɛ Yeluzalɛm, zɛnɔɔ bot ɛ kyee dik Yude djas, nɛ bot ɛ dhiiti membyak. Mɛ eelɛɛ nɛ nɔɔ náá, bɛ liig elyem bɔɔ, da bɛ ɛ́ dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ ɛlyaal tɔ mɛsa mɔɔ náá, yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bɛ eezeswoola mɛfulu. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Yɛ ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ tɛp'enek ɛ eYuda mɛt mɛ, é sok mɛ di tɔ kok Ndjaa-ebuwa ɛ, ye bɛ ɛ́, bɛ eewaagó mɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Tin, ye bɛ ɛ́, Zɛɛb eebaal mɛ kɛkum dwoo mos, yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ baadi mos, étɛp mɛ neetaŋal yam é mis mɛ bot djas, nɛ bɔɔ dhyeeb nɛ eboo bot. Ye tok nɛ dhiiti sonok mɛ baadi elɛɛ, bhis yii Moiiz nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nalɛɛ náá, yɛ waasael ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Yɛ ɛ́ náá, Mɛsia ɛ́ waazuk, nyɛ aadi ɛ́ mot mɛkɛn é ɛgom bhis ɛsyee. Deenek, nyɛ waagoola bhaadal gwyɛ di edjɛ tsik nɛ bot ɛ mbyak'ena, dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ membyak mɛ sis ɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl ɛpesaa náá, Aghilipa dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Tin, Pɔl kuku taŋal'ɛ, Fɛstus eezɛtsim náá: «Wɔ ɛpelyet, Pɔl! Dáa di náá, wɔ naadyeebatɔ́ mɛdjek ɛ, wɔ moo lyet!» <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Pɔl eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Mɛ ààlyet, dhaandiŋaa. Etɛp ee mɛ di elii ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ, nɛ piki. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Mɛkoozi Aghilipa nɛ gu etɛp ee mɛ di elii ɛ, deenek, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛlii nɛ ɛbwaalel é mis mɛ. Mɛ nɛ gu náá, ye tok nɛ sa nyɛ di ààgu, etɛɛ náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààsael tɔ sɔ, tɔ dhiiti tuma. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Mɛkoozi Aghilipa, wɔ nɛ myaal sa bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nalɛɛ ɛ? Mɛ nɛ gu náá, wɔ nɛ myaal yɛ!» <verse eid="ACT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Aghilipa eezɛke nɛ Pɔl náá: «Wɔ gek ɛ́ náá, wɔ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa náá, mɛ di Keletyɛ é mɔɔ ɛwala batsa dáak é?» <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Pɔl eezɛbɔɔza náá: «Ye nakoozodi mɔɔ ɛwala batsa, nɛghu bɛtɛ nɛ mɛwala, mɛ ɛpedjaala nɛ Zɛɛb náá, wɔy nɛ bot djas di egwak mɛ mos'aak, bi di dáa mɛ di'aak, tin, ààbɛ kɔla nɛ eghwooz bak!»<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Mɛkoozi, kukuma dik nɛ kɛl Bheelenis, zɛnɔɔ bot ɛ bɛ nɛ bɛnɔɔ nadi ɔ, zokazɛwyɛl. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Bɛ eezɛdus tin, bɛ moo tin esɔs pak'ɔɔ náá: «Mot'ak ààpasa dhiiti tɛp nyɛ di egoka nɛ ɛgóaa, nɛghu ɛkɔɔlaa é membok kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Tin, Aghilipa eezɛke nɛ Fɛstus náá: «Mot'ak ɛpedi ààdjóo Sezaad boo mɛkoozi náá, nyɛ zɛpɛ́ɛ tɛp'ɛ ɔɔ, pe nyɛ eebetaa.»<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Pɔl eekyeedaa pɛ Lɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Dáa bɛ nake náá, bis moo tɔ́ pɛ dik Itali pɛ tɔ mɛsuwa ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛnɔɔ Pɔl nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ membok djɛ bɛ é mɛmbɔ mɛ dhiiti kukuma esodja. Din ɛ kukuma tak nabɛ ɛ́ Zilius. Nyɛ nadi ɛ́ boo kukuma mwaka esodja e bot ɛ ghaada Lɔm nadi edjóo «Mwaka boo mɛkoozi» ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Bis eezɛni tɔ mɛsuwa nadus pɛ ɛboŋ ɛ Adalamit, etɔ́ pɛ kyee mɛboŋ mɛ kyee dik Azi ɛ. Tin, bis eezɛtɔ́, Aalistaalak, mot kyee dik Masedwan pɛ ghaada Tesalonik nadi ɛ́ bis nɛ bɛnɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />É yak mɛlem, bis eezɛkum pɛ Sidɔn. Zilius nadi ɛ́ nɛ lyem ghwyikwyee nɛ Pɔl. Nyɛ ɛ́ boozɛdjɛ Pɔl ze nyɛ kɛbee bɛsɔ étɛp bɛ neekwyee nyɛ nɛ esa ee nyɛ aadi nɛ gwyes tak ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Dáa bis nadus tin ɛ, bis eezɛtɔ́ mbaka-mbaka pɛ kyee ghola Siipɛlɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, étɛp ɛkɛsɔwa pup nadi epupal ɛlyelɛpe ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Bis eezɛtsaal boo dii mɛsɔn é ngwoob Silisi nɛ Panfili, tin, bis eezɛkum pɛ ghaada Miila pɛ tɔ dik Lisi. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Tin, kukuma tak eezɛbee dhiiti mɛsuwa mɛ bot ɛ ghaada Alɛkzandili, etɔ́ pɛ kyee dik Itali. Nyɛ eezɛniigal bis tɔ tak. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Tɔ bɛtɛ nɛ mɛlu, bis nadi ekɛ ɛ́ tetyok-tetyok. Yɛ ɛ́ tɔ boo mezuk ɛ bis nakum pɛ ghaada Siniid. Dáa pup nadi elu náá, bis natɔ́ ɛnyɔɛpe pɛ ze tak ɛ, bis ɛ́ boozɛdhaa mbaka-mbaka nɛ dhiiti di di edjóoaa ze Salmɔne ɛ. Di tak nadi ɛ́ pɛ tɔ ghola Kelɛt, pɛ kyee nadi ààbɛ nɛ pup ɛbuɛpe ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Bis nadi ewyeed ɛ́ mbaka-mbaka, ɛkɛ ɛ mɛzuwa mes naadyeebalyel. Tin, wɔ gwaa bis zɛkum é dhiiti di, bɛ nadi edjóo «Mbɛɛ Ɛboŋ» ɛ, é ngwoob ghaada Lase.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />É mɛdjoŋ mɛ tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ bis eezedyeebakwyɛɛg bɛtɛ nɛ mɛlu. Tin, ɛkɛ ɛ mɛsuwa nabɛ ɛ́ ye moo ɛlyelɛpe, etɛɛ náá, dwoo eYuda dyeebatsi edee<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">dwoo eYuda dyeebatsi edee ɛ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kana é mɛlu menek, ye nabɛ ɛ́ mɛlu mɛ ghuu nadi ɛlyelɛpe pɛ kyee dik'enek ɛ.</char></note> ɛ nabɛ ɛ́ eezedhaa. Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ Pɔl nadul bot ɛ di ebe mɛsuwa ɔ mɛlɔ náá: <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />«Bɛwɛn bam, mɛ bee ɛ́ náá, mɛdjoŋ mak ɛ́ waakɔɔla. Mɛsuwa nɛ esa ee di tɔ tak ɛ waapulel, dɔɔ nɛ menabɛlka, mena ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛgwyɛka.» <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Tin, kukuma esodja nakadi egwak ɛ́ mɛkpa mɛ mbeel mɛsuwa nɛ nakuma tak, dhaa yii Pɔl nadi elɛɛ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Ɛboŋ ɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́ àànyɔ étɛp ɛsel mɛsuwa é mbu kwol. Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ bɛtɛ nɛ bot nadi tɔ mɛsuwa ɔ nazɛke náá, bɛ dus tin, bɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛsa mɛghaaz étɛp bɛ neekum pɛ dɛl ɛ Fenikesɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, dhiiti ɛboŋ ɛ ghola Kelɛt. Yiizaag ɛboŋ gwyákel ɛ́ nɛ pɛ ɛsila ɛ dwoo, ye tɛp tak ɛ, ɛboŋ ɛ tak, nadi mbɛɛ di ɛkɛdhaa mbu kwol.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Boo ghuu kɔ boo dii mɛsɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Bhii tak, ba mɔɔ pup di edus pɛ kyɛ bɔs eezɛkan ɛpupal. Bɛ nagek ɛ́ náá, bɛ aakwak ɛkum pɛ ɛboŋ ɛ Fenikesɛ. Bɛ eezɛghɛɛ mbwak mɛsuwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mbwak mɛsuwa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yɛ ɛ́ boo ghwooz na dil-dil nɛghu boo ele bɛ di elóo tɔ dii étɛp ɛpyet mɛsuwa ekaab náá, yɛ ɛzɛkɛwo ɛ.</char></note>, bɛ eezɛtɔ́ mbaka-mbaka nɛ ghola Kelɛt. <figure style="fig" alt="L’ancre du bateau" file="45_Acts27.13_Anchor&amp;Ship.tif" size="col" loc="27.13" copy="Gordon Thompson" ref="27.13">Mbwak mɛsuwa</figure><verse eid="ACT 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Tin, ààkobɔya deenek, boo ghuu di edjóoaa «pup di epupal edus pɛ ɛdjem ɛ dwoo» nadi esul edus pɛ kɔ mɛtsok mɛ ghola Kelɛt. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Mɛsuwa nadi ewo, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ tyee bis pyet yɛ, etɛɛ náá, ghuu nadi ɛ́ ɛlyelɛpe. Tin, bis eezɛbet náá, bis wo dáa pup nadi edul bis ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Deenek, bis naazɛdhaa é ngwoob dhiiti mɔɔ ghola di edjóoaa Koda ɛ. Ghola tak naala bis pup ghuu. Tin, tɔ mezuk djas ɛ, bis nakwak ɛdul ɛ́ mɔɔ elɛɛd di elwol bot ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Tin, bot ɛ di esa mɛsa tɔ mɛsuwa ɔ eezɛben mɔɔ elɛɛd e tak, wa tɔ mɛsuwa. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛkɔl ekel é mengwoob mɛ boo mɛsuwa, étɛp ɛpyet ɛ yɛ. Bela náá, bɛ nadi ekaab ɛkɛghaaga kɔ ɛbyok ɛ bɛsyɛ di é mengwoob pɛ kyee dik Libi ɛ. Tin, bɛ eezɛlóo dhiiti sonok di esa náá, boo mɛsuwa nàwo ɛlyelɛpe ɛ tɔ dii. Bhii tak, bɛ eezɛbet náá, pup wo nɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Ghuu nadi etɔ́ nɛ ɛdheeg bis ɛlyelɛpe. Ye naasa náá, é ɛlu ɛ nazyɛ bhii tak ɛ, bɛ zɛkan ɛmwas dhiiti esa e mɛbom mɔɔ tɔ boo dii mɛsɔn. Bɛ nasa deenek ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, boo mɛsuwa neegwyaa. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />É ɛlu ɛ elɛl, bɛ naazɛmwas nɛ mɛmbɔ mɔɔ met dhiiti eghwooz di esa náá, mɛsuwa kɛ ɛ́ pɛ tɔ dii. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Tin, mɛlu naadhaa ɛbuɛpe bis ààkobee-beeak gwyes nɛ ekwyikwyen. Boo ghuu tak nazodi ɛ́ ɛlyelɛpe. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ bisɔ djas naazɛdis lyem tɔ ɛbwaal náá, bis ɛ́ waatsak.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Bot ɛ nadi tɔ mɛsuwa ɔ naasa bɛtɛ nɛ mɛlu ààdɛ edee. Tin, Pɔl eezɛtyaa tetel sok bhwoob'ɔɔ, nyɛ eezɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bɛwɛn, bi ɛpedi náá bi naagwak mɛ ɔɔ, pe bi ààpadus pɛ ghola Kelɛt. Bi ɛpedi náá bi naagwak mɛ ɔɔ, pe yak puluk nɛ ɛsaab esa e mɛbom mena ààpasael. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Nenak, mɛ lɛɛ bin ɛ́ náá, nàbemka ba, etɛɛ náá, mot ngɔt pak'en aanàkwaagwyɛ. Yɛ ɛ́ boo mɛsuwa ɛ aakwaazopulel. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Mɛ ke deenek ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, é pum'ak mos, Zɛɛb'am, mot mɛ di esa mɛsa mɛ ɔ, ye bɛ ɛ́, nyɛ eedhis fofop'ɛ ngɔt pɛ daa lam. <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />Nyɛ lɛɛ mɛ ɛ́ náá: “Nàbem ba, Pɔl! Ye goka ɛ́ náá, wɔ kɛtaŋal sok bhwoob ɛ Sezaad, mɛkoozi mɛ dik Lɔm. Tin, Zɛɛb tɔ mɛkwyɛla mɛ nyɛ di nɛ yɛ nɛ nɔ ɛpetsik wɔ, dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ wɔ di kɔ dii bi nɛ bɛnɔɔ ɛ djas.” <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Saka mɛghaaz bɛwɛn, etɛɛ náá, mɛ dum koŋ ɛ́ nɛ Zɛɛb. Yɛ waasael dáa nyɛ lɛɛ mɛ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Ye kalik ɛ́ batsa, mɛsuwa neebel mena é ngwoob dhiiti ghola.»<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Boo ghuu naazyeegal boo mɛsuwa pɛ dhiiti ghola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Ye nabɛ ɛ́, é pum, ɛlu ɛ kam nɛ ená, yii pup nadi ewo nɛ nes kɔ boo dii mɛsɔ mɛ Mediteelane ɛ. Ye moo tyee kuku pum, bot ɛ di ebe mɛsuwa ɔ, eezɛbee tyee náá, bis nadi ɛ́, bis moo kunaa nɛ kiid. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Bɛ eezɛlóo ghwooz bɛ di egek mɛdim mɛ dii nɛ yɛ ɛ. Bɛ eezɛbee náá, dii nabɛ ɛ́ edim, mɛdim mɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́ tyee emɛtɛlɛ mɛkam-mɛlɛl nɛ etɛn nɛ ebá (37). Tin, bɛ eezɛbaatiila, bhii tak, bɛ eebaazɛlóo ghwooz tak tɔ dii, bɛ eezɛbee náá, mɛdim mɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́ ye moo tyee emɛtɛlɛ mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ etɛn nɛ elɛl (28). <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Bot ɛ di esa mɛsa tɔ mɛsuwa ɔ nadi ekaab náá, mɛsuwa mes ɛzɛkɛtuma é mɛkok. Étɛp tak, bɛ eezɛsil embwak e mɛsuwa ená pɛ bhii mɛsuwa. Bhii bɛ nasa deenek ɛ́, bɛ eezɛbwood náá, mɛlem lem. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />É di'enek, bot ɛ di ebe mɛsuwa ɔ nadi esaa dáa bɛ dus tɔ mɛsuwa kaab. Bɛ eezɛsil mɔɔ elɛɛd tɔ boo dii mɛsɔn. Bɛ nadi esa tyee náá, bɛ ɛpekɔl edhiiti embwak mɛsuwa pɛ lo boo mɛsuwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Tin, Pɔl eezɛke nɛ kukuma nɛ esodja bɛ náá: «Bot bak ɛ di ààdi tɔ mɛsuwa ɔɔ, biyɔ djas aanàkwaatsak.» <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />É di'enek, esodja eezɛtsaal ekel e mɔɔ elɛɛd. Bhii tak bɛ eezɛbet elɛɛd náá, ye wo.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Ɛsok nɛ mɛlem nɛ lem, Pɔl eezɛdjóo bɔɔ djas étɛp bɛ neezɛdɛ edee, nyɛy náá: «Beeka, ye moo mos ɛ́ mɛlu kam nɛ ená, yii bi di ebwood nɛ bwoo tɔ elyem ɛ. Deenek, bi ààpaboma mbɔ nɛ nuub. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Mɛ ke nɛ nen ɛ́ bi dɛ edee, étɛp bi neebela ghwyil étɛp bi neetsak. Ye tok nɛ mot ngɔt pak'en aakodiibal ko bhoo lo'ɛ wat.» <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Dáa nyɛ nasilal ɛlii ɛ, Pɔl eezɛnɔɔ mapa, ghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb. Bhii tak nyɛ eepyak yɛ, wɔ gwaa, nyɛ zɛnɔɔ yɛ dɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Tin, nyɛ eezɛdjɛ bɔɔ djas mɛghaaz. É di'enek, bɔɔ djas eezɛdɛ pe. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Pɛ tɔ mɛsuwa, bis nadi ɛ́ bot bɛdhet-ɛbá nɛ mɛkam-mɛtɛn nɛ mɛkam-mɛmbá nɛ ɛtɛn nɛ wat (276). <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Dáa mot nɛ mot nadɛ djil ɛ, bɛ eezɛmwas mɛbhubhwak mɛ mbi bhek bhusa di edjóoaa ble ɛ, tɔ dii, étɛp mɛsuwa neegwyaa.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛdiida ɛ mɛsuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Dáa mɛlem nakalem ɛ, bot ɛ di esa mɛsa tɔ mɛsuwa ɔ naazɛbee bɔs, bɛ kadi ɛ́ ààgwyak sum di tak. É di tak, bɛ eezɛbee dhiiti mbɛɛ di nadi nɛ bɛsyɛ, étɛp mɛsuwa neesel é tak ɛ. Tin, bɛ eezɛpem mɛsuwa mbaka-mbaka nɛ di tak. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Tin, bɛ eezɛtii eghwooz, bet yɛ tɔ dii. Deenek, bɛ eebaazɛtii ekel e ewul ee di epem mɛsuwa tɔ dii ɛ. Tin, bɛ eezɛben boo lɛmbɛ pɛ lo mɛsuwa, etɛɛ náá, pup neepem yɛ, kyeed kɔ bɛsyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />É di'enek, mɛsuwa naazɛtuma kɔ ɛbyok ɛ bɛsyɛ. Dáa lo mɛsuwa nabel tin tɔ bɛsyɛ ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààkabɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛtiila. Tin, boo ghulal bhuuge naazɛbwak mɛsuwa. <figure style="fig" alt="Naufrage du bateau" file="cn02045C.tif" size="span" loc="27.41" copy="David C Cook" ref="27.41">Ɛdiida ɛ mɛsuwa</figure><verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Esodja naawaakwyɛl ɛgó bot ɛ membok, etɛɛ náá, bɛ needi ààkaab, da tɔ́ nɛ mɛgɔk. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Tin, kukuma esodja nadi ekwyɛl ɛtsik ɛ Pɔl, nyɛ naazɛlu esodja náá, bɛ nàsa sa bɛ nagek ɛ. Nyɛ eezɛke nɛ bot ɛ nadi egu mɛgɔk ɔ, bɛ di bot ɛ ɛsok é ɛghaaga tɔ dii étɛp bɛ neekɛsɛɛ pɛ kyiid. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Bhii tak, bɛdhiiti bot ɛ nalik ɔ, naazɛdu bɛ, bɔɔ etselela kɔ ebhil e mɛbaya nɛ é mɛsuwa. Deenek, ye naasa náá, bɔɔ djas kɛsɛɛ, mot ààgwyɛ.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Pɔl pɛ kɔ ghola Maletɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Dáa bis natsak ɛ, bis eezɛgwak náá, din ɛ ghola tak nabɛ ɛ́ Maletɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Bot ɛ mbyak di kɔ ghola tak ɔ, naabe bis ɛnyɔɛpe. Dáa bhi nadi enee ɛ, ɛgwyiyo nadi esa, bot ɛ dɛl ɛ tak naazɛtuub boo du, bisɔ djas neesulal é ngwoob tak, étɛp ɛgoogal ɛ mɛnyel. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Pɔl eetɔ́ kɛtek boo mbwoob egeta étɛp ɛzɛwa tɔ du. Tin, wɔ gwaa ɛgel zɛwyis tɔ mbwoob egeta tak, ekaab mɛgoo mɛ du, nyɛ eezɛkwaal Pɔl, naata nyɛ é mbɔ. <figure style="fig" alt="La vipère s’est attaché à la main de Paul" file="WA03996b.tif" size="span" loc="28.3" copy="Graham Wade" ref="28.3">Ɛgel eenaata Pɔl é mbɔ</figure><verse eid="ACT 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Dáa bot ɛ ghola nabee ɛgel tsela é mbɔ ɛ Pɔl ɛ, bɛ moo tin eke pak'ɔɔ náá: «Yɛ ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ, mot'ak nɛ gó bot. Yɛ kobɛ náá, ɛsyee eekat nyɛ tɔ boo dii mɛsɔn ɔɔ, epiki e Zɛɛb ààpakwyɛl náá, mot'ak di nɛ tsik.» <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Tin, Pɔl eezɛkut mbɔ, nyɔ tak eekwyit tɔ du, nyɛy ààgwak sonok. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Bot ɛ tak nadi ebwood náá, bɛ bee nyel ɛ Pɔl ebeyal, nɛghu náá, ɛsyee bela nyɛ zaka. Tin, bhii bɛ nadyeebabwood ɛbuɛpe, bɛ eezɛbee náá, sonok nabɛ ɛ́ ààsa nyɛ. Bɛ eezɛswoola esiiza bɔɔ, bɛ moo eke pak'ɔɔ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ kɔkɔ mbi dhiiti zɛɛb.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />É ngwoob di tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɛɛdok ɛ kukuma ghola tak. Din ɛ lɛ nabɛ ɛ́ Pibilus. Kukuma tak naamyaal nɛ lyem wat náá, bis sulal pɛ daa lɛ. Tin, nyɛ naadjɛk bis tɔ ndjaŋ'ɛ mɛlu mɛlɛl. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Sɛɛg ɛ Pibilus nadi ɛ́ ndjaasi, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ mɛkosa nɛ mɛlaa. Pɔl eezɛtɔ́ kɛbee nyɛ, nyɛ boodjaala Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ, bhii tak, nyɛ eezɛkɛl nyɛ mɛmbɔ, wɔ gwaa nyɛ zɛtsik nyɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Bhii tak, bɛdhiiti bot ɛ mɛbɛ́ nadi kɔ ghola ɔ zokabaazyɛ yɔbɔ, Zɛɛb zokazɛtsik bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Bɛ naazɛdjɛ bis boo duu. Tin, é ghɛŋ bis nadi bis moo eni tɔ mɛsuwa étɛp bis neetɔ́ ɛ, wɔ gwaa, bɛ zɛdjɛ bis esesɛɛ djas nagoka náá bis di nɛ yɛ, étɛp mɛdjoŋ mɛ bis nadi etɔ́ ɛ.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl eedus pɛ ghola Maletɛ étɛp ɛtɔ́ pɛ ghaada Lɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Bhii bɛngɔn ɛlɛl, bis eezɛtɔ́, tɔ dhiiti mɛsuwa mɛ nadus pɛ ghaada Alɛkzandili ɛ. Pɛ lo mɛsuwa mɛ tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ kpaka dhiiti ndem bɛzɛɛb ɛ di edjóoaa «Mɛwas» ɔ. Ye nadi ɛ́, mɛsuwa mɛ nadhaa mbu kwol é ɛboŋ ɛ ghola Maletɛ ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Bis eezɛsel é ɛboŋ ɛ ghaada Silakuuz, bis eezɛdhaa mɛlu mɛlɛl tin. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Dusa bis nadus tin ɛ, bis eezɛdhaa mbaka-mbaka nɛ ghola tak, étɛp ɛkɛtsaal dii, kɛtuula pɛ ghaada Leezyo. É yak mɛlem, pup di edus pɛ kyɛ bɔs ɛ́ eezɛkan ɛpupal. Mɛlu mɛmbá bhii tak, bis eezɛtuula pɛ ghaada Puzɔlɛs. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Pɛ kɔ ghaada tak, bis naazɛbela bɔn-nyɛɛg bis. Bɛ nadi ekwyɛl náá, bis nɛ bɛnɔɔ dhaa yenga wat tin. Yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ bis nakɛkum pɛ Lɔm. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bis yii ghaada Lɔm naagwak menduk mes. Wɔ gwaa, bɛ zokazyɛ zɛboma nɛ nes, pɛ djando Apiyus nɛ pɛ di di edjóoaa «Mendjaa melɛl yii bɛdjoŋ» ɛ. Dáa Pɔl nabee bɛ ɛ, nyɛ eezɛghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb, tin, nyɛ eezɛbela mɛghaaz. <verse eid="ACT 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Bis naazɛkum pɛ ghaada Lɔm. Tin bɛ naazɛdjɛ Pɔl ze ɛkɛdjaasi pɛ ndjaŋ'ɛ, bɛ nɛ sodja ngɔt nadi ebaal nyɛ ɔ.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl ɛpegoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal pɛ daa eYuda nadidi pɛ Lɔm ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Mɛlu mɛlɛl bhii tak, Pɔl eezɛdjóo ekukuma eYuda nadi kɔ ghaada Lɔm ɛ pɛ daa lɛ. Dáa bɛ nakasɛɛga ɛ, nyɛ boozɛke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Bɔn-nyɛɛg, ye nakoozodi náá, mɛ ààpasa étɛp ɛbiyo nɛ bot ɛ mbyak'ena, ààkobɛ pe dum nɛ mɛtiŋ e bɛbhaab benaka. Ye nabɛ ɛ́, mɛ eemɛtaa pɛ Yeluzalɛm, djɛaa é mɛmbɔ mɛ bot ɛ Lɔm. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Bhii ekukuma e Lɔm nalɛɛ náá, mɛ taŋal ɛ, bɛ naagwak mɛ ɛnyɔɛpe. Tin, bɛ naakwyɛl ɛbet ɛ mɛ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nabɛ ààbee lo mɛsɔ mɛ bɛ nawaadjɛ mɛ epɛ́ɛ ɛsyee kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Tin, eYuda naabyen, mɛ ɛ́ boozɛwaab nɛ bhel náá, mɛ zɛtaŋal sok bhwoob ɛ Sezaad, boo mɛkoozi mɛ dik Lɔm. Deenek, mɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛzyɛ wak zɛpit mbyak'am. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ kwyɛl ɛbee bin, étɛp mɛ neelii nɛ nen. Yɛ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, mɛ kɔɔlaa nɛ eghwooz bak ɛ, kɔ ɛsu ɛ mot, bot ɛ Yisalaɛl di nɛ ɛbwaalel nɛ nɛ ɔ.»<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Bɛ eezɛbɔɔza nɛ nɛ náá: «Bis ààpabela mɛkana mɛ nadus pɛ daa bot ɛ kyee dik Yude dum nɛ tɛp'ɔ ɛ. Ye tok nɛ dhiiti mɔn-nyɛɛg'es dus penek, étɛp nyɛ neezɛbaŋa bis dhiiti tɛp. Nɛghu ɛlɛɛ bis embee etɛp dum nɛ nɔ. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Tin, bis ɛpekwyɛl náá, wɔ pookolɛɛ bis wɔy wɔ ɛmet yɔ esiiza. Etɛɛ náá, bis nɛ gu náá, pɛ kɔ edi djas, bot ààkwyɛl bot ɛ di edu sama bot ɛ wɔ di edu yenek.»<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Bɛ eezɛgwakel nɛ Pɔl, étɛp bɛ neebaaboma é dhiiti dwoo. Dáa dwoo tak nakakum ɛ, bɛ eezɛzyɛ bɔɔ ɛbuɛpe, bɛ eezɛbela nyɛ pɛ nyɛ nasulal ɛ. Pɔl eezɛni nɛ ɛlii, kana mɛlem kɛkum bikoko. Nyɛ nadi elyo bɛ ɛ́ dum nɛ Ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb. Nyɛ nadi esa zii tɔ ɛlɛɛ bɛ náá, Yezu ɛ́ Mɛsia, étɛp bɛ needum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. Nyɛ nanenɔɔ etɛp e tak ɛ, tɔ mɛkana mɛ etsi ɛ Moiiz nɛ tɔ bɛmɛkana mɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Bɛdhiiti bot naamyaal etɛp ee nyɛ nadi elɛɛ bɛ ɛ. Tin, bɛdhiiti naabyen ɛmyaal yɔbɔ. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Dáa bɛ nabɛka, bɔɔ ààgwakel pak'ɔɔ ɛ, Pɔl ɛ́ booke nɛ nɔɔ náá: «Sisim na Dɛɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ gham, é ghɛŋ nyɛ nadi elii nɛ bɛbhaab bin tɔ nuub ɛ ngoolel-Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb Ezayi ɛ! <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />Nyɛ nadi eke ɛ́ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">“Tɔ́a kɛlɛɛ bot ɛ mbyak'ak náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Bi ɛpegwak ɛnyɔɛpe, tin, bi ààmɛt mɛsuk mɛ tak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Bi ɛpegwyák ɛnyɔɛpe, tin, bi ààbee.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Etɛɛ náá, bot bak nɛ kadyeebalyel elyem dhaa tyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Bɛ eezediyal mɛlɔ mɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Bɛ eezediyal mis mɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Bɛ sa deenek ɛ́, ekaab náá, mis mɔɔ ɛ́ zɛkɛbee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">mɛlɔ mɔɔ ɛ́ zɛkɛgwak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">ɛtselal ɛ lɔɔ ɛ́ zɛkɛtiibal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Bɛ aanàkwaabula pɛ daa lam étɛp mɛ neetsik bɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.27 <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Eza 6.9-10</ref></char></char></note>.”»<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Pɔl eebaazɛbil náá: «Guka náá, Zɛɛb eedhis bhaadal tsik pɛ daa bot ɛ di ààdi bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ. Bɔɔ, bɛ waagwak yɛ.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 28:28">[<verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dáa Pɔl nake deenek ɛ́, eYuda binɔk eezɛtɔ́, bɛ moo tin esuu mɛso pak'ɔɔ.</char></note>]<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Pɔl eezɛdi membu membá tin tɔ ndjaa bɛ nanɛɛg nyɛ tɔ tak ɛ. Nyɛy nadi emɔ nɛ bot djas nadi ezyɛ zɛbee nyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Nyɛ nadi elɛɛ bot náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waakɔk kɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ lɛ, nɛ ɛlyo ɛ bot dum nɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu Klisto nɛ boo ɛbwaalel, nyɛy ààluaa.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>